Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.15,0:01:50.55,*ENG,2,0,0,0,,Bloody kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:40.66,*ENG,3,0,0,0,,How fastidious you've become, Wormtail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:45.24,*ENG,4,0,0,0,,As I recall, you once called the nearest gutter pipe home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:50.61,*ENG,5,0,0,0,,Could it be that the task of nursing me has become wearisome for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.25,*ENG,6,0,0,0,,Oh, no. No, no, my Lord Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:54.68,*ENG,7,0,0,0,,I only meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:02:57.82,*ENG,8,0,0,0,,...perhaps if we were to do it without the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:00.39,*ENG,9,0,0,0,,No! The boy is everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:04.08,*ENG,10,0,0,0,,It cannot be done without him. And it will be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:06.92,*ENG,11,0,0,0,,Exactly as I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:11.03,*ENG,12,0,0,0,,- I will not disappoint you, my Lord. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:14.26,*ENG,13,0,0,0,,First, gather our old comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.44,0:03:16.67,*ENG,14,0,0,0,,Send them a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:31.88,*ENG,15,0,0,0,,Nagini tells me the old Muggle caretaker...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:35.75,*ENG,16,0,0,0,,...is standing just outside the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.93,0:03:41.23,*ENG,17,0,0,0,,Step aside, Wormtail, so I can give our guest a proper greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:43.23,*ENG,18,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:49.76,*ENG,19,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.51,0:03:52.17,*ENG,20,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:55.27,*ENG,21,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:58.07,*ENG,22,0,0,0,,Hermione. Bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:04:01.62,*ENG,23,0,0,0,,- When did you get here? - Just now. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:03.01,*ENG,24,0,0,0,,Last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.19,0:04:05.42,*ENG,25,0,0,0,,Wake up! Wake up, Ronald!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.59,0:04:06.85,*ENG,26,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:08.55,*ENG,27,0,0,0,,Honestly, get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:11.02,*ENG,28,0,0,0,,And don't go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:14.53,*ENG,29,0,0,0,,Come on, Ron! Your mother says breakfast's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:24.04,*ENG,30,0,0,0,,- Ron, where are we actually going? - Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:27.77,*ENG,31,0,0,0,,- Hey, Dad. Where are we going? - Haven't the foggiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:29.47,*ENG,32,0,0,0,,Keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:33.88,*ENG,33,0,0,0,,Arthur!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:36.04,*ENG,34,0,0,0,,It's about time, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:40.59,*ENG,35,0,0,0,,Sorry, Amos. Some of us had a bit of a sleepy start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:46.42,*ENG,36,0,0,0,,This is Amos Diggory, everyone. Works with me at the Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:49.12,*ENG,37,0,0,0,,And this strapping young lad must be Cedric, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:50.46,*ENG,38,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.63,0:04:52.30,*ENG,39,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:57.40,*ENG,40,0,0,0,,Merlin's beard! You must be Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:05:00.30,*ENG,41,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir. - Great, great pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:02.27,*ENG,42,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you too, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:07.58,*ENG,43,0,0,0,,Yes, it's just over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:11.65,*ENG,44,0,0,0,,- Shall we? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:13.02,*ENG,45,0,0,0,,We don't want to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:17.32,*ENG,46,0,0,0,,Come on. Nearly there now. Get yourself into a good position.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:20.66,*ENG,47,0,0,0,,Why are they all standing around that manky old boot?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.83,0:05:23.32,*ENG,48,0,0,0,,- That isn't just any manky old boot. - It's a Portkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:24.87,*ENG,49,0,0,0,,Time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:26.63,*ENG,50,0,0,0,,What's a Portkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:30.83,*ENG,51,0,0,0,,- Ready! After three. One, two... - Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:32.10,*ENG,52,0,0,0,,...three!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:44.28,*ENG,53,0,0,0,,Let go, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:47.05,*ENG,54,0,0,0,,- What?! - Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:01.66,*ENG,55,0,0,0,,I'll bet that cleared your sinuses, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:05.21,*ENG,56,0,0,0,,- Total shambles, as per usual. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:13.14,*ENG,57,0,0,0,,Go on, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:17.91,*ENG,58,0,0,0,,Well, kids, welcome to the Quidditch World Cup!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:23.55,*ENG,59,0,0,0,,Stay together! Keep up, girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:26.36,*ENG,60,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:29.53,*ENG,61,0,0,0,,Come on! Keep up, girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:37.84,*ENG,62,0,0,0,,Blimey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:39.87,*ENG,63,0,0,0,,Parting of the ways, I think, old chap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:41.44,*ENG,64,0,0,0,,- See you at the match. - See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.61,0:06:42.91,*ENG,65,0,0,0,,- Cedric. - Ced, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.77,*ENG,66,0,0,0,,See you later, Cedric.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:51.48,*ENG,67,0,0,0,,Home sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:54.81,*ENG,68,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:04.13,*ENG,69,0,0,0,,- Excellent, excellent. - Ginny, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:05.60,*ENG,70,0,0,0,,- All to the bath. - Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:08.26,*ENG,71,0,0,0,,Girls, choose a bunk and unpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:11.31,*ENG,72,0,0,0,,Ron, get out of the kitchen. We're all hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:13.94,*ENG,73,0,0,0,,- Yeah, get out of the kitchen, Ron! - Feet off the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.11,0:07:16.37,*ENG,74,0,0,0,,- Feet off the table! - Feet off the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:19.81,*ENG,75,0,0,0,,I love magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.07,0:07:38.56,*ENG,76,0,0,0,,Get your Quidditch World Cup programs here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:41.97,*ENG,77,0,0,0,,Blimey, Dad. How far up are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.57,*ENG,78,0,0,0,,Well, put it this way:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:45.54,*ENG,79,0,0,0,,If it rains...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:48.08,*ENG,80,0,0,0,,...you'll be the first to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.81,0:07:51.21,*ENG,81,0,0,0,,Father and I are in the minister's box...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:54.65,*ENG,82,0,0,0,,...by personal invitation of Cornelius Fudge himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:57.01,*ENG,83,0,0,0,,Don't boast, Draco.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:07:59.28,*ENG,84,0,0,0,,There's no need with these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:04.28,*ENG,85,0,0,0,,Do enjoy yourself, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.66,0:08:06.49,*ENG,86,0,0,0,,While you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:24.57,*ENG,87,0,0,0,,Come on up. Take your seats. I told you these seats would be worth waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:26.61,*ENG,88,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.85,0:08:30.82,*ENG,89,0,0,0,,It's the lrish! There's Troy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:32.82,*ENG,90,0,0,0,,- And Mullet! - And Moran!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:41.40,*ENG,91,0,0,0,,Ireland! Ireland! Ireland!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:48.83,*ENG,92,0,0,0,,- Here come the Bulgarians! - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:56.28,*ENG,93,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:09:00.07,*ENG,94,0,0,0,,That, sis, is the best Seeker in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:05.65,*ENG,95,0,0,0,,Krum! Krum! Krum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.39,0:09:11.62,*ENG,96,0,0,0,,Krum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:13.52,*ENG,97,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:23.17,*ENG,98,0,0,0,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:26.70,*ENG,99,0,0,0,,As Minister for Magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:29.97,*ENG,100,0,0,0,,...it gives me great pleasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:34.35,*ENG,101,0,0,0,,...to welcome each and every one of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:40.39,*ENG,102,0,0,0,,...to the final of the 422nd Quidditch World Cup!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:42.39,*ENG,103,0,0,0,,Let the match...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.35,*ENG,104,0,0,0,,...begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:52.66,*ENG,105,0,0,0,,Krum! Krum! Krum!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:02.17,*ENG,106,0,0,0,,There's no one like Krum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:03.94,*ENG,107,0,0,0,,- Krum? - Dumb Krum?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.11,0:10:07.17,*ENG,108,0,0,0,,He's like a bird, the way he rides the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:10.25,*ENG,109,0,0,0,,- He's more than an athlete. - Dumb Krum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:11.82,*ENG,110,0,0,0,,He's an artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:14.25,*ENG,111,0,0,0,,- I think you're in love, Ron. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:15.82,*ENG,112,0,0,0,,Viktor, I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:17.58,*ENG,113,0,0,0,,Viktor, I do
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:20.99,*ENG,114,0,0,0,,When we're apart My heart beats only for you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:23.83,*ENG,115,0,0,0,,Sounds like the lrish have got their pride on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:25.73,*ENG,116,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:27.86,*ENG,117,0,0,0,,It's not the lrish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:31.17,*ENG,118,0,0,0,,We've gotta get out of here. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:35.64,*ENG,119,0,0,0,,Get out, it's the Death Eaters!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.81,0:10:39.18,*ENG,120,0,0,0,,Get back to the Portkey, everybody, and stick together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.35,0:10:42.01,*ENG,121,0,0,0,,Fred, George! Ginny is your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.32,*ENG,122,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:46.32,*ENG,123,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:03.30,*ENG,124,0,0,0,,- Keep up, you lot! - Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.57,0:11:06.70,*ENG,125,0,0,0,,Harry! Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:55.85,*ENG,126,0,0,0,,Morsmordre!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.62,0:12:24.11,*ENG,127,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:28.82,*ENG,128,0,0,0,,- Where are you? - Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:32.69,*ENG,129,0,0,0,,We've been looking for you for ages!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.80,0:12:35.63,*ENG,130,0,0,0,,Thought we lost you, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:38.42,*ENG,131,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:43.60,*ENG,132,0,0,0,,Stupefy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:45.10,*ENG,133,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:47.51,*ENG,134,0,0,0,,That's my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:51.21,*ENG,135,0,0,0,,- Ron, Harry, Hermione, you all right? - We came back for Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:52.68,*ENG,136,0,0,0,,Which of you conjured it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:55.01,*ENG,137,0,0,0,,- Crouch, you can't possi... - Do not lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:57.18,*ENG,138,0,0,0,,You've been discovered at the scene of the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:12:59.38,*ENG,139,0,0,0,,- Crime? - Barty! They're just kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:01.05,*ENG,140,0,0,0,,What crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:03.72,*ENG,141,0,0,0,,It's the Dark Mark, Harry. It's his mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:05.05,*ENG,142,0,0,0,,What, Voldemort?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:10.10,*ENG,143,0,0,0,,Those people tonight, in the masks, they're his too, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:12.50,*ENG,144,0,0,0,,- His followers? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.57,*ENG,145,0,0,0,,Death Eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.31,0:13:19.33,*ENG,146,0,0,0,,- Follow me. - There was a man, before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.81,0:13:21.17,*ENG,147,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.34,0:13:23.64,*ENG,148,0,0,0,,All of you, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:25.81,*ENG,149,0,0,0,,A man, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.58,*ENG,150,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:29.78,*ENG,151,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.62,*ENG,152,0,0,0,,I didn't see his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.87,0:13:51.86,*ENG,153,0,0,0,,Anything from the trolley?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:57.11,*ENG,154,0,0,0,,Anything from the trolley?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.05,0:14:02.78,*ENG,155,0,0,0,,Anything from the trolley, dears?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.95,0:14:05.15,*ENG,156,0,0,0,,Packet of Drooble's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:07.12,*ENG,157,0,0,0,,...and a Licorice Wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.59,0:14:10.65,*ENG,158,0,0,0,,On second thought, just the Drooble's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:14.82,*ENG,159,0,0,0,,- It's all right, I'll get it. Don't worry. - Just the Drooble's. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:18.50,*ENG,160,0,0,0,,Two Pumpkin Pasties, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:25.50,*ENG,161,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:28.34,*ENG,162,0,0,0,,Anything sweet for you, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:31.51,*ENG,163,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I'm not hungry. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.44,*ENG,164,0,0,0,,Anything from the trolley?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:36.64,*ENG,165,0,0,0,,This is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:39.75,*ENG,166,0,0,0,,How can the Ministry not know who conjured it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:41.69,*ENG,167,0,0,0,,Wasn't there any security or...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:44.66,*ENG,168,0,0,0,,Loads, according to Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:48.79,*ENG,169,0,0,0,,That's what worried them so much. Happened right under their noses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:54.84,*ENG,170,0,0,0,,It's hurting again, isn't it? Your scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:56.67,*ENG,171,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:01.61,*ENG,172,0,0,0,,You know Sirius will want to hear about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.78,0:15:05.74,*ENG,173,0,0,0,,...what you saw at the World Cup and the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:13.74,*ENG,174,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:17.39,*ENG,175,0,0,0,,Hedwig. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:15:58.86,*ENG,176,0,0,0,,Clear the runway!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:07.04,*ENG,177,0,0,0,,Well, there's something you don't see every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.03,0:16:35.94,*ENG,178,0,0,0,,Well, now we're all settled in and sorted, I'd like to make an announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:40.34,*ENG,179,0,0,0,,This castle will not only be your home this year...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:43.67,*ENG,180,0,0,0,,...but home to some very special guests as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:46.67,*ENG,181,0,0,0,,You see, Hogwarts has been chosen...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.62,0:16:49.11,*ENG,182,0,0,0,,Yes, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:50.68,*ENG,183,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:56.36,*ENG,184,0,0,0,,Tell them to wait. Tell them to wait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:17:02.50,*ENG,185,0,0,0,,So Hogwarts has been chosen to host a legendary event:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:04.72,*ENG,186,0,0,0,,The Triwizard Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:07.33,*ENG,187,0,0,0,,- For those of you who do not know... - Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:10.67,*ENG,188,0,0,0,,...the Triwizard Tournament brings together three schools...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:12.97,*ENG,189,0,0,0,,...for a series of magical contests.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:16.67,*ENG,190,0,0,0,,From each school, a single student is selected to compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:18.54,*ENG,191,0,0,0,,Now let me be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:21.65,*ENG,192,0,0,0,,If chosen, you stand alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:23.75,*ENG,193,0,0,0,,And trust me when I say...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:26.89,*ENG,194,0,0,0,,...these contests are not for the faint-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.19,0:17:31.52,*ENG,195,0,0,0,,But more of that later. For now, please join me in welcoming...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.69,0:17:35.72,*ENG,196,0,0,0,,...the lovely ladies of the Beauxbatons Academy of Magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:39.89,*ENG,197,0,0,0,,...and their headmistress, Madame Maxime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:54.01,*ENG,198,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:04.19,*ENG,199,0,0,0,,Blimey. That's one big woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:28.27,*ENG,200,0,0,0,,And now our friends from the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:31.28,*ENG,201,0,0,0,,Please greet the proud sons of Durmstrang...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.45,0:18:34.29,*ENG,202,0,0,0,,...and their high master, lgor Karkaroff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:18:58.90,*ENG,203,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Krum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:00.55,*ENG,204,0,0,0,,Blimey, it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:02.58,*ENG,205,0,0,0,,Viktor Krum!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:12.93,*ENG,206,0,0,0,,Albus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.10,0:19:14.82,*ENG,207,0,0,0,,Igor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:32.11,*ENG,208,0,0,0,,Professor Dumbly-dorr, my horses have traveled a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:34.81,*ENG,209,0,0,0,,- They will need attending to. - Don't worry, Madame Maxime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:38.51,*ENG,210,0,0,0,,Our gamekeeper, Hagrid, is more than capable of seeing to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:40.95,*ENG,211,0,0,0,,But you know, Monsieur Hagrid...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:43.82,*ENG,212,0,0,0,,...they drink only single-malt whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:51.73,*ENG,213,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.74,0:19:58.73,*ENG,214,0,0,0,,Your attention, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:03.24,*ENG,215,0,0,0,,I'd like to say a few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.98,0:20:07.04,*ENG,216,0,0,0,,Eternal glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.48,0:20:11.51,*ENG,217,0,0,0,,That is what awaits the student who wins the Triwizard Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.69,0:20:15.89,*ENG,218,0,0,0,,But to do this, that student must survive three tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:20.02,*ENG,219,0,0,0,,Three extremely dangerous tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:21.45,*ENG,220,0,0,0,,- Wicked. - Wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:25.86,*ENG,221,0,0,0,,For this reason, the Ministry has seen fit to impose a new rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:27.40,*ENG,222,0,0,0,,To explain all this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.57,0:20:31.20,*ENG,223,0,0,0,,...we have the head of the Department of lnternational Magical Cooperation...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:33.54,*ENG,224,0,0,0,,...Mr. Bartemius Crouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:50.69,*ENG,225,0,0,0,,Bloody hell. It's Mad-Eye Moody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:54.66,*ENG,226,0,0,0,,- Alastor Moody? The Auror? - Auror?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:58.29,*ENG,227,0,0,0,,Dark-wizard catcher. Half the cells in Azkaban are filled thanks to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:02.10,*ENG,228,0,0,0,,He's supposed to be mad as a hatter, though, these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:17.65,*ENG,229,0,0,0,,- My dear old friend, thanks for coming. - Stupid ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:18.91,*ENG,230,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:27.29,*ENG,231,0,0,0,,What's that he's drinking, do you suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:30.72,*ENG,232,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I don't think it's pumpkin juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.71,0:21:39.64,*ENG,233,0,0,0,,After due consideration...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.81,0:21:42.71,*ENG,234,0,0,0,,...the Ministry has concluded that, for their own safety...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:45.85,*ENG,235,0,0,0,,...no student under the age of 17...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:49.75,*ENG,236,0,0,0,,...shall be allowed to put forth their name for the Triwizard Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:52.62,*ENG,237,0,0,0,,- This decision is final. - That's rubbish!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.38,*ENG,238,0,0,0,,That's rubbish! You don't know what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:59.29,*ENG,239,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.68,0:22:21.12,*ENG,240,0,0,0,,The Goblet of Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.68,0:22:24.59,*ENG,241,0,0,0,,Anyone wishing to submit themselves to the tournament...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.75,0:22:27.65,*ENG,242,0,0,0,,...need only write their name upon a piece of parchment...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.82,0:22:30.92,*ENG,243,0,0,0,,...and throw it in the flame before this hour on Thursday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.03,0:22:34.26,*ENG,244,0,0,0,,Do not do so lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.63,0:22:38.19,*ENG,245,0,0,0,,If chosen, there's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.37,0:22:43.33,*ENG,246,0,0,0,,As from this moment, the Triwizard Tournament has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.50,0:23:11.56,*ENG,247,0,0,0,,Alastor Moody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:15.13,*ENG,248,0,0,0,,Ex-Auror...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.84,0:23:19.27,*ENG,249,0,0,0,,...Ministry malcontent...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.48,0:23:21.88,*ENG,250,0,0,0,,...and your new Defense Against the Dark Arts teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:26.50,*ENG,251,0,0,0,,I am here because Dumbledore asked me. End of story, goodbye, the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:28.45,*ENG,252,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.62,0:23:33.35,*ENG,253,0,0,0,,When it comes to the Dark Arts...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.72,0:23:37.39,*ENG,254,0,0,0,,...I believe in a practical approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:43.26,*ENG,255,0,0,0,,But first, which of you can tell me how many Unforgivable Curses there are?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.80,0:23:46.13,*ENG,256,0,0,0,,- Three, sir. - And they are so named?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.30,0:23:49.53,*ENG,257,0,0,0,,Because they are unforgivable. The use of any one of them will...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.71,0:23:53.84,*ENG,258,0,0,0,,Will earn you a one-way ticket to Azkaban, correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.01,0:23:56.74,*ENG,259,0,0,0,,The Ministry says you're too young to see what these curses do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.91,0:24:00.37,*ENG,260,0,0,0,,I say different! You need to know what you're up against!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.55,0:24:02.71,*ENG,261,0,0,0,,You need to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.89,0:24:05.35,*ENG,262,0,0,0,,You need to find another place to put your chewing gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.52,0:24:07.82,*ENG,263,0,0,0,,...besides the underside of your desk, Mr. Finnigan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.99,0:24:10.98,*ENG,264,0,0,0,,No way. The old codger can see out the back of his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.69,0:24:13.46,*ENG,265,0,0,0,,And hear across classrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.80,0:24:19.29,*ENG,266,0,0,0,,So which curse shall we see first?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.47,0:24:20.70,*ENG,267,0,0,0,,- Weasley! - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.87,0:24:22.20,*ENG,268,0,0,0,,Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.37,0:24:27.14,*ENG,269,0,0,0,,Give us a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.31,0:24:31.18,*ENG,270,0,0,0,,Well, my dad did tell me about one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.75,0:24:33.01,*ENG,271,0,0,0,,The lmperius Curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.18,0:24:36.48,*ENG,272,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, your father would know all about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.89,0:24:39.55,*ENG,273,0,0,0,,Gave the Ministry quite a bit of grief a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.02,0:24:42.51,*ENG,274,0,0,0,,Perhaps this will show you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.13,0:24:51.46,*ENG,275,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.10,0:24:54.80,*ENG,276,0,0,0,,Lovely little beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.94,0:24:59.93,*ENG,277,0,0,0,,Engorgio.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.31,0:25:01.97,*ENG,278,0,0,0,,Imperio!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.38,0:25:08.82,*ENG,279,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's completely harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.99,0:25:16.65,*ENG,280,0,0,0,,If she bites...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.19,0:25:18.68,*ENG,281,0,0,0,,...she's lethal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.23,0:25:23.03,*ENG,282,0,0,0,,What are you laughing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.37,0:25:25.80,*ENG,283,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.24,0:25:30.00,*ENG,284,0,0,0,,Talented, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.17,0:25:33.57,*ENG,285,0,0,0,,What should I have her do next? Jump out the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.54,0:25:36.94,*ENG,286,0,0,0,,Drown herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:51.99,*ENG,287,0,0,0,,Scores of witches and wizards have claimed...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:56.15,*ENG,288,0,0,0,,...that they only did You-Know-Who's bidding...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.33,0:25:58.56,*ENG,289,0,0,0,,...under the influence of the lmperius Curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.73,0:26:00.67,*ENG,290,0,0,0,,But here's the rub:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.00,0:26:04.00,*ENG,291,0,0,0,,How do we sort out the liars?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.34,0:26:08.04,*ENG,292,0,0,0,,Another, another.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.04,0:26:10.57,*ENG,293,0,0,0,,Up, up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.75,0:26:12.30,*ENG,294,0,0,0,,Longbottom, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.98,0:26:14.47,*ENG,295,0,0,0,,Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.52,0:26:20.39,*ENG,296,0,0,0,,Professor Sprout tells me you have an aptitude for herbology.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.29,0:26:23.92,*ENG,297,0,0,0,,There's the...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.16,0:26:26.09,*ENG,298,0,0,0,,The Cruciatus Curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.26,0:26:29.13,*ENG,299,0,0,0,,Correct, correct. Come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.33,0:26:30.96,*ENG,300,0,0,0,,Particularly nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.00,0:26:35.83,*ENG,301,0,0,0,,The torture curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.84,0:26:39.00,*ENG,302,0,0,0,,Crucio!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.72,0:26:55.52,*ENG,303,0,0,0,,Stop it! Can't you see it's bothering him? Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:17.14,*ENG,304,0,0,0,,Perhaps you could give us the last Unforgivable Curse, Miss Granger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.58,0:27:20.91,*ENG,305,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.12,0:27:24.24,*ENG,306,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:29.55,*ENG,307,0,0,0,,The Killing Curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.69,0:27:33.82,*ENG,308,0,0,0,,Only one person is known to have survived it...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.40,0:27:36.76,*ENG,309,0,0,0,,...and he's sitting in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.36,0:28:10.13,*ENG,310,0,0,0,,Brilliant, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.30,0:28:14.33,*ENG,311,0,0,0,,Completely demented, of course, and terrifying to be in the same room with...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.50,0:28:17.67,*ENG,312,0,0,0,,...but he's really been there, you know? He's looked evil in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.84,0:28:20.43,*ENG,313,0,0,0,,There's a reason those curses are unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.61,0:28:24.71,*ENG,314,0,0,0,,To perform them in a classroom... I mean, did you see Neville's face?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.65,0:28:29.12,*ENG,315,0,0,0,,Neville?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.28,0:28:30.72,*ENG,316,0,0,0,,Son?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.09,0:28:32.71,*ENG,317,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.69,0:28:37.06,*ENG,318,0,0,0,,Come on. We'll have a cup of tea. I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.61,0:28:53.60,*ENG,319,0,0,0,,We're gonna be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.19,0:29:09.52,*ENG,320,0,0,0,,Come on, Cedric. Put it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.14,0:29:27.63,*ENG,321,0,0,0,,Eternal glory. Be brilliant, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.81,0:29:30.44,*ENG,322,0,0,0,,Three years from now, when we're old enough to be chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.61,0:29:32.24,*ENG,323,0,0,0,,Yeah, rather you than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.41,0:29:34.35,*ENG,324,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.55,0:29:38.45,*ENG,325,0,0,0,,Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.62,0:29:41.68,*ENG,326,0,0,0,,- Well, lads, we've done it. - Cooked it up just this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.86,0:29:44.02,*ENG,327,0,0,0,,It's not going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.23,0:29:47.72,*ENG,328,0,0,0,,- Oh, yeah? - And why is that, Granger?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.90,0:29:50.87,*ENG,329,0,0,0,,You see this? This is an Age Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.03,0:29:52.83,*ENG,330,0,0,0,,Dumbledore drew it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:54.43,*ENG,331,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:59.63,*ENG,332,0,0,0,,So a genius like Dumbledore couldn't possibly be fooled...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.81,0:30:02.80,*ENG,333,0,0,0,,...by a dodge as pathetically dimwitted as an Aging Potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.98,0:30:07.24,*ENG,334,0,0,0,,- But that's why it's so brilliant. - Because it's so pathetically dimwitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.98,0:30:10.98,*ENG,335,0,0,0,,- Ready, Fred? - Ready, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.15,0:30:12.98,*ENG,336,0,0,0,,- Bottoms up. - Bottoms up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.43,0:30:18.33,*ENG,337,0,0,0,,- Yes! - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.19,0:30:20.66,*ENG,338,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.83,0:30:23.46,*ENG,339,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.90,0:30:25.39,*ENG,340,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.70,0:30:30.83,*ENG,341,0,0,0,,- Yes! - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.38,0:30:41.35,*ENG,342,0,0,0,,- You said! - You said!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.32,0:30:45.75,*ENG,343,0,0,0,,- Oh, right, you want a piece of me?! - I'll tear your ears off!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.92,0:30:48.41,*ENG,344,0,0,0,,- Now you're making me laugh. - Take this! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.59,0:30:50.02,*ENG,345,0,0,0,,Fight! Fight! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.13,0:30:56.86,*ENG,346,0,0,0,,We're "old school", right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.03,0:30:59.43,*ENG,347,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you look older!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.80,0:31:33.46,*ENG,348,0,0,0,,Sit down. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.87,0:31:39.74,*ENG,349,0,0,0,,Now the moment you've all been waiting for:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.91,0:31:42.04,*ENG,350,0,0,0,,The champion selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.48,0:32:17.28,*ENG,351,0,0,0,,The Durmstrang champion is Viktor Krum.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.23,0:32:35.63,*ENG,352,0,0,0,,The champion for Beauxbatons...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.80,0:32:37.82,*ENG,353,0,0,0,,...is Fleur Delacour.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.38,0:32:51.37,*ENG,354,0,0,0,,The Hogwarts champion, Cedric Diggory!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.42,0:33:05.83,*ENG,355,0,0,0,,Excellent! We now have our three champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.99,0:33:10.19,*ENG,356,0,0,0,,But in the end, only one will go down in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.37,0:33:13.70,*ENG,357,0,0,0,,Only one will hoist this chalice of champions...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.00,0:33:17.03,*ENG,358,0,0,0,,...this vessel of victory...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.21,0:33:19.40,*ENG,359,0,0,0,,...the Triwizard Cup!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.17,0:33:51.83,*ENG,360,0,0,0,,Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.94,0:33:55.57,*ENG,361,0,0,0,,Harry Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.95,0:34:02.14,*ENG,362,0,0,0,,No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.65,0:34:03.95,*ENG,363,0,0,0,,Harry Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.39,0:34:05.88,*ENG,364,0,0,0,,Go on, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.05,0:34:07.82,*ENG,365,0,0,0,,Harry, for goodness sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.32,0:34:40.52,*ENG,366,0,0,0,,He's a cheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.06,0:34:43.62,*ENG,367,0,0,0,,He's not even 17 yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.49,0:35:14.98,*ENG,368,0,0,0,,- It's wrong, I tell you! - You French tart.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.16,0:35:18.13,*ENG,369,0,0,0,,- Everything is a conspiracy theory with you! - Quiet! I can't think!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.29,0:35:20.28,*ENG,370,0,0,0,,- Everything is a conspiracy theory! - I protest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.46,0:35:21.66,*ENG,371,0,0,0,,- Harry. - I protest!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.83,0:35:23.70,*ENG,372,0,0,0,,Did you put your name in the Goblet of Fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.87,0:35:26.03,*ENG,373,0,0,0,,- No, sir. - Did you ask one of the older students...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.20,0:35:27.53,*ENG,374,0,0,0,,- ...to do it for you? - No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.70,0:35:30.60,*ENG,375,0,0,0,,- You're absolutely sure? - Yes. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.04,0:35:33.27,*ENG,376,0,0,0,,- But of course he is lying. - The hell he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.48,0:35:35.84,*ENG,377,0,0,0,,The Goblet of Fire is an exceptionally powerful magical object.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.01,0:35:39.14,*ENG,378,0,0,0,,Only an exceptionally powerful Confundus Charm could have hoodwinked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.31,0:35:41.31,*ENG,379,0,0,0,,Magic way beyond the talents of a fourth year.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.48,0:35:44.48,*ENG,380,0,0,0,,You seem to have given this a fair bit of thought, Mad-Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.65,0:35:47.82,*ENG,381,0,0,0,,It was once my job to think as dark wizards do, Karkaroff...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.99,0:35:51.08,*ENG,382,0,0,0,,- ...perhaps you remember. - This doesn't help, Alastor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.86,0:35:55.16,*ENG,383,0,0,0,,Leave this to you, Barty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.53,0:35:58.73,*ENG,384,0,0,0,,The rules are absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.94,0:36:03.67,*ENG,385,0,0,0,,The Goblet of Fire constitutes a binding magical contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.21,0:36:07.40,*ENG,386,0,0,0,,Mr. Potter has no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.21,0:36:10.54,*ENG,387,0,0,0,,He is, as of tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.35,0:36:14.37,*ENG,388,0,0,0,,...a Triwizard champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.31,0:36:44.44,*ENG,389,0,0,0,,This can't go on, Albus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.78,0:36:47.61,*ENG,390,0,0,0,,First the Dark Mark. Now this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.78,0:36:49.77,*ENG,391,0,0,0,,What do you suggest, Minerva?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.95,0:36:53.01,*ENG,392,0,0,0,,Put an end to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.49,0:36:55.48,*ENG,393,0,0,0,,Don't let Potter compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.66,0:36:58.13,*ENG,394,0,0,0,,You heard Barty. The rules are clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.29,0:37:01.13,*ENG,395,0,0,0,,Well, the devil with Barty and his rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.30,0:37:03.73,*ENG,396,0,0,0,,And since when did you accommodate the Ministry?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.90,0:37:07.89,*ENG,397,0,0,0,,Headmaster, l, too, find it difficult to believe this mere coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.07,0:37:12.01,*ENG,398,0,0,0,,However, if we are to truly discover the meaning of these events...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.17,0:37:15.77,*ENG,399,0,0,0,,...perhaps we should, for the time being...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.68,0:37:18.94,*ENG,400,0,0,0,,...Iet them unfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.11,0:37:21.28,*ENG,401,0,0,0,,What? Do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.45,0:37:23.08,*ENG,402,0,0,0,,Offer him up as bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.09,0:37:26.92,*ENG,403,0,0,0,,Potter is a boy, not a piece of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.82,0:37:30.55,*ENG,404,0,0,0,,I agree. With Severus.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.13,0:37:33.96,*ENG,405,0,0,0,,Alastor, keep an eye on Harry, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.23,0:37:36.70,*ENG,406,0,0,0,,- I can do that. - Don't let him know, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.97,0:37:40.06,*ENG,407,0,0,0,,He must be anxious enough as it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.60,0:37:43.26,*ENG,408,0,0,0,,...knowing what lies ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.64,0:37:46.20,*ENG,409,0,0,0,,Then again, we all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.09,0:38:02.89,*ENG,410,0,0,0,,How did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.36,0:38:08.99,*ENG,411,0,0,0,,Never mind. Doesn't matter. Might've let your best friend know, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.16,0:38:12.46,*ENG,412,0,0,0,,- Let you know what? - You know bloody well what.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.63,0:38:15.03,*ENG,413,0,0,0,,I didn't ask for this to happen, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.50,0:38:17.10,*ENG,414,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.27,0:38:19.76,*ENG,415,0,0,0,,- You're being stupid. - Yeah, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.94,0:38:23.47,*ENG,416,0,0,0,,Ron Weasley, Harry Potter's stupid friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.18,0:38:29.15,*ENG,417,0,0,0,,I didn't put my name in that cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.58,0:38:33.42,*ENG,418,0,0,0,,I don't want eternal glory. I just wanna be...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.19,0:38:39.65,*ENG,419,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know what happened tonight, and I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.83,0:38:41.06,*ENG,420,0,0,0,,It just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.93,0:38:43.49,*ENG,421,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.31,0:38:54.07,*ENG,422,0,0,0,,Piss off.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.09,0:39:11.56,*ENG,423,0,0,0,,What a charismatic quartet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.89,0:39:14.49,*ENG,424,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.36,0:39:17.92,*ENG,425,0,0,0,,I'm Rita Skeeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.50,0:39:20.99,*ENG,426,0,0,0,,I write for the Daily Prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:26.30,*ENG,427,0,0,0,,But of course you know that, don't you? It's you we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.84,0:39:28.67,*ENG,428,0,0,0,,You're the juicy news.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.84,0:39:33.04,*ENG,429,0,0,0,,What quirks lurk beneath those rosy cheeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.25,0:39:36.71,*ENG,430,0,0,0,,What mysteries do the muscles mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.89,0:39:40.12,*ENG,431,0,0,0,,Does courage lie beneath those curls?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.29,0:39:43.31,*ENG,432,0,0,0,,In short, what makes a champion tick?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.83,0:39:48.13,*ENG,433,0,0,0,," Me, Myself & l" want to know. Not to mention my rabid readers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.30,0:39:50.79,*ENG,434,0,0,0,,So who's feeling up to sharing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.10,0:39:56.70,*ENG,435,0,0,0,,Shall we start with the youngest? Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.98,0:40:10.78,*ENG,436,0,0,0,,This is cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.35,0:40:13.05,*ENG,437,0,0,0,,It's a broom cupboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.42,0:40:15.72,*ENG,438,0,0,0,,You should feel right at home, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.92,0:40:18.69,*ENG,439,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I use a Quick-Quotes Quill, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.86,0:40:20.42,*ENG,440,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.80,0:40:22.79,*ENG,441,0,0,0,,So tell me, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.96,0:40:25.87,*ENG,442,0,0,0,,Here you sit, a mere boy of 12...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.03,0:40:27.52,*ENG,443,0,0,0,,I'm 14. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.70,0:40:30.67,*ENG,444,0,0,0,,...about to compete against three students...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.84,0:40:34.10,*ENG,445,0,0,0,,...not only vastly more emotionally mature than yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.28,0:40:36.87,*ENG,446,0,0,0,,...but who have mastered spells that you wouldn't attempt...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.05,0:40:39.38,*ENG,447,0,0,0,,...in your dizziest daydreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.88,0:40:41.91,*ENG,448,0,0,0,,Concerned?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.08,0:40:45.92,*ENG,449,0,0,0,,I don't know. I haven't really thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.09,0:40:47.95,*ENG,450,0,0,0,,Just ignore the quill.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.42,0:40:50.95,*ENG,451,0,0,0,,Then, of course, you're no ordinary boy of 12, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.13,0:40:53.72,*ENG,452,0,0,0,,- Fourteen. - Your story's legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.50,0:40:56.66,*ENG,453,0,0,0,,Do you think it was the trauma of your past...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.83,0:41:00.06,*ENG,454,0,0,0,,...that made you so keen to enter such a dangerous tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.24,0:41:02.00,*ENG,455,0,0,0,,No, I didn't enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.17,0:41:03.76,*ENG,456,0,0,0,,Of course you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.04,0:41:07.67,*ENG,457,0,0,0,,Everyone loves a rebel, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.98,0:41:11.50,*ENG,458,0,0,0,,Scratch that last.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.28,0:41:16.44,*ENG,459,0,0,0,,Speaking of your parents, were they alive, how do you think they'd feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.62,0:41:18.42,*ENG,460,0,0,0,,Proud? Or concerned...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.59,0:41:22.42,*ENG,461,0,0,0,,...that your attitude shows, at best, a pathological need for attention...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.59,0:41:25.18,*ENG,462,0,0,0,,...at worst, a psychotic death wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.19,0:41:31.26,*ENG,463,0,0,0,,Hey, my eyes aren't "glistening with the ghosts of my past."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.56,0:42:05.90,*ENG,464,0,0,0,,Harry, I couldn 't risk sending Hedwig.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.07,0:42:09.33,*ENG,465,0,0,0,,Since the World Cup, the Ministry's been intercepting more and more owls...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.50,0:42:11.73,*ENG,466,0,0,0,,...and she 's too easily recognized.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.91,0:42:14.77,*ENG,467,0,0,0,,We need to talk, Harry, face-to-face.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.94,0:42:19.11,*ENG,468,0,0,0,,Meet me in the Gryffindor common room, 1:00 this Saturday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.28,0:42:21.04,*ENG,469,0,0,0,,And make sure you 're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.22,0:42:22.71,*ENG,470,0,0,0,,Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.88,0:42:24.37,*ENG,471,0,0,0,,P.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.55,0:42:26.35,*ENG,472,0,0,0,,The bird bites.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.70,0:42:38.13,*ENG,473,0,0,0,,Sirius?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.02,0:42:56.92,*ENG,474,0,0,0,,Harry Potter, age 12...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.09,0:43:00.05,*ENG,475,0,0,0,,...suspect entrant in the Triwizard Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.22,0:43:02.82,*ENG,476,0,0,0,,His eyes swimming with the ghosts of his past...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.99,0:43:04.55,*ENG,477,0,0,0,,...and choking back tears...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.04,0:43:22.64,*ENG,478,0,0,0,,Sirius. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.81,0:43:25.30,*ENG,479,0,0,0,,I don ' t have much time, so let me get straight to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.48,0:43:28.42,*ENG,480,0,0,0,,Did you or did you not put your name into the Goblet of Fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.58,0:43:30.05,*ENG,481,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.65,0:43:31.91,*ENG,482,0,0,0,,I had to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.09,0:43:36.89,*ENG,483,0,0,0,,Now, tell me about this dream of yours. You mentioned Wormtail and Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.06,0:43:39.49,*ENG,484,0,0,0,,But who was the third man in the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.66,0:43:42.15,*ENG,485,0,0,0,,- I don't know. - You didn't hear a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.00,0:43:44.52,*ENG,486,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.43,0:43:49.16,*ENG,487,0,0,0,,Voldemort was giving him a job to do. Something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.34,0:43:50.63,*ENG,488,0,0,0,,And what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.81,0:43:54.43,*ENG,489,0,0,0,,He wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.61,0:43:56.27,*ENG,490,0,0,0,,...me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.84,0:44:01.18,*ENG,491,0,0,0,,I don't know why. But he was gonna use this man to get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.45,0:44:04.61,*ENG,492,0,0,0,,But, I mean, it was only a dream, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.99,0:44:06.61,*ENG,493,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.79,0:44:08.35,*ENG,494,0,0,0,,It's just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.09,0:44:10.52,*ENG,495,0,0,0,,Look, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.69,0:44:14.15,*ENG,496,0,0,0,,The Death Eaters at the World Cup, your name rising from that goblet...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.33,0:44:18.32,*ENG,497,0,0,0,,...these are not just coincidences. Hogwarts isn't safe anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.50,0:44:19.59,*ENG,498,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.77,0:44:24.03,*ENG,499,0,0,0,,I'm saying the devils are inside the walls. Igor Karkaroff?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.21,0:44:28.61,*ENG,500,0,0,0,,He was a Death Eater. And no one, no one stops being a Death Eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.04,0:44:34.17,*ENG,501,0,0,0,,Then there's Barty Crouch. Heart of stone. Sent his own son to Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.99,0:44:41.08,*ENG,502,0,0,0,,You think one of them put my name in the goblet?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.26,0:44:43.55,*ENG,503,0,0,0,,I haven't a clue who put your name in that goblet...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.72,0:44:47.68,*ENG,504,0,0,0,,...but whoever did is no friend to you. People die in this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.86,0:44:51.35,*ENG,505,0,0,0,,- I'm not ready for this, Sirius. - You don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.90,0:44:57.30,*ENG,506,0,0,0,,- Someone's coming. - Keep your friends close, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.61,0:45:01.94,*ENG,507,0,0,0,,Who were you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.11,0:45:05.17,*ENG,508,0,0,0,,- What? Who says I was talking to anyone? - I heard voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.45,0:45:09.44,*ENG,509,0,0,0,,Maybe you're imagining things. Wouldn't be the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.98,0:45:13.32,*ENG,510,0,0,0,,You're probably just practicing for your next interview, I expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.55,0:45:30.37,*ENG,511,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.25,0:45:40.87,*ENG,512,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.85,0:45:46.55,*ENG,513,0,0,0,,- Amazing! - Neville. You're doing it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.12,0:45:48.52,*ENG,514,0,0,0,,Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.39,0:45:52.38,*ENG,515,0,0,0,,"Magical Water Plants of the Highland Lochs"?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.56,0:45:55.72,*ENG,516,0,0,0,,Moody gave it to me. That day we had tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.23,0:45:58.96,*ENG,517,0,0,0,,It's already been through enough people.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.13,0:46:01.23,*ENG,518,0,0,0,,Why don't you just go and talk to him yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.70,0:46:05.04,*ENG,519,0,0,0,,Ron, this is your problem, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.21,0:46:07.30,*ENG,520,0,0,0,,What do you want me to say again?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.48,0:46:08.81,*ENG,521,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.75,0:46:15.91,*ENG,522,0,0,0,,Ronald would like me to tell you that Seamus told him...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.48,0:46:20.08,*ENG,523,0,0,0,,...that Dean was told by Parvati that Hagrid's looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.25,0:46:22.69,*ENG,524,0,0,0,,Is that right? Well, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.86,0:46:23.92,*ENG,525,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.03,0:46:31.97,*ENG,526,0,0,0,,- Are you sure you won't do this? - Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.77,0:46:37.74,*ENG,527,0,0,0,,Dean was told by Parvati that...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.97,0:46:41.20,*ENG,528,0,0,0,,Please don't ask me to say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.58,0:46:43.04,*ENG,529,0,0,0,,Hagrid's looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.54,0:46:46.60,*ENG,530,0,0,0,,- Well, you can tell Ronald... - I'm not an owl!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.16,0:46:59.42,*ENG,531,0,0,0,,Did you bring your father's cloak, like I asked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.59,0:47:02.19,*ENG,532,0,0,0,,Yeah, I brought the cloak. Hagrid, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.36,0:47:03.76,*ENG,533,0,0,0,,You'll see soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.93,0:47:06.13,*ENG,534,0,0,0,,Now pay attention, this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.87,0:47:09.34,*ENG,535,0,0,0,,What's with the flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.37,0:47:12.77,*ENG,536,0,0,0,,Hagrid, have you combed your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.17,0:47:14.90,*ENG,537,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.34,0:47:18.28,*ENG,538,0,0,0,,You might like to try the same thing now and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.79,0:47:28.25,*ENG,539,0,0,0,,Hagrid?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.16,0:47:34.06,*ENG,540,0,0,0,,The cloak! Put the cloak on!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.60,0:47:44.00,*ENG,541,0,0,0,,- Bonsoir, Olympe. - Oh, Hagrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.17,0:47:47.90,*ENG,542,0,0,0,,I thought perhaps you weren't coming. I thought perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.08,0:47:50.74,*ENG,543,0,0,0,,...you had forgotten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.91,0:47:52.88,*ENG,544,0,0,0,,Couldn't forget you, Olympe.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.51,0:47:55.35,*ENG,545,0,0,0,,What is it you wanted to show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.02,0:48:00.25,*ENG,546,0,0,0,,When we spoke earlier, you sounded so...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.59,0:48:02.08,*ENG,547,0,0,0,,...exhilarated.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.66,0:48:05.49,*ENG,548,0,0,0,,You'll be glad you came. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.07,0:48:17.83,*ENG,549,0,0,0,,Can we get closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.65,0:48:27.11,*ENG,550,0,0,0,,Dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.28,0:48:28.77,*ENG,551,0,0,0,,That's the first task?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.18,0:48:31.21,*ENG,552,0,0,0,,- You're joking. - Come on, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.49,0:48:35.51,*ENG,553,0,0,0,,These are seriously misunderstood creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.62,0:48:38.09,*ENG,554,0,0,0,,Oh, crikey!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.59,0:48:43.59,*ENG,555,0,0,0,,Although, I have to admit, that Horntail is a right nasty piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.90,0:48:46.73,*ENG,556,0,0,0,,Poor Ron nearly fainted just seeing him, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.24,0:48:50.26,*ENG,557,0,0,0,,- Ron was here? - Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.44,0:48:53.97,*ENG,558,0,0,0,,His brother Charlie helped to bring him over from Romania.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.14,0:48:55.57,*ENG,559,0,0,0,,Didn't Ron tell you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.51,0:48:58.91,*ENG,560,0,0,0,,No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.65,0:49:01.51,*ENG,561,0,0,0,,He didn't tell me a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.46,0:49:14.55,*ENG,562,0,0,0,,- You cheat, Potter. - You stink, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.06,0:49:18.73,*ENG,563,0,0,0,,- Good luck, Potter. - Potter stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.90,0:49:21.56,*ENG,564,0,0,0,,- Cedric rules. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.64,0:49:24.30,*ENG,565,0,0,0,,Like the badge?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.87,0:49:26.60,*ENG,566,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.78,0:49:32.25,*ENG,567,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.81,0:49:34.78,*ENG,568,0,0,0,,Hey! Read the badge, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.95,0:49:36.44,*ENG,569,0,0,0,,Can I have a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.42,0:49:39.28,*ENG,570,0,0,0,,- All right. - You stink, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.45,0:49:42.45,*ENG,571,0,0,0,,- Potter, you stink! - Harry Potter smells!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.96,0:49:47.52,*ENG,572,0,0,0,,Dragons. That's the first task.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.70,0:49:50.82,*ENG,573,0,0,0,,- They've got one for each of us. - Come on, Ced!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.00,0:49:53.02,*ENG,574,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.80,0:49:56.83,*ENG,575,0,0,0,,And Fleur and Krum, do they...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.00,0:49:59.27,*ENG,576,0,0,0,,- Yes. - Come on, Ced, leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.44,0:50:00.91,*ENG,577,0,0,0,,- Right. - He's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.08,0:50:03.57,*ENG,578,0,0,0,,- Read the badges, Potter! - Hey, listen. About the badges.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.74,0:50:06.77,*ENG,579,0,0,0,,- I've asked them not to wear them, but... - Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.95,0:50:09.38,*ENG,580,0,0,0,,It's not like I try to blow things up, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.08,0:50:11.55,*ENG,581,0,0,0,,It just happens a fair bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.72,0:50:14.78,*ENG,582,0,0,0,,You have to admit, though, fire's pretty fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.96,0:50:16.79,*ENG,583,0,0,0,,You're a right foul git, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.96,0:50:19.22,*ENG,584,0,0,0,,- You think so? - I know so.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.39,0:50:20.72,*ENG,585,0,0,0,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.90,0:50:24.39,*ENG,586,0,0,0,,- Yeah. Stay away from me. - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.77,0:50:30.36,*ENG,587,0,0,0,,- There's Potter. Cheat. - Why so tense, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.14,0:50:33.54,*ENG,588,0,0,0,,My father and I have a bet, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.71,0:50:36.90,*ENG,589,0,0,0,,I don't think you're gonna last 10 minutes in this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.48,0:50:42.42,*ENG,590,0,0,0,,He disagrees. He thinks you won't last five.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.58,0:50:45.71,*ENG,591,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn what your father thinks, Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.69,0:50:50.68,*ENG,592,0,0,0,,He's vile and cruel. And you're just pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.59,0:50:54.19,*ENG,593,0,0,0,,- Pathetic? - Oh, no, you don't, sonny!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.36,0:50:59.26,*ENG,594,0,0,0,,I'll teach you to curse someone when their back is turned!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.43,0:51:03.27,*ENG,595,0,0,0,,You stinking, cowardly, scummy...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.44,0:51:05.17,*ENG,596,0,0,0,,- Professor Moody! - ...back-shooting...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.34,0:51:08.24,*ENG,597,0,0,0,,- What are you doing? - Teaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.28,0:51:13.41,*ENG,598,0,0,0,,- ls that a... Is that a student? - Technically, it's a ferret.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.05,0:51:20.99,*ENG,599,0,0,0,,Stand still! Stand still!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.97,0:51:34.16,*ENG,600,0,0,0,,- My father will hear about this! - ls that a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.34,0:51:36.27,*ENG,601,0,0,0,,- Professor Moody! - ls that a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.44,0:51:38.30,*ENG,602,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.47,0:51:42.03,*ENG,603,0,0,0,,I could tell you stories about your father that would curl even your greasy hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.21,0:51:44.91,*ENG,604,0,0,0,,- Alastor! Alastor. - lt doesn't end here!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.08,0:51:48.88,*ENG,605,0,0,0,,We never use transfiguration as a punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.05,0:51:51.24,*ENG,606,0,0,0,,Surely Dumbledore told you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.79,0:51:56.25,*ENG,607,0,0,0,,- He might've mentioned it. - Well, you will do well to remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.36,0:51:58.83,*ENG,608,0,0,0,,Away!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.93,0:52:04.12,*ENG,609,0,0,0,,You. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.37,0:52:41.43,*ENG,610,0,0,0,,That's a Foe-Glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.17,0:52:44.33,*ENG,611,0,0,0,,Lets me keep an eye on my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.74,0:52:49.14,*ENG,612,0,0,0,,If I can see the whites of their eyes, they're standing right behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.31,0:52:55.78,*ENG,613,0,0,0,,Wouldn't even bother telling you what's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.95,0:52:57.98,*ENG,614,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe it if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.25,0:52:59.95,*ENG,615,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.62,0:53:04.46,*ENG,616,0,0,0,,...what are you going to do about your dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.36,0:53:10.66,*ENG,617,0,0,0,,Well, you know, I just thought l'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.13,0:53:13.62,*ENG,618,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.34,0:53:18.74,*ENG,619,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.74,0:53:20.90,*ENG,620,0,0,0,,Your pal Diggory?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.08,0:53:25.54,*ENG,621,0,0,0,,By your age, he could turn a whistle into a watch and have it sing you the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.68,0:53:27.94,*ENG,622,0,0,0,,Miss Delacour?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.35,0:53:31.08,*ENG,623,0,0,0,,She's as much a fairy princess as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.59,0:53:35.15,*ENG,624,0,0,0,,As for Krum, his head may be filled with sawdust...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.32,0:53:37.48,*ENG,625,0,0,0,,...but Karkaroff's is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.66,0:53:39.49,*ENG,626,0,0,0,,They'll have a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.66,0:53:43.19,*ENG,627,0,0,0,,And you can bet that it will play to Krum's strengths.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.97,0:53:49.53,*ENG,628,0,0,0,,Come on, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.70,0:53:51.80,*ENG,629,0,0,0,,What are your strengths?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.37,0:53:54.74,*ENG,630,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.91,0:53:57.71,*ENG,631,0,0,0,,Well, I can fly. I mean, I'm a fair flyer. But l...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.88,0:54:01.91,*ENG,632,0,0,0,,- Better than fair, the way I heard it. - But I'm not allowed a broom.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.08,0:54:05.71,*ENG,633,0,0,0,,You're allowed a wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.16,0:54:13.63,*ENG,634,0,0,0,,Bets! Place your bets!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.79,0:54:15.96,*ENG,635,0,0,0,,Bets taken! Bets taken here!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.13,0:54:19.07,*ENG,636,0,0,0,,Step up, folks! Who fancies a flutter in today's bloodbath?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.23,0:54:22.10,*ENG,637,0,0,0,,Smart money's on Krum to survive! Any bets?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.27,0:54:23.76,*ENG,638,0,0,0,,Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.10,0:54:26.83,*ENG,639,0,0,0,,Ten-to-1 for Fleur. There you go. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.34,0:54:29.28,*ENG,640,0,0,0,,Your attention, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.51,0:54:32.10,*ENG,641,0,0,0,,This is a great day for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.55,0:54:39.78,*ENG,642,0,0,0,,Each of the three tasks involves very considerable danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.95,0:54:42.65,*ENG,643,0,0,0,,Please keep your seats at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.82,0:54:45.55,*ENG,644,0,0,0,,This will minimize any risks you may be exposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.73,0:54:49.16,*ENG,645,0,0,0,,- Harry? Is that you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.33,0:54:51.02,*ENG,646,0,0,0,,I'm sure we all wish our champions...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.20,0:54:54.26,*ENG,647,0,0,0,,- How are you feeling? Okay? - ... the greatest of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.57,0:54:59.97,*ENG,648,0,0,0,,The key is to concentrate. After that, you just have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.14,0:55:01.97,*ENG,649,0,0,0,,Battle a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.28,0:55:08.77,*ENG,650,0,0,0,,Young love.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.48,0:55:10.75,*ENG,651,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.22,0:55:14.52,*ENG,652,0,0,0,,...stirring.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.19,0:55:20.35,*ENG,653,0,0,0,,If everything goes unfortunately today...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.53,0:55:23.29,*ENG,654,0,0,0,,...you two may even make the front page.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.46,0:55:25.69,*ENG,655,0,0,0,,You have no business here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.87,0:55:27.89,*ENG,656,0,0,0,,This tent is for champions...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.24,0:55:29.93,*ENG,657,0,0,0,,...and friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.74,0:55:36.90,*ENG,658,0,0,0,,No matter. We've got what we wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.05,0:55:42.85,*ENG,659,0,0,0,,Good day, champions. Gather round, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.02,0:55:47.21,*ENG,660,0,0,0,,Now, you've waited, you've wondered, and at last the moment has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.39,0:55:50.62,*ENG,661,0,0,0,,A moment only four of you can fully appreciate.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.79,0:55:52.92,*ENG,662,0,0,0,,What are you doing here, Miss Granger?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.23,0:55:55.89,*ENG,663,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.06,0:55:57.66,*ENG,664,0,0,0,,Barty, the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.03,0:56:00.26,*ENG,665,0,0,0,,Champions, in a circle around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.43,0:56:03.53,*ENG,666,0,0,0,,Miss Delacour, over here. Mr. Krum.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.70,0:56:07.64,*ENG,667,0,0,0,,And, Potter, Mr. Potter, over here. That's right. Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.81,0:56:10.24,*ENG,668,0,0,0,,...Miss Delacour, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.31,0:56:15.98,*ENG,669,0,0,0,,The Welsh Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.62,0:56:21.95,*ENG,670,0,0,0,,Mr. Krum.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.93,0:56:26.83,*ENG,671,0,0,0,,The Chinese Fireball.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.30,0:56:35.70,*ENG,672,0,0,0,,The Swedish Short-Snout.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.17,0:56:38.16,*ENG,673,0,0,0,,- Which leaves... - The Horntail.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.34,0:56:40.60,*ENG,674,0,0,0,,- What's that, boy? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.01,0:56:46.41,*ENG,675,0,0,0,,The Hungarian Horntail.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.58,0:56:51.71,*ENG,676,0,0,0,,These represent four very real dragons...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.89,0:56:54.95,*ENG,677,0,0,0,,...each of which has been given a golden egg to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.12,0:56:57.59,*ENG,678,0,0,0,,Your objective is simple:
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.76,0:56:59.25,*ENG,679,0,0,0,,Collect the egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.43,0:57:02.42,*ENG,680,0,0,0,,This you must do, for each egg contains a clue...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.60,0:57:06.09,*ENG,681,0,0,0,,...without which you cannot hope to proceed to the next task.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.27,0:57:07.60,*ENG,682,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.64,0:57:11.30,*ENG,683,0,0,0,,Very well. Good luck, champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.47,0:57:14.30,*ENG,684,0,0,0,,Mr. Diggory, at the sound of the cannon, you may...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.92,0:57:26.75,*ENG,685,0,0,0,,Diggory! Diggory! Diggory!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.33,0:57:41.70,*ENG,686,0,0,0,,Three of our champions have now faced their dragons...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.87,0:57:45.36,*ENG,687,0,0,0,,...and so each one of them will proceed to the next task.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.94,0:57:49.03,*ENG,688,0,0,0,,And now our fourth and final contestant.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.01,0:57:54.57,*ENG,689,0,0,0,,Harry! Harry! Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.68,0:59:04.62,*ENG,690,0,0,0,,Your wand, Harry! Your wand!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.12,0:59:07.14,*ENG,691,0,0,0,,Accio Firebolt!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.15,0:59:38.31,*ENG,692,0,0,0,,- Yeah! - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.23,0:59:48.66,*ENG,693,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.31,1:00:01.60,*ENG,694,0,0,0,,- Yeah! - Yeah! Well done, dragon!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.59,1:02:35.75,*ENG,695,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.99,1:03:01.68,*ENG,696,0,0,0,,- Yes, Harry! - Knew you wouldn't die, Harry. Lose a leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.86,1:03:03.79,*ENG,697,0,0,0,,- Or an arm. - Pack it in altogether?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.96,1:03:05.72,*ENG,698,0,0,0,,- Never! - Never!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.83,1:03:09.16,*ENG,699,0,0,0,,Shush!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.63,1:03:12.29,*ENG,700,0,0,0,,Go on, Harry. What's the clue?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.33,1:03:16.17,*ENG,701,0,0,0,,- Who wants me to open it? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.97,1:03:19.50,*ENG,702,0,0,0,,- Do you want me to open it? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.68,1:03:33.08,*ENG,703,0,0,0,,What the bloody hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.22,1:03:39.95,*ENG,704,0,0,0,,All right, everyone! Go back to your knitting.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.13,1:03:44.15,*ENG,705,0,0,0,,This is gonna be uncomfortable enough without all you nosy sods listening in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.33,1:03:51.33,*ENG,706,0,0,0,,I reckon you have to be barking mad to put your own name in the Goblet of Fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.67,1:03:54.40,*ENG,707,0,0,0,,Caught on, have you? Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.54,1:03:57.64,*ENG,708,0,0,0,,I wasn't the only one who thought you'd done it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.81,1:04:00.08,*ENG,709,0,0,0,,Everyone was saying it behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.28,1:04:05.51,*ENG,710,0,0,0,,Brilliant. That makes me feel loads better.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.45,1:04:09.85,*ENG,711,0,0,0,,- Least I warned you about the dragons. - Hagrid warned me about the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.02,1:04:11.49,*ENG,712,0,0,0,,No, no, no, I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.66,1:04:14.68,*ENG,713,0,0,0,,No, don't you remember? I told Hermione to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.86,1:04:18.92,*ENG,714,0,0,0,,...that Seamus told me that Parvati told Dean that Hagrid was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.10,1:04:23.04,*ENG,715,0,0,0,,Seamus never actually told me anything, so it was really me all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.04,1:04:27.03,*ENG,716,0,0,0,,I thought we'd be all right, you know...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.27,1:04:29.26,*ENG,717,0,0,0,,...after you'd figured that out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.64,1:04:32.31,*ENG,718,0,0,0,,Who... Who could possibly figure that out?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.98,1:04:34.41,*ENG,719,0,0,0,,That's completely mental.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.58,1:04:37.61,*ENG,720,0,0,0,,Yeah. Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.78,1:04:39.81,*ENG,721,0,0,0,,I suppose I was a bit distraught.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.42,1:04:44.12,*ENG,722,0,0,0,,Boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.58,1:05:10.01,*ENG,723,0,0,0,,- Hi, Harry. - Hi, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.65,1:05:16.25,*ENG,724,0,0,0,,Cho, Harry's looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.19,1:05:21.89,*ENG,725,0,0,0,,Shush.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.60,1:05:23.96,*ENG,726,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.97,1:05:28.46,*ENG,727,0,0,0,,I can't believe it! She's done it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.50,1:05:31.73,*ENG,728,0,0,0,,"Miss Granger, a plain but ambitious girl...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.91,1:05:34.67,*ENG,729,0,0,0,,...seems to be developing a taste for famous wizards.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.84,1:05:37.11,*ENG,730,0,0,0,,Her latest prey, sources report...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.28,1:05:40.91,*ENG,731,0,0,0,,...is none other than the Bulgarian bonbon, Viktor Krum.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.21,1:05:45.15,*ENG,732,0,0,0,,No word yet on how Harry Potter's taking this latest emotional blow."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.52,1:05:48.45,*ENG,733,0,0,0,,Parcel for you, Mr. Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.62,1:05:50.11,*ENG,734,0,0,0,,Thank you, Nigel.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.93,1:05:57.76,*ENG,735,0,0,0,,Not now, Nigel. Later.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.60,1:06:01.12,*ENG,736,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.47,1:06:09.24,*ENG,737,0,0,0,,I told him I'd get him Harry's autograph.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.44,1:06:13.21,*ENG,738,0,0,0,,Oh, look, Mum's sent me something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.35,1:06:23.19,*ENG,739,0,0,0,,Mum sent me a dress.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.36,1:06:27.16,*ENG,740,0,0,0,,Well, it does match your eyes. Is there a bonnet?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.63,1:06:29.46,*ENG,741,0,0,0,,Nose down, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.00,1:06:33.96,*ENG,742,0,0,0,,- Ginny, these must be for you. - I'm not wearing that, it's ghastly.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.70,1:06:37.53,*ENG,743,0,0,0,,What are you on about?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.70,1:06:39.64,*ENG,744,0,0,0,,They're not for Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.81,1:06:41.21,*ENG,745,0,0,0,,They're for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.18,1:06:45.94,*ENG,746,0,0,0,,- Dress robes. - Dress robes? For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.18,1:06:49.34,*ENG,747,0,0,0,,The Yule Ball...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.52,1:06:54.85,*ENG,748,0,0,0,,...has been a tradition of the Triwizard Tournament...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.59,1:06:57.65,*ENG,749,0,0,0,,...since its inception.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.32,1:07:02.19,*ENG,750,0,0,0,,On Christmas Eve night, we and our guests...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.36,1:07:04.02,*ENG,751,0,0,0,,...gather in the Great Hall...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.20,1:07:08.26,*ENG,752,0,0,0,,...for a night of well-mannered frivolity.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.80,1:07:12.07,*ENG,753,0,0,0,,As representatives of the host school...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.24,1:07:17.34,*ENG,754,0,0,0,,...I expect each and every one of you to put your best foot forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.64,1:07:20.27,*ENG,755,0,0,0,,And I mean this literally, because...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.45,1:07:24.88,*ENG,756,0,0,0,,...the Yule Ball is, first and foremost...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.75,1:07:27.24,*ENG,757,0,0,0,,...a dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.49,1:07:33.29,*ENG,758,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.49,1:07:36.49,*ENG,759,0,0,0,,The house of Godric Gryffindor has commanded the respect...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.66,1:07:39.29,*ENG,760,0,0,0,,...of the wizard world for nearly 10 centuries.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.47,1:07:43.53,*ENG,761,0,0,0,,I will not have you, in the course of a single evening, besmirching that name...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.70,1:07:47.90,*ENG,762,0,0,0,,...by behaving like a babbling, bumbling band of baboons.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.64,1:07:50.61,*ENG,763,0,0,0,,Try saying that five times fast, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.78,1:07:52.27,*ENG,764,0,0,0,,Now, to dance...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.45,1:07:56.14,*ENG,765,0,0,0,,...is to let the body breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.32,1:07:59.65,*ENG,766,0,0,0,,Inside every girl, a secret swan slumbers...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.82,1:08:02.19,*ENG,767,0,0,0,,...Ionging to burst forth and take flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.36,1:08:06.35,*ENG,768,0,0,0,,Something's about to burst out of Eloise Midgen, but I don't think it's a swan.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.53,1:08:09.65,*ENG,769,0,0,0,,Inside every boy, a lordly lion prepared to prance.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.83,1:08:12.06,*ENG,770,0,0,0,,- Mr. Weasley. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.23,1:08:14.67,*ENG,771,0,0,0,,Will you join me, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.27,1:08:22.80,*ENG,772,0,0,0,,Now, place your right hand on my waist.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.98,1:08:25.54,*ENG,773,0,0,0,,- Where? - My waist.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.71,1:08:28.27,*ENG,774,0,0,0,,And extend your arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.72,1:08:30.68,*ENG,775,0,0,0,,Mr. Filch, if you please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.75,1:08:35.74,*ENG,776,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.92,1:08:39.41,*ENG,777,0,0,0,,One, two, three. One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.13,1:08:45.26,*ENG,778,0,0,0,,Never gonna let him forget this, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.43,1:08:46.59,*ENG,779,0,0,0,,- Never. - Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.77,1:08:50.63,*ENG,780,0,0,0,,Everybody come together. Boys, on your feet!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.73,1:09:15.66,*ENG,781,0,0,0,,Why do they have to travel in packs?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.83,1:09:18.49,*ENG,782,0,0,0,,How are you supposed to get one on their own to ask them?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.34,1:09:29.83,*ENG,783,0,0,0,,Blimey, Harry. You've slayed dragons. If you can't get a date, who can?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.01,1:09:32.27,*ENG,784,0,0,0,,I think I'd take the dragon right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.48,1:09:40.04,*ENG,785,0,0,0,,I take after my mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.22,1:09:44.16,*ENG,786,0,0,0,,Though I didn't know her very well. She left when I was about 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.32,1:09:46.26,*ENG,787,0,0,0,,No, not the maternal sort, her.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.43,1:09:49.99,*ENG,788,0,0,0,,Broke me dad's heart, though. He was a tiny little fella, my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.16,1:09:54.69,*ENG,789,0,0,0,,I could pick him up at the age of 6 with one hand and put him up on the dresser.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.87,1:09:57.20,*ENG,790,0,0,0,,He laughed so hard at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.27,1:10:01.14,*ENG,791,0,0,0,,Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.08,1:10:10.81,*ENG,792,0,0,0,,And then he died just when I started school, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.98,1:10:14.01,*ENG,793,0,0,0,,So I sort of had to make me own way, as it were.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.45,1:10:16.68,*ENG,794,0,0,0,,But enough of me. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.87,1:10:38.97,*ENG,795,0,0,0,,This is mad. At this rate, we'll be the only ones in our year without dates.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.25,1:10:43.98,*ENG,796,0,0,0,,Well, us and Neville.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.15,1:10:46.81,*ENG,797,0,0,0,,Yeah, but, then again, he can take himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.55,1:10:50.89,*ENG,798,0,0,0,,It might interest you to know that Neville's already got someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.36,1:10:55.12,*ENG,799,0,0,0,,Now I'm really depressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.97,1:11:04.43,*ENG,800,0,0,0,,"Get a move on or all the good ones will have gone."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.47,1:11:08.44,*ENG,801,0,0,0,,Who you going with, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.18,1:11:12.87,*ENG,802,0,0,0,,- Oi, Angelina? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.05,1:11:18.35,*ENG,803,0,0,0,,Do you wanna go to the ball with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.68,1:11:20.41,*ENG,804,0,0,0,,To the ball?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.59,1:11:22.05,*ENG,805,0,0,0,,Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.76,1:11:27.32,*ENG,806,0,0,0,,Oi, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.49,1:11:29.12,*ENG,807,0,0,0,,You're a girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.30,1:11:30.63,*ENG,808,0,0,0,,Very well spotted.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.80,1:11:32.73,*ENG,809,0,0,0,,Come with one of us?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.37,1:11:40.27,*ENG,810,0,0,0,,Come on. It's one thing for a bloke to show up alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.44,1:11:41.93,*ENG,811,0,0,0,,For a girl, it's just sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.11,1:11:45.87,*ENG,812,0,0,0,,I won't be going alone, because, believe it or not, someone's asked me!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.82,1:11:54.81,*ENG,813,0,0,0,,And I said yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.66,1:11:58.25,*ENG,814,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.42,1:12:00.09,*ENG,815,0,0,0,,She's lying, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.26,1:12:01.49,*ENG,816,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.20,1:12:05.49,*ENG,817,0,0,0,,Look, we've just gotta grit our teeth and do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.67,1:12:09.57,*ENG,818,0,0,0,,Tonight, when we get back to the common room, we'll both have partners. Agreed?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.74,1:12:11.29,*ENG,819,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.66,1:12:36.99,*ENG,820,0,0,0,,- Cho! - Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.57,1:12:43.30,*ENG,821,0,0,0,,Watch yourself on the stairs. It's a bit icy at the top.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.47,1:12:45.06,*ENG,822,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.51,1:12:50.57,*ENG,823,0,0,0,,Cho?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.51,1:12:53.07,*ENG,824,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.45,1:12:56.68,*ENG,825,0,0,0,,Well, I just wondered if you...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.85,1:12:59.51,*ENG,826,0,0,0,,I wondered if maybe you wanted to go to the ball with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.32,1:13:03.58,*ENG,827,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't catch that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.49,1:13:09.39,*ENG,828,0,0,0,,I was just wondering if maybe you wanted to go to the ball with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.43,1:13:16.99,*ENG,829,0,0,0,,Harry...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.17,1:13:20.00,*ENG,830,0,0,0,,...I'm sorry, but someone's already asked me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.01,1:13:22.44,*ENG,831,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.11,1:13:26.34,*ENG,832,0,0,0,,Well, I've said I'll go with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.01,1:13:30.57,*ENG,833,0,0,0,,Okay. Yeah. Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.88,1:13:34.61,*ENG,834,0,0,0,,Fine. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.92,1:13:36.51,*ENG,835,0,0,0,,Okay. Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.79,1:13:39.52,*ENG,836,0,0,0,,Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.16,1:13:41.96,*ENG,837,0,0,0,,I really am...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.13,1:13:43.76,*ENG,838,0,0,0,,...sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.54,1:13:55.03,*ENG,839,0,0,0,,It's all right, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.21,1:13:58.41,*ENG,840,0,0,0,,It's okay, Ron. It's all right. It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.58,1:14:00.44,*ENG,841,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.71,1:14:02.87,*ENG,842,0,0,0,,He just asked Fleur Delacour out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.05,1:14:05.54,*ENG,843,0,0,0,,- What? - What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.72,1:14:07.08,*ENG,844,0,0,0,,No, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.65,1:14:11.99,*ENG,845,0,0,0,,- She said yes? - Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.39,1:14:16.83,*ENG,846,0,0,0,,There she was, walking by. You know how I like it when they walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.56,1:14:21.19,*ENG,847,0,0,0,,I couldn't help it. It just sort of slipped out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.37,1:14:24.83,*ENG,848,0,0,0,,Actually, he sort of screamed at her. It was a bit frightening.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.01,1:14:29.60,*ENG,849,0,0,0,,- And what did you do then? - What else? I ran for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.78,1:14:33.51,*ENG,850,0,0,0,,I'm not cut out for this, Harry. I don't know what got into me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.68,1:14:34.91,*ENG,851,0,0,0,,- Hi, Harry. - Hi, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.08,1:14:38.14,*ENG,852,0,0,0,,I always liked looking at them from behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.49,1:14:42.05,*ENG,853,0,0,0,,She's never gonna forgive me, ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.69,1:14:43.68,*ENG,854,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.77,1:15:02.47,*ENG,855,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.71,1:15:06.47,*ENG,856,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.98,1:15:11.28,*ENG,857,0,0,0,,Bloody...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.45,1:15:12.68,*ENG,858,0,0,0,,Oh, bloody...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.39,1:15:19.09,*ENG,859,0,0,0,,What are those? What are those?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.26,1:15:22.28,*ENG,860,0,0,0,,- My dress robes. - Well, they're all right!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.46,1:15:25.40,*ENG,861,0,0,0,,No lace. No dodgy little collar.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.56,1:15:27.50,*ENG,862,0,0,0,,Well, I expect yours are more traditional.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.67,1:15:32.70,*ENG,863,0,0,0,,Traditional?! They're ancient! I look like my Great Aunt Tessie!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.07,1:15:38.13,*ENG,864,0,0,0,,I smell like my Great Aunt Tessie.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.88,1:15:44.71,*ENG,865,0,0,0,,Murder me, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.12,1:15:47.68,*ENG,866,0,0,0,,Leave it alone!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.65,1:15:52.09,*ENG,867,0,0,0,,Poor kid. I bet she's alone in her room, crying her eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.26,1:15:54.73,*ENG,868,0,0,0,,- Who? - Hermione, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.89,1:15:58.49,*ENG,869,0,0,0,,Come on, Harry, why do you think she wouldn't tell us who she's coming with?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.66,1:16:00.86,*ENG,870,0,0,0,,Because we'd take the mickey out of her if she did.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.03,1:16:06.13,*ENG,871,0,0,0,,Nobody asked her. Would've taken her myself if she wasn't so bloody proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.11,1:16:08.51,*ENG,872,0,0,0,,- Hello, boys. - Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.67,1:16:10.51,*ENG,873,0,0,0,,Don't you look...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.08,1:16:12.27,*ENG,874,0,0,0,,...dashing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.85,1:16:16.01,*ENG,875,0,0,0,,There you are, Potter. Are you and Miss Patil ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.18,1:16:18.01,*ENG,876,0,0,0,,- Ready, professor? - To dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.18,1:16:21.21,*ENG,877,0,0,0,,It's traditional that the three champions... Well, in this case, four.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.39,1:16:22.45,*ENG,878,0,0,0,,...are the first to dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.79,1:16:25.42,*ENG,879,0,0,0,,- Surely I told you that. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.99,1:16:27.72,*ENG,880,0,0,0,,Well, now you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.23,1:16:33.53,*ENG,881,0,0,0,,As for you, Mr. Weasley, you may proceed into the Great Hall with Miss Patil.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.70,1:16:36.10,*ENG,882,0,0,0,,- Oh, there you are. - Come on, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.27,1:16:37.76,*ENG,883,0,0,0,,Come along this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.64,1:16:44.47,*ENG,884,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.31,1:16:47.30,*ENG,885,0,0,0,,- Hi. - Now, I need you all to line up...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.48,1:16:50.85,*ENG,886,0,0,0,,...in the procession, please. Oh, you are very late.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.05,1:16:55.45,*ENG,887,0,0,0,,This way. This way. Come along.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.16,1:16:59.39,*ENG,888,0,0,0,,She looks beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.56,1:17:01.15,*ENG,889,0,0,0,,Yeah, she does.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.54,1:17:52.10,*ENG,890,0,0,0,,Is that Hermione Granger? With Viktor Krum?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.75,1:17:55.31,*ENG,891,0,0,0,,No. Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.02,1:18:01.58,*ENG,892,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.33,1:18:12.32,*ENG,893,0,0,0,,Harry, take my waist.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.20,1:18:14.63,*ENG,894,0,0,0,,- What? - Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.20,1:19:23.07,*ENG,895,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.64,1:19:25.90,*ENG,896,0,0,0,,Move your body like a hairy troll
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.67,1:19:29.14,*ENG,897,0,0,0,,Learning to rock and roll
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.54,1:19:32.14,*ENG,898,0,0,0,,Spin around like a crazy elf
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.65,1:19:34.88,*ENG,899,0,0,0,,Dancing by himself
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.18,1:19:38.52,*ENG,900,0,0,0,,Boogie down like a unicorn
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.69,1:19:41.12,*ENG,901,0,0,0,,No stopping till the break of dawn
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.29,1:19:44.12,*ENG,902,0,0,0,,Put your hands up in the air
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.33,1:19:47.09,*ENG,903,0,0,0,,Like an ogre who just don 't care
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.80,1:19:50.46,*ENG,904,0,0,0,,Can you dance like a Hippogriff?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.80,1:19:55.00,*ENG,905,0,0,0,,Ruddy pumpkinhead, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.17,1:20:00.57,*ENG,906,0,0,0,,I don't think it was the books that had him going to the library.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.51,1:20:04.03,*ENG,907,0,0,0,,May I have your arm?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.21,1:20:06.94,*ENG,908,0,0,0,,Arm. Leg. I'm yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.84,1:20:34.43,*ENG,909,0,0,0,,Hot, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.11,1:20:38.44,*ENG,910,0,0,0,,Viktor's gone to go and get drinks. Would you care to join us?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.61,1:20:42.31,*ENG,911,0,0,0,,No, we'd not care to join you and Viktor.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.99,1:20:46.32,*ENG,912,0,0,0,,What's got your wand in a knot?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.62,1:20:50.32,*ENG,913,0,0,0,,He's a Durmstrang. You're fraternizing with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.49,1:20:54.05,*ENG,914,0,0,0,,The enemy? Who was it wanting his autograph?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.76,1:20:57.20,*ENG,915,0,0,0,,Besides, the whole point of the tournament...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.37,1:21:00.89,*ENG,916,0,0,0,,...is international magical cooperation...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.47,1:21:03.03,*ENG,917,0,0,0,,...to make friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.70,1:21:06.87,*ENG,918,0,0,0,,I think he's got a bit more than friendship on his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.85,1:21:19.18,*ENG,919,0,0,0,,Are you going to ask me to dance or not?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.35,1:21:20.79,*ENG,920,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.03,1:21:31.46,*ENG,921,0,0,0,,- He's using you. - How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.63,1:21:35.83,*ENG,922,0,0,0,,- Besides, I can take care of myself. - I doubt it. He's way too old.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.00,1:21:39.67,*ENG,923,0,0,0,,- What?! What? That's what you think? - Yeah, that's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.84,1:21:41.97,*ENG,924,0,0,0,,You know the solution then, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.14,1:21:44.13,*ENG,925,0,0,0,,- Go on. - Next time there's a ball...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.31,1:21:47.44,*ENG,926,0,0,0,,...pluck up the courage and ask me before somebody else does!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.62,1:21:49.64,*ENG,927,0,0,0,,And not as a last resort.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.82,1:21:54.02,*ENG,928,0,0,0,,Well, that's... I mean, that's just completely off the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.19,1:21:55.52,*ENG,929,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.99,1:21:57.29,*ENG,930,0,0,0,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.46,1:21:59.95,*ENG,931,0,0,0,,Never mind! Off to bed, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.76,1:22:06.79,*ENG,932,0,0,0,,- They get scary when they get older. - Ron, you spoiled everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.97,1:22:08.83,*ENG,933,0,0,0,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.11,1:22:16.10,*ENG,934,0,0,0,,No, don 't let
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.91,1:22:22.25,*ENG,935,0,0,0,,This magic die
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.02,1:22:26.78,*ENG,936,0,0,0,,The answer's there
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.11,1:23:27.21,*ENG,937,0,0,0,,Let me see it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.52,1:23:31.45,*ENG,938,0,0,0,,Yes, the time is close now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.12,1:23:37.99,*ENG,939,0,0,0,,Harry, at last!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.29,1:23:44.63,*ENG,940,0,0,0,,Step aside, Wormtail, so I can give our guest a proper greeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.24,1:23:56.64,*ENG,941,0,0,0,,You all right, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.08,1:23:59.84,*ENG,942,0,0,0,,I just got in.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.45,1:24:01.68,*ENG,943,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.96,1:24:16.23,*ENG,944,0,0,0,,Harry, you told me you'd figured the egg out weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.40,1:24:20.60,*ENG,945,0,0,0,,- The task is two days from now. - Really? I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.14,1:24:23.93,*ENG,946,0,0,0,,I suppose Viktor's already figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.11,1:24:26.94,*ENG,947,0,0,0,,Wouldn't know. We don't actually talk about the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.14,1:24:32.74,*ENG,948,0,0,0,,Actually, we don't really talk at all. Viktor's more of a physical being.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.48,1:24:39.68,*ENG,949,0,0,0,,I just mean he's not particularly loquacious.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.15,1:24:42.38,*ENG,950,0,0,0,,Mostly, he watches me study.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.19,1:24:45.28,*ENG,951,0,0,0,,It's a bit annoying, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.66,1:24:49.36,*ENG,952,0,0,0,,You are trying to figure this egg out, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.20,1:24:51.72,*ENG,953,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.30,1:24:55.27,*ENG,954,0,0,0,,It just means these tasks are designed to test you...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.47,1:24:58.63,*ENG,955,0,0,0,,...in the most brutal way. They're almost cruel.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.77,1:25:01.40,*ENG,956,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.74,1:25:05.64,*ENG,957,0,0,0,,...I'm scared for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.58,1:25:09.17,*ENG,958,0,0,0,,You got by the dragons mostly on nerve.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.78,1:25:12.28,*ENG,959,0,0,0,,I'm not sure it's going to be enough this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.45,1:25:14.15,*ENG,960,0,0,0,,Hey, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.89,1:25:21.38,*ENG,961,0,0,0,,- Potter! - Cedric.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.10,1:25:25.76,*ENG,962,0,0,0,,How... How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.83,1:25:28.23,*ENG,963,0,0,0,,Spectacular.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.77,1:25:33.60,*ENG,964,0,0,0,,I realize I never really thanked you properly for tipping me off about those dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.77,1:25:36.11,*ENG,965,0,0,0,,Forget it. I'm sure you would've done the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.41,1:25:37.97,*ENG,966,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.08,1:25:41.64,*ENG,967,0,0,0,,You know the Prefects' bathroom on the fifth floor?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.49,1:25:48.08,*ENG,968,0,0,0,,It's not a bad place for a bath.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.46,1:25:52.36,*ENG,969,0,0,0,,Just take your egg...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.09,1:25:55.82,*ENG,970,0,0,0,,...and mull things over in the hot water.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.03,1:26:33.19,*ENG,971,0,0,0,,I must be out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.41,1:26:45.57,*ENG,972,0,0,0,,I'm definitely out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.25,1:26:51.51,*ENG,973,0,0,0,,I'd try putting it in the water if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.69,1:26:53.59,*ENG,974,0,0,0,,Myrtle!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.75,1:26:55.48,*ENG,975,0,0,0,,Hello, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.22,1:26:59.49,*ENG,976,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.76,1:27:07.43,*ENG,977,0,0,0,,I was circling a blocked drain the other day...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.60,1:27:11.04,*ENG,978,0,0,0,,...and could swear I saw a bit of Polyjuice Potion.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.21,1:27:13.54,*ENG,979,0,0,0,,Not being a bad boy again, are you, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.71,1:27:15.47,*ENG,980,0,0,0,,Polyjuice Potion?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.24,1:27:20.27,*ENG,981,0,0,0,,Kicked the habit. Myrtle, did you say, "Try putting it in the water"?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.09,1:27:28.78,*ENG,982,0,0,0,,That's what he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.62,1:27:31.28,*ENG,983,0,0,0,,The other boy...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.69,1:27:34.75,*ENG,984,0,0,0,,...the handsome one...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.06,1:27:37.29,*ENG,985,0,0,0,,...Cedric.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.70,1:27:43.36,*ENG,986,0,0,0,,Well, go on. Open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.48,1:27:56.47,*ENG,987,0,0,0,,Come seek us Where our voices sound
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.65,1:28:01.31,*ENG,988,0,0,0,,We cannot sing Above the ground
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.49,1:28:05.86,*ENG,989,0,0,0,,An hour long you'll have to look
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.59,1:28:11.26,*ENG,990,0,0,0,,To recover what we took
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.44,1:28:20.67,*ENG,991,0,0,0,,Myrtle...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.34,1:28:25.78,*ENG,992,0,0,0,,...there aren't merpeople in the Black Lake, are there?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.68,1:28:28.34,*ENG,993,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.22,1:28:33.59,*ENG,994,0,0,0,,It took Cedric ages to riddle it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.09,1:28:37.85,*ENG,995,0,0,0,,Almost all the bubbles were gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.51,1:28:57.48,*ENG,996,0,0,0,,Harry, tell me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.18,1:29:02.01,*ENG,997,0,0,0,,"Come seek us where our voices sound."
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.18,1:29:04.74,*ENG,998,0,0,0,,The Black Lake, that's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.72,1:29:08.24,*ENG,999,0,0,0,,"An hour long you'll have to look."
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.42,1:29:11.88,*ENG,1000,0,0,0,,Again, obvious. Though, admittedly, potentially problematic.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.26,1:29:15.13,*ENG,1001,0,0,0,,"Potentially problematic"?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.30,1:29:18.56,*ENG,1002,0,0,0,,When's the last time you held your breath underwater for an hour, Hermione?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.10,1:29:23.43,*ENG,1003,0,0,0,,Look, Harry, we can do this. The three of us can figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.60,1:29:26.10,*ENG,1004,0,0,0,,Hate to break up the skull session.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.27,1:29:28.26,*ENG,1005,0,0,0,,Professor McGonagall wants you in her office.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.51,1:29:30.91,*ENG,1006,0,0,0,,Not you, Potter, just Weasley and Granger.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.08,1:29:33.74,*ENG,1007,0,0,0,,But, sir, the second task is only hours away, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.91,1:29:36.51,*ENG,1008,0,0,0,,Exactly. Presumably Potter is well prepared by now...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.68,1:29:38.55,*ENG,1009,0,0,0,,...and could do with a good night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.72,1:29:41.21,*ENG,1010,0,0,0,,Go. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.20,1:29:53.00,*ENG,1011,0,0,0,,Longbottom!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.17,1:29:55.19,*ENG,1012,0,0,0,,Why don't you help Potter put his books back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.84,1:30:06.04,*ENG,1013,0,0,0,,You know, if you're interested in plants...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.21,1:30:08.81,*ENG,1014,0,0,0,,...you'd be better off with Goshawk's Guide to Herbology.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.42,1:30:13.75,*ENG,1015,0,0,0,,Do you know there's a wizard in Nepal who's growing gravity-resistant trees?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.92,1:30:17.65,*ENG,1016,0,0,0,,Neville, no offense, but I really don't care...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.26,1:30:19.99,*ENG,1017,0,0,0,,...about plants.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.33,1:30:22.02,*ENG,1018,0,0,0,,Now, if there's...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.20,1:30:27.00,*ENG,1019,0,0,0,,...a Tibetan turnip that will allow me to breathe underwater for an hour...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.17,1:30:29.66,*ENG,1020,0,0,0,,...then great. But otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.84,1:30:33.64,*ENG,1021,0,0,0,,I don't know about a turnip. But you could always use gillyweed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.81,1:30:37.71,*ENG,1022,0,0,0,,- Any bets? Any bets? - Come on, place your bets!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.88,1:30:39.35,*ENG,1023,0,0,0,,Step up, mates! Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.51,1:30:40.95,*ENG,1024,0,0,0,,- Three lads. - One lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.12,1:30:43.28,*ENG,1025,0,0,0,,- Four go down. - But do four come up?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.45,1:30:44.97,*ENG,1026,0,0,0,,Don't be so mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.59,1:30:47.42,*ENG,1027,0,0,0,,- Any bets? - Fleur's 10-1.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.59,1:30:51.58,*ENG,1028,0,0,0,,- You're sure about this, Neville? - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.76,1:30:53.69,*ENG,1029,0,0,0,,- For an hour? - Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.86,1:30:55.35,*ENG,1030,0,0,0,,Most likely?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.53,1:30:57.72,*ENG,1031,0,0,0,,Well, there is some debate among herbologists...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.90,1:31:00.37,*ENG,1032,0,0,0,,...as to the effects of fresh water versus salt water...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.53,1:31:03.20,*ENG,1033,0,0,0,,You're telling me this now? You must be joking!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.37,1:31:05.34,*ENG,1034,0,0,0,,I just wanted to help.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.51,1:31:08.60,*ENG,1035,0,0,0,,Well, that makes you a right sight better than Ron and Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.78,1:31:10.54,*ENG,1036,0,0,0,,Where are they anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.71,1:31:13.74,*ENG,1037,0,0,0,,- You seem a little tense, Harry. - Do l?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.75,1:31:22.98,*ENG,1038,0,0,0,,Welcome to the second task.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.16,1:31:26.85,*ENG,1039,0,0,0,,Last night, something was stolen from each of our champions.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.03,1:31:28.39,*ENG,1040,0,0,0,,A treasure of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.56,1:31:31.19,*ENG,1041,0,0,0,,These four treasures, one for each champion...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.37,1:31:34.06,*ENG,1042,0,0,0,,...now lie on the bottom of the Black Lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.23,1:31:35.79,*ENG,1043,0,0,0,,In order to win...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.97,1:31:39.80,*ENG,1044,0,0,0,,...each champion need only find their treasure and return to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.97,1:31:42.60,*ENG,1045,0,0,0,,- Simple enough, except for this: - Put that in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.78,1:31:46.41,*ENG,1046,0,0,0,,They will have but one hour to do so, and one hour only.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.58,1:31:50.52,*ENG,1047,0,0,0,,After that, they'll be on their own. No magic will save them.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.98,1:31:53.25,*ENG,1048,0,0,0,,You may begin at the sound of the cannon.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.78,1:32:22.72,*ENG,1049,0,0,0,,- What's the matter with him? - I don ' t know, I can ' t see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.05,1:32:27.04,*ENG,1050,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. I've killed Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.89,1:32:30.79,*ENG,1051,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.96,1:32:33.59,*ENG,1052,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.17,1:33:55.30,*ENG,1053,0,0,0,,The Beauxbatons champion, Miss Delacour...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.48,1:33:58.00,*ENG,1054,0,0,0,,...has unfortunately been forced to retire...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.65,1:34:01.74,*ENG,1055,0,0,0,,...so she will take no further part in this task.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.53,1:35:21.39,*ENG,1056,0,0,0,,But she' s my friend too!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.96,1:35:24.69,*ENG,1057,0,0,0,,Only one!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.05,1:36:17.91,*ENG,1058,0,0,0,,Let's get down below.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.89,1:36:30.76,*ENG,1059,0,0,0,,Krum! Krum! Krum!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.29,1:37:30.02,*ENG,1060,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.14,1:37:50.20,*ENG,1061,0,0,0,,Ascendio!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.45,1:37:57.14,*ENG,1062,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.45,1:38:00.92,*ENG,1063,0,0,0,,He's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.12,1:38:03.56,*ENG,1064,0,0,0,,He's all right. Barty!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.72,1:38:07.16,*ENG,1065,0,0,0,,- Go get him another towel. - I want all the judges over here now!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.76,1:38:11.25,*ENG,1066,0,0,0,,You saved her, even though she wasn't yours to save.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.90,1:38:13.59,*ENG,1067,0,0,0,,My little sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.00,1:38:15.56,*ENG,1068,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.37,1:38:19.10,*ENG,1069,0,0,0,,And you! You helped.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.74,1:38:22.77,*ENG,1070,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.98,1:38:31.14,*ENG,1071,0,0,0,,- Harry! - Hermione!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.32,1:38:33.98,*ENG,1072,0,0,0,,Are you all right? You must be freezing.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.22,1:38:37.16,*ENG,1073,0,0,0,,Personally, I think you behaved admirably.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.32,1:38:39.35,*ENG,1074,0,0,0,,I finished last, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.19,1:38:44.32,*ENG,1075,0,0,0,,Next to last. Fleur never got past the Grindylows.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.50,1:38:47.73,*ENG,1076,0,0,0,,Krum! Krum! Krum!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.90,1:38:50.80,*ENG,1077,0,0,0,,- Come on! Come on! - Attention!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.14,1:38:55.73,*ENG,1078,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.21,1:39:00.08,*ENG,1079,0,0,0,,The winner is Mr. Diggory...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.51,1:39:04.01,*ENG,1080,0,0,0,,...who showed innate command of the Bubble-Head Charm.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.18,1:39:06.85,*ENG,1081,0,0,0,,However, seeing as Mr. Potter would have finished first...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.02,1:39:11.98,*ENG,1082,0,0,0,,...had it not been for his determination to rescue not only Mr. Weasley...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.16,1:39:16.42,*ENG,1083,0,0,0,,...but the others as well, we've agreed to award him...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.60,1:39:18.59,*ENG,1084,0,0,0,,...second place...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.77,1:39:20.26,*ENG,1085,0,0,0,,- Second place! - Well done!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.43,1:39:23.06,*ENG,1086,0,0,0,,...for outstanding moral fiber!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.34,1:39:25.86,*ENG,1087,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.38,1:39:31.17,*ENG,1088,0,0,0,,- Right on. - All that moral fiber, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.34,1:39:32.97,*ENG,1089,0,0,0,,- It's great. - Moral fiber?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.15,1:39:35.51,*ENG,1090,0,0,0,,Blimey. Even when you go wrong, it turns out right.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.68,1:39:38.34,*ENG,1091,0,0,0,,- Yeah, well done, Moral Fiber. - Congratulations, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.52,1:39:40.18,*ENG,1092,0,0,0,,- A fine achievement. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.35,1:39:41.88,*ENG,1093,0,0,0,,Well done, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.06,1:39:45.29,*ENG,1094,0,0,0,,- See you at Hagrid's, Harry. - I'm sorry we haven't spoken.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.46,1:39:49.45,*ENG,1095,0,0,0,,After all, your story is one I've heard so many times.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.46,1:39:53.92,*ENG,1096,0,0,0,,Quite remarkable, really. Tragic, of course...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.10,1:39:56.09,*ENG,1097,0,0,0,,...to lose one's family.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.10,1:40:00.27,*ENG,1098,0,0,0,,Never whole again, are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.51,1:40:04.60,*ENG,1099,0,0,0,,Still, life goes on...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.28,1:40:06.94,*ENG,1100,0,0,0,,...and here we stand.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.82,1:40:12.55,*ENG,1101,0,0,0,,I'm sure your parents would be very proud of you today, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.72,1:40:14.19,*ENG,1102,0,0,0,,Bartemius!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.35,1:40:18.48,*ENG,1103,0,0,0,,Not trying to lure Potter into one of the Ministry's summer internships, are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.66,1:40:21.86,*ENG,1104,0,0,0,,The last boy who went into the Department of Mysteries never came out!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.34,1:40:36.24,*ENG,1105,0,0,0,,And they say I'm mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.52,1:40:49.25,*ENG,1106,0,0,0,,Now, I remember... I remember when I first met you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.42,1:40:52.45,*ENG,1107,0,0,0,,Biggest bunch of misfits I ever set eyes on.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.96,1:40:55.52,*ENG,1108,0,0,0,,Suppose you remind me of meself a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.70,1:40:59.72,*ENG,1109,0,0,0,,- And here we all are, four years later. - We're still a bunch of misfits.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.90,1:41:03.23,*ENG,1110,0,0,0,,Well, maybe, but we've all got each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.40,1:41:04.96,*ENG,1111,0,0,0,,And Harry, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.14,1:41:10.51,*ENG,1112,0,0,0,,Soon to be the youngest Triwizard champion there's ever been!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.71,1:41:12.74,*ENG,1113,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.18,1:41:16.67,*ENG,1114,0,0,0,,Hogwarts, Hogwarts Hoggy Warty Hogwarts
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.85,1:41:19.48,*ENG,1115,0,0,0,,Teach us something, please
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.46,1:41:30.95,*ENG,1116,0,0,0,,Mr. Crouch?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.04,1:41:41.63,*ENG,1117,0,0,0,,A man has died here, Fudge. And he won't be the last. You must take action.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.81,1:41:43.37,*ENG,1118,0,0,0,,I will not.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.54,1:41:47.60,*ENG,1119,0,0,0,,In times like these, the wizard world looks to its leaders for strength, Dumbledore!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.78,1:41:49.11,*ENG,1120,0,0,0,,Then for once show them some!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.28,1:41:53.38,*ENG,1121,0,0,0,,The Triwizard Tournament will not be canceled. I will not be seen as a coward!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.55,1:41:56.75,*ENG,1122,0,0,0,,A true leader does what is right, no matter what others think.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.92,1:41:59.72,*ENG,1123,0,0,0,,- What did you say to me? - Excuse me, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.89,1:42:03.56,*ENG,1124,0,0,0,,It may interest you to know this conversation is no longer private.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.90,1:42:09.46,*ENG,1125,0,0,0,,Oh, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.64,1:42:11.93,*ENG,1126,0,0,0,,Harry, how good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.77,1:42:14.30,*ENG,1127,0,0,0,,I can come back later, professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.47,1:42:17.81,*ENG,1128,0,0,0,,Not necessary, Harry. The minister and l are done. I'll be back in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.98,1:42:20.54,*ENG,1129,0,0,0,,Minister, after you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.08,1:42:23.07,*ENG,1130,0,0,0,,There you are. Your hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.25,1:42:26.91,*ENG,1131,0,0,0,,Oh, Harry, do feel free to indulge in a little Licorice Snap in my absence.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.09,1:42:30.32,*ENG,1132,0,0,0,,But I have to warn you, they're a wee bit sharp.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.75,1:44:03.34,*ENG,1133,0,0,0,,Professor?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.52,1:44:06.04,*ENG,1134,0,0,0,,- Professor. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.96,1:44:20.73,*ENG,1135,0,0,0,,Igor Karkaroff, you have been brought from Azkaban at your own request...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.90,1:44:22.83,*ENG,1136,0,0,0,,...to present evidence to this council.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.00,1:44:25.70,*ENG,1137,0,0,0,,Should your testimony prove consequential...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.87,1:44:29.93,*ENG,1138,0,0,0,,...council may be prepared to order your immediate release.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.11,1:44:34.71,*ENG,1139,0,0,0,,Until such time, you remain in the eyes of the Ministry a convicted Death Eater.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.88,1:44:36.58,*ENG,1140,0,0,0,,Do you accept these terms?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.15,1:44:39.85,*ENG,1141,0,0,0,,- I do, sir. - And what do you wish to present?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.19,1:44:42.65,*ENG,1142,0,0,0,,I have names, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.19,1:44:46.78,*ENG,1143,0,0,0,,There was Rosier, Evan Rosier.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.46,1:44:51.99,*ENG,1144,0,0,0,,- Rosier is dead. - He took a piece of me with him...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.17,1:44:54.29,*ENG,1145,0,0,0,,- ...though, didn't he? - I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.47,1:44:57.10,*ENG,1146,0,0,0,,- lf that is all the witness has to offer... - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.27,1:45:00.57,*ENG,1147,0,0,0,,There was Rookwood! He was a spy.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.74,1:45:03.11,*ENG,1148,0,0,0,,Augustus Rookwood? Of the Department of Mysteries?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.28,1:45:04.47,*ENG,1149,0,0,0,,Yeah, the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.64,1:45:08.31,*ENG,1150,0,0,0,,He passed information to You-Know-Who from inside the Ministry itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.55,1:45:12.81,*ENG,1151,0,0,0,,Very well. Council will deliberate.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.99,1:45:14.95,*ENG,1152,0,0,0,,In the meantime, you will return to Azkaban.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.12,1:45:19.85,*ENG,1153,0,0,0,,No! Wait! Wait, please! Please, I have more! What about Snape? Severus Snape?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.03,1:45:23.00,*ENG,1154,0,0,0,,As the council is aware, I've given evidence on this matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.16,1:45:27.12,*ENG,1155,0,0,0,,Severus Snape was indeed a Death Eater and, prior to Lord Voldemort's downfall...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.30,1:45:30.29,*ENG,1156,0,0,0,,- ...turned spy for us at great personal risk. - It's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.47,1:45:33.91,*ENG,1157,0,0,0,,- Today he's no more a Death Eater than I am. - Snape remains faithful to the Dark Lord!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.07,1:45:36.37,*ENG,1158,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.98,1:45:40.41,*ENG,1159,0,0,0,,Unless the witness possesses any genuine name of consequence...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.58,1:45:42.71,*ENG,1160,0,0,0,,...this session is now concluded.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.88,1:45:44.98,*ENG,1161,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.89,1:45:47.35,*ENG,1162,0,0,0,,I've heard about one more.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.52,1:45:50.08,*ENG,1163,0,0,0,,- What's that? - The name.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.26,1:45:51.72,*ENG,1164,0,0,0,,- Yes? - I know for a fact...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.89,1:45:53.92,*ENG,1165,0,0,0,,...this person took part in the capture...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.09,1:45:56.25,*ENG,1166,0,0,0,,...and, by means of the Cruciatus Curse...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.43,1:45:59.92,*ENG,1167,0,0,0,,...torture of the Auror Frank Longbottom and his wife!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.10,1:46:02.43,*ENG,1168,0,0,0,,The name. Give me the wretched name!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.60,1:46:05.13,*ENG,1169,0,0,0,,Barty Crouch...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.84,1:46:08.86,*ENG,1170,0,0,0,,...Junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.35,1:46:20.05,*ENG,1171,0,0,0,,Hold him down!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.69,1:46:27.32,*ENG,1172,0,0,0,,Get your filthy hands off me, you pathetic little men!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.03,1:46:30.62,*ENG,1173,0,0,0,,Hello, Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.03,1:46:34.09,*ENG,1174,0,0,0,,You are no son of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.41,1:46:49.87,*ENG,1175,0,0,0,,Curiosity is not a sin, Harry. But you should exercise caution.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.25,1:46:52.65,*ENG,1176,0,0,0,,It's a Pensieve.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.82,1:46:57.48,*ENG,1177,0,0,0,,Very useful if, like me, you find your mind a wee bit stretched.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.66,1:47:01.18,*ENG,1178,0,0,0,,It allows me to see once more things I've already seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.66,1:47:04.63,*ENG,1179,0,0,0,,You see, Harry, I have searched and searched for something...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.80,1:47:06.36,*ENG,1180,0,0,0,,...some small detail...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.77,1:47:09.89,*ENG,1181,0,0,0,,...something I might have overlooked...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.07,1:47:14.27,*ENG,1182,0,0,0,,...something that would explain why these terrible things have happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.07,1:47:18.94,*ENG,1183,0,0,0,,Every time I get close to an answer, it slips away.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.01,1:47:21.60,*ENG,1184,0,0,0,,It's maddening.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.95,1:47:25.71,*ENG,1185,0,0,0,,Sir? Mr. Crouch's son.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.49,1:47:28.55,*ENG,1186,0,0,0,,What exactly happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.72,1:47:33.52,*ENG,1187,0,0,0,,He was sent to Azkaban. Destroyed Barty to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.19,1:47:37.79,*ENG,1188,0,0,0,,But he had no choice. The evidence was overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.27,1:47:42.26,*ENG,1189,0,0,0,,- Why do you ask? - It's just that l...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.00,1:47:45.10,*ENG,1190,0,0,0,,I had a dream about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.37,1:47:50.17,*ENG,1191,0,0,0,,It was in the summer, before school.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.31,1:47:55.30,*ENG,1192,0,0,0,,In the dream, I was in a house.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.52,1:48:00.28,*ENG,1193,0,0,0,,And Voldemort was there, only he wasn 't quite human.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.45,1:48:04.08,*ENG,1194,0,0,0,,And Wormtail was there too. And Mr. Crouch 's son.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.46,1:48:07.29,*ENG,1195,0,0,0,,- Have there been others like this dream? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.13,1:48:09.75,*ENG,1196,0,0,0,,Always the same one.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.80,1:48:15.13,*ENG,1197,0,0,0,,Sir, these dreams...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.30,1:48:20.50,*ENG,1198,0,0,0,,...what I see, you don ' t think it' s actually happening, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.14,1:48:25.11,*ENG,1199,0,0,0,,I think it's unwise for you to linger over these dreams, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.61,1:48:27.58,*ENG,1200,0,0,0,,I think it's best if you simply...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.22,1:48:34.98,*ENG,1201,0,0,0,,...cast them away.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.26,1:48:48.22,*ENG,1202,0,0,0,,It's a sign, Severus. You know what it means as well as l.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.94,1:48:58.14,*ENG,1203,0,0,0,,Potter!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.31,1:49:00.84,*ENG,1204,0,0,0,,What's your hurry?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.95,1:49:09.72,*ENG,1205,0,0,0,,Congratulations, your performance in the Black Lake was inspiring.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.89,1:49:12.15,*ENG,1206,0,0,0,,Gillyweed, am I correct?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.93,1:49:14.45,*ENG,1207,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.39,1:49:16.79,*ENG,1208,0,0,0,,Ingenious.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.63,1:49:22.59,*ENG,1209,0,0,0,,A rather rare herb, gillyweed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.40,1:49:26.89,*ENG,1210,0,0,0,,Not something found in your everyday garden.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.61,1:49:30.54,*ENG,1211,0,0,0,,Nor is this.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.75,1:49:36.41,*ENG,1212,0,0,0,,Know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.72,1:49:39.15,*ENG,1213,0,0,0,,Bubble juice, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.72,1:49:41.62,*ENG,1214,0,0,0,,Veritaserum.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.36,1:49:46.05,*ENG,1215,0,0,0,,Three drops of this and You-Know-Who himself would spill his darkest secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.23,1:49:51.39,*ENG,1216,0,0,0,,The use of it on a student is, regrettably, forbidden. However...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.06,1:49:55.09,*ENG,1217,0,0,0,,...should you ever steal from my personal stores again...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.27,1:50:00.14,*ENG,1218,0,0,0,,...my hand might just slip over your morning pumpkin juice.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.31,1:50:04.71,*ENG,1219,0,0,0,,- I haven't stolen anything. - Don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.85,1:50:11.55,*ENG,1220,0,0,0,,Gillyweed may be innocuous, but boomslang skin, lacewing flies?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.25,1:50:15.58,*ENG,1221,0,0,0,,You and your little friends are brewing Polyjuice Potion, and believe me...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.76,1:50:17.95,*ENG,1222,0,0,0,,...I'm going to find out why!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.78,1:50:46.38,*ENG,1223,0,0,0,,- Yeah! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.57,1:51:07.10,*ENG,1224,0,0,0,,Sonorus!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.34,1:51:16.68,*ENG,1225,0,0,0,,Earlier today, Professor Moody placed the Triwizard Cup deep within the maze.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.85,1:51:21.81,*ENG,1226,0,0,0,,Only he knows its exact position. Now, as Mr. Diggory...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.92,1:51:25.72,*ENG,1227,0,0,0,,...and Mr. Potter...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.59,1:51:29.32,*ENG,1228,0,0,0,,...are tied for first position...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.50,1:51:33.63,*ENG,1229,0,0,0,,...they will be the first to enter the maze, followed by Mr. Krum...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.87,1:51:38.33,*ENG,1230,0,0,0,,- ...and Miss Delacour. - Come on! Krum! Krum! Krum!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.21,1:51:42.30,*ENG,1231,0,0,0,,The first person to touch the cup will be the winner!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.65,1:51:49.38,*ENG,1232,0,0,0,,I've instructed the staff to patrol the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.55,1:51:52.48,*ENG,1233,0,0,0,,Should, at any point, a contestant wish to withdraw from the task...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.65,1:51:57.15,*ENG,1234,0,0,0,,...he or she need only send up red sparks with their wands.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.49,1:52:01.39,*ENG,1235,0,0,0,,Contestants! Gather around. Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.53,1:52:08.86,*ENG,1236,0,0,0,,In the maze, you'll find no dragons or creatures of the deep.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.04,1:52:12.40,*ENG,1237,0,0,0,,Instead, you'll face something even more challenging.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.57,1:52:15.60,*ENG,1238,0,0,0,,You see, people change in the maze.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.78,1:52:17.47,*ENG,1239,0,0,0,,Oh, find the cup if you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.64,1:52:22.41,*ENG,1240,0,0,0,,But be very wary, you could just lose yourselves along the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.88,1:52:26.88,*ENG,1241,0,0,0,,Champions, prepare yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.93,1:52:37.40,*ENG,1242,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.80,1:52:39.73,*ENG,1243,0,0,0,,- My boy. - See you later, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.10,1:52:44.70,*ENG,1244,0,0,0,,On the count of three. One...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.48,1:56:13.71,*ENG,1245,0,0,0,,Fleur?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.38,1:56:16.81,*ENG,1246,0,0,0,,Fleur.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.39,1:56:22.22,*ENG,1247,0,0,0,,Periculum!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.89,1:57:02.36,*ENG,1248,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.93,1:57:04.66,*ENG,1249,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.30,1:57:06.53,*ENG,1250,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.14,1:57:19.34,*ENG,1251,0,0,0,,No, don't! Stop! He's bewitched, Cedric!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.51,1:57:21.57,*ENG,1252,0,0,0,,- Get off me! - He's bewitched!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.19,1:57:34.89,*ENG,1253,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.78,1:57:57.54,*ENG,1254,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.85,1:58:01.51,*ENG,1255,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.89,1:58:05.32,*ENG,1256,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.79,1:58:09.35,*ENG,1257,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.33,1:58:13.13,*ENG,1258,0,0,0,,Reducto!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.92,1:58:32.41,*ENG,1259,0,0,0,,- Thanks. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.82,1:58:37.52,*ENG,1260,0,0,0,,You know, for a moment there, I thought you were gonna let it get me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.69,1:58:39.42,*ENG,1261,0,0,0,,For a moment, so did l.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.29,1:58:42.45,*ENG,1262,0,0,0,,Some game, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.50,1:58:44.89,*ENG,1263,0,0,0,,Some game.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.34,1:58:51.96,*ENG,1264,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.11,1:59:05.14,*ENG,1265,0,0,0,,Go on, take it. You saved me, take it!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.32,1:59:07.31,*ENG,1266,0,0,0,,- Together. One, two... - Two...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.49,1:59:08.71,*ENG,1267,0,0,0,,- ...three! - ...three!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.17,1:59:24.10,*ENG,1268,0,0,0,,- You okay? - Yeah. You?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.18,1:59:32.51,*ENG,1269,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.22,1:59:39.84,*ENG,1270,0,0,0,,I've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.49,1:59:45.08,*ENG,1271,0,0,0,,It's a Portkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.86,1:59:51.13,*ENG,1272,0,0,0,,- Harry, the cup is a Portkey. - I've been here before, in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.20,1:59:56.60,*ENG,1273,0,0,0,,Cedric! We have to get back to the cup. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.77,1:59:58.74,*ENG,1274,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.98,2:00:06.88,*ENG,1275,0,0,0,,- Harry! What is it? - Get back to the cup!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.52,2:00:16.85,*ENG,1276,0,0,0,,- Who are you? What do you want? - Kill the spare.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.02,2:00:19.79,*ENG,1277,0,0,0,,- Avada Kedavra! - No! Cedric!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.10,2:00:32.97,*ENG,1278,0,0,0,,Do it! Now!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.92,2:00:47.41,*ENG,1279,0,0,0,,Bone of the father...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.59,2:00:49.88,*ENG,1280,0,0,0,,...unwillingly given.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.36,2:01:00.39,*ENG,1281,0,0,0,,Flesh of the servant...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.43,2:01:05.60,*ENG,1282,0,0,0,,...willingly sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.71,2:01:13.44,*ENG,1283,0,0,0,,And blood of the enemy...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.25,2:01:21.74,*ENG,1284,0,0,0,,...forcibly taken.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.79,2:01:30.76,*ENG,1285,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord shall rise...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.53,2:01:33.46,*ENG,1286,0,0,0,,...again.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.86,2:02:40.26,*ENG,1287,0,0,0,,My wand, Wormtail.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.81,2:02:51.78,*ENG,1288,0,0,0,,Hold out your arm.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.94,2:02:53.54,*ENG,1289,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.71,2:02:56.34,*ENG,1290,0,0,0,,Thank you, master.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.52,2:02:57.98,*ENG,1291,0,0,0,,The other arm, Wormtail.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.62,2:03:40.52,*ENG,1292,0,0,0,,Welcome, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.93,2:03:44.69,*ENG,1293,0,0,0,,Thirteen years it's been, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.33,2:03:50.83,*ENG,1294,0,0,0,,...here you stand before me as though it were only yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.77,2:03:54.71,*ENG,1295,0,0,0,,I confess myself...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.17,2:03:56.73,*ENG,1296,0,0,0,,...disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.41,2:03:59.50,*ENG,1297,0,0,0,,Not one of you tried to find me.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.68,2:04:03.05,*ENG,1298,0,0,0,,Crabbe! Macnair!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.95,2:04:05.28,*ENG,1299,0,0,0,,Goyle!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.79,2:04:09.41,*ENG,1300,0,0,0,,Not even you...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.29,2:04:15.23,*ENG,1301,0,0,0,,...Lucius.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.06,2:04:21.90,*ENG,1302,0,0,0,,My Lord, had I detected any sign, a whisper of your whereabouts...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.07,2:04:25.06,*ENG,1303,0,0,0,,There were signs, my slippery friend. And more than whispers.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.24,2:04:30.40,*ENG,1304,0,0,0,,I assure you, my Lord, I have never renounced the old ways.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.11,2:04:37.74,*ENG,1305,0,0,0,,The face I have been obliged to present each day since your absence...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.75,2:04:42.38,*ENG,1306,0,0,0,,...that is my true mask.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.75,2:04:44.31,*ENG,1307,0,0,0,,I returned.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.79,2:04:50.69,*ENG,1308,0,0,0,,Out of fear, not loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.83,2:04:57.60,*ENG,1309,0,0,0,,Still, you have proved yourself useful these past few months, Wormtail.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.81,2:05:05.14,*ENG,1310,0,0,0,,Thank you, master.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.74,2:05:07.47,*ENG,1311,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.58,2:05:12.95,*ENG,1312,0,0,0,,- Such a handsome boy. - Don't touch him!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.42,2:05:15.91,*ENG,1313,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.09,2:05:18.89,*ENG,1314,0,0,0,,I'd almost forgotten you were here.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.06,2:05:23.46,*ENG,1315,0,0,0,,Standing on the bones of my father. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.63,2:05:24.99,*ENG,1316,0,0,0,,I'd introduce you...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.16,2:05:29.46,*ENG,1317,0,0,0,,...but word has it you're almost as famous as me these days.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.14,2:05:34.80,*ENG,1318,0,0,0,,The boy who lived.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.97,2:05:37.87,*ENG,1319,0,0,0,,How lies have fed your legend, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.04,2:05:42.04,*ENG,1320,0,0,0,,Shall I reveal what really happened that night 13 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.21,2:05:46.95,*ENG,1321,0,0,0,,Shall I divulge how I truly lost my powers?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.12,2:05:48.71,*ENG,1322,0,0,0,,Yes, shall l?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.05,2:05:50.39,*ENG,1323,0,0,0,,It was love.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.56,2:05:55.05,*ENG,1324,0,0,0,,You see, when dear, sweet Lily Potter gave her life for her only son...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.23,2:05:57.82,*ENG,1325,0,0,0,,...she provided the ultimate protection.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.23,2:06:00.03,*ENG,1326,0,0,0,,I could not touch him.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.27,2:06:03.39,*ENG,1327,0,0,0,,It was old magic.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.57,2:06:05.83,*ENG,1328,0,0,0,,Something I should have foreseen.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.00,2:06:07.80,*ENG,1329,0,0,0,,But no matter, no matter.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.97,2:06:10.17,*ENG,1330,0,0,0,,Things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.94,2:06:14.43,*ENG,1331,0,0,0,,I can touch you...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.05,2:06:16.78,*ENG,1332,0,0,0,,...now.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.92,2:06:26.25,*ENG,1333,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.60,2:06:36.29,*ENG,1334,0,0,0,,Astonishing what a few drops of your blood will do, eh, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.44,2:06:39.16,*ENG,1335,0,0,0,,Pick up your wand, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.77,2:06:43.00,*ENG,1336,0,0,0,,I said, pick it up! Get up! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.58,2:06:46.91,*ENG,1337,0,0,0,,You've been taught how to duel, I presume, yes?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.08,2:06:49.51,*ENG,1338,0,0,0,,First, we bow to each other.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.68,2:06:52.05,*ENG,1339,0,0,0,,Come on, now, Harry. The niceties must be observed.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.22,2:06:55.45,*ENG,1340,0,0,0,,Dumbledore wouldn't want you to forget your manners, would he?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.62,2:06:56.95,*ENG,1341,0,0,0,,I said, bow.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.82,2:07:03.16,*ENG,1342,0,0,0,,- That's better. And now... - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.56,2:07:05.43,*ENG,1343,0,0,0,,Crucio!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.90,2:07:09.63,*ENG,1344,0,0,0,,Crucio!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.70,2:07:12.64,*ENG,1345,0,0,0,,Attaboy, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.80,2:07:14.93,*ENG,1346,0,0,0,,Your parents would be proud.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.24,2:07:18.64,*ENG,1347,0,0,0,,Especially your filthy Muggle mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.81,2:07:20.40,*ENG,1348,0,0,0,,Expelliar...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.42,2:07:25.82,*ENG,1349,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill you, Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.98,2:07:27.98,*ENG,1350,0,0,0,,I'm going to destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.19,2:07:35.75,*ENG,1351,0,0,0,,After tonight, no one will ever again question my powers.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.39,2:07:38.95,*ENG,1352,0,0,0,,After tonight, if they speak of you...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.13,2:07:41.79,*ENG,1353,0,0,0,,...they'll speak only of how you...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.10,2:07:43.93,*ENG,1354,0,0,0,,...begged for death.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.10,2:07:47.87,*ENG,1355,0,0,0,,And l, being a merciful Lord...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.41,2:07:50.00,*ENG,1356,0,0,0,,...obliged.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.34,2:07:51.83,*ENG,1357,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.85,2:07:58.82,*ENG,1358,0,0,0,,Don't you turn your back on me, Harry Potter!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.98,2:08:01.25,*ENG,1359,0,0,0,,I want you to look at me when I kill you!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.42,2:08:04.62,*ENG,1360,0,0,0,,I want to see the light leave your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.57,2:08:20.30,*ENG,1361,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.34,2:08:23.74,*ENG,1362,0,0,0,,- Expelliarmus! - Avada Kedavra!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.26,2:08:43.92,*ENG,1363,0,0,0,,Do nothing! He's mine to finish!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.50,2:08:50.20,*ENG,1364,0,0,0,,He's mine!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.27,2:09:27.26,*ENG,1365,0,0,0,,Harry, when the connection is broken, you must get to the Portkey.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.44,2:09:29.50,*ENG,1366,0,0,0,,We can linger for a moment to give you some time...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.67,2:09:31.44,*ENG,1367,0,0,0,,...but only a moment. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.64,2:09:35.67,*ENG,1368,0,0,0,,Harry, take my body back, will you?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.85,2:09:38.37,*ENG,1369,0,0,0,,Take my body back to my father.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.42,2:09:40.75,*ENG,1370,0,0,0,,Let go.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.22,2:09:43.19,*ENG,1371,0,0,0,,Sweetheart, you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:44.02,2:09:46.65,*ENG,1372,0,0,0,,Let go! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.40,2:09:53.76,*ENG,1373,0,0,0,,Accio!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.47,2:10:01.46,*ENG,1374,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.22,2:10:15.81,*ENG,1375,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.06,2:10:18.72,*ENG,1376,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.49,2:10:22.98,*ENG,1377,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.20,2:10:27.43,*ENG,1378,0,0,0,,No! No! No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.73,2:10:29.60,*ENG,1379,0,0,0,,For God's sake, Dumbledore, what's happened?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.90,2:10:32.46,*ENG,1380,0,0,0,,He's back. He's back.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.64,2:10:34.66,*ENG,1381,0,0,0,,Voldemort's back.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.84,2:10:37.24,*ENG,1382,0,0,0,,Cedric, he asked me to bring his body back.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.41,2:10:39.74,*ENG,1383,0,0,0,,I couldn't leave him, not there.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.91,2:10:42.71,*ENG,1384,0,0,0,,It's all right, Harry. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.88,2:10:45.18,*ENG,1385,0,0,0,,He's home. You both are.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.35,2:10:48.98,*ENG,1386,0,0,0,,Keep everybody in their seats. A boy has just been killed.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.06,2:10:55.72,*ENG,1387,0,0,0,,The body must be moved, Dumbledore. There are too many people.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.99,2:10:57.69,*ENG,1388,0,0,0,,Let me through.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.86,2:10:59.39,*ENG,1389,0,0,0,,Let me through!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:01.30,2:11:02.56,*ENG,1390,0,0,0,,Let me through!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.73,2:11:04.13,*ENG,1391,0,0,0,,That's my son!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.44,2:11:06.87,*ENG,1392,0,0,0,,That's my boy!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:09.71,2:11:12.44,*ENG,1393,0,0,0,,It's my boy!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:15.25,2:11:18.81,*ENG,1394,0,0,0,,- Come on. Get up. Easy, easy! - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.98,2:11:21.95,*ENG,1395,0,0,0,,This is not where you want to be right now. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:22.62,2:11:24.82,*ENG,1396,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.89,2:11:30.29,*ENG,1397,0,0,0,,It's all right, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.46,2:11:33.79,*ENG,1398,0,0,0,,I got you. Come on. Easy, now.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.80,2:11:39.60,*ENG,1399,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.71,2:11:42.57,*ENG,1400,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:24.98,2:12:26.68,*ENG,1401,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:27.25,2:12:29.19,*ENG,1402,0,0,0,,Does it hurt? That?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.35,2:12:31.15,*ENG,1403,0,0,0,,Not so much now.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.09,2:12:34.18,*ENG,1404,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'd better take a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.33,2:12:39.32,*ENG,1405,0,0,0,,The cup was a Portkey.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.03,2:12:43.86,*ENG,1406,0,0,0,,Someone had bewitched it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.14,2:12:46.23,*ENG,1407,0,0,0,,What was it like?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.57,2:12:48.23,*ENG,1408,0,0,0,,- What was he like? - Who?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:48.41,2:12:50.17,*ENG,1409,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.48,2:12:55.57,*ENG,1410,0,0,0,,What was it like to stand in his presence?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.85,2:12:58.65,*ENG,1411,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.49,2:13:04.42,*ENG,1412,0,0,0,,It was like I'd fallen into one of my dreams...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.39,2:13:09.38,*ENG,1413,0,0,0,,...into one of my nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.11,2:13:29.67,*ENG,1414,0,0,0,,Were there others?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.85,2:13:32.11,*ENG,1415,0,0,0,,In the graveyard, were there others?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.05,2:13:37.45,*ENG,1416,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.16,2:13:42.09,*ENG,1417,0,0,0,,I don't think I said anything about a graveyard, professor.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.53,2:13:52.80,*ENG,1418,0,0,0,,"Marvelous creatures, dragons, aren't they? "
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.21,2:14:00.27,*ENG,1419,0,0,0,,Did you think that miserable oaf would've led you into the woods...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:00.45,2:14:02.35,*ENG,1420,0,0,0,,...if I hadn't suggested it?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:05.88,2:14:09.58,*ENG,1421,0,0,0,,Do you think Cedric Diggory would've told you to open the egg underwater...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.75,2:14:12.25,*ENG,1422,0,0,0,,...if I hadn't told him first myself?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.86,2:14:16.52,*ENG,1423,0,0,0,,Did you think Neville Longbottom, the witless wonder...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.69,2:14:19.89,*ENG,1424,0,0,0,,...could've provided you with gillyweed if I hadn't given him the book...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:20.06,2:14:21.62,*ENG,1425,0,0,0,,...that led him straight to it?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:30.04,2:14:34.03,*ENG,1426,0,0,0,,It was you from the beginning. You put my name in the Goblet of Fire.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.61,2:14:38.24,*ENG,1427,0,0,0,,- You bewitched Krum, but you... - "But... But..."
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.42,2:14:40.58,*ENG,1428,0,0,0,,You won because I made it so, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.22,2:14:44.71,*ENG,1429,0,0,0,,You ended up in that graveyard tonight because it was meant to be so.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.89,2:14:46.19,*ENG,1430,0,0,0,,And now the deed is done.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.86,2:14:52.19,*ENG,1431,0,0,0,,The blood that runs through these veins runs within the Dark Lord.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.71,2:15:04.20,*ENG,1432,0,0,0,,Imagine how he will reward me when he learns...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.14,2:15:07.63,*ENG,1433,0,0,0,,...that I have once and for all...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.25,2:15:12.58,*ENG,1434,0,0,0,,...silenced the great Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.75,2:15:14.01,*ENG,1435,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.72,2:15:19.99,*ENG,1436,0,0,0,,Severus.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.46,2:15:23.95,*ENG,1437,0,0,0,,That's it, take it.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.93,2:15:29.39,*ENG,1438,0,0,0,,- Do you know who I am? - Albus Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.57,2:15:32.26,*ENG,1439,0,0,0,,- Are you Alastor Moody? Are you? - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.44,2:15:35.53,*ENG,1440,0,0,0,,Is he in this room? Is he in this room?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.58,2:15:40.10,*ENG,1441,0,0,0,,Harry, away from there!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:01.10,2:16:04.43,*ENG,1442,0,0,0,,- You all right, Alastor? - I'm sorry, Albus.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.40,2:16:07.46,*ENG,1443,0,0,0,,That's Moody. But then who's...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.27,2:16:10.37,*ENG,1444,0,0,0,,Polyjuice Potion.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.54,2:16:13.77,*ENG,1445,0,0,0,,Now we know who's been stealing from your stores, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.01,2:16:15.95,*ENG,1446,0,0,0,,We'll get you up in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.38,2:16:51.78,*ENG,1447,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.45,2:16:57.65,*ENG,1448,0,0,0,,Barty Crouch Junior.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:57.89,2:17:00.82,*ENG,1449,0,0,0,,I'll show you mine if you show me yours.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.19,2:17:04.39,*ENG,1450,0,0,0,,Your arm, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.77,2:17:11.00,*ENG,1451,0,0,0,,You know what this means, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.90,2:17:13.23,*ENG,1452,0,0,0,,He's back.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.44,2:17:16.57,*ENG,1453,0,0,0,,Lord Voldemort has returned.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.51,2:17:19.84,*ENG,1454,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir. I couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.04,2:17:24.57,*ENG,1455,0,0,0,,Send an owl to Azkaban. I think they'll find they're missing a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:25.05,2:17:27.54,*ENG,1456,0,0,0,,- I'll be welcomed back like a hero. - Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:28.12,2:17:30.99,*ENG,1457,0,0,0,,Personally, I've never had much time for heroes.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:50.88,2:17:53.54,*ENG,1458,0,0,0,,Today, we acknowledge...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:54.25,2:17:57.01,*ENG,1459,0,0,0,,...a really terrible loss.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:59.12,2:18:01.88,*ENG,1460,0,0,0,,Cedric Diggory was, as you all know...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.05,2:18:04.39,*ENG,1461,0,0,0,,...exceptionally hard-working...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:05.29,2:18:07.66,*ENG,1462,0,0,0,,...infinitely fair-minded...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:08.23,2:18:10.52,*ENG,1463,0,0,0,,...and, most importantly...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:10.83,2:18:15.39,*ENG,1464,0,0,0,,...a fierce, fierce friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:16.53,2:18:20.90,*ENG,1465,0,0,0,,Now, I think, therefore, you have the right to know exactly how he died.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:23.94,2:18:25.47,*ENG,1466,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:26.31,2:18:28.40,*ENG,1467,0,0,0,,...Cedric Diggory was murdered...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.31,2:18:31.30,*ENG,1468,0,0,0,,...by Lord Voldemort!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:33.22,2:18:36.78,*ENG,1469,0,0,0,,The Ministry of Magic does not wish me to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.42,2:18:41.12,*ENG,1470,0,0,0,,But not to do so, I think, would be an insult to his memory.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.29,2:18:44.96,*ENG,1471,0,0,0,,Now, the pain...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:45.13,2:18:48.79,*ENG,1472,0,0,0,,...we all feel at this dreadful loss reminds me...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.97,2:18:50.30,*ENG,1473,0,0,0,,...and reminds us...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.47,2:18:54.17,*ENG,1474,0,0,0,,...that while we may come from different places and speak in different tongues...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.34,2:18:57.77,*ENG,1475,0,0,0,,...our hearts beat as one.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.28,2:19:00.30,*ENG,1476,0,0,0,,In light of recent events...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:00.65,2:19:05.58,*ENG,1477,0,0,0,,...the bonds of friendship we've made this year will be more important than ever.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:06.45,2:19:11.79,*ENG,1478,0,0,0,,Remember that, and Cedric Diggory will not have died in vain.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.22,2:19:14.35,*ENG,1479,0,0,0,,You remember that...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:14.96,2:19:17.99,*ENG,1480,0,0,0,,...and we'll celebrate a boy who was...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:18.53,2:19:21.00,*ENG,1481,0,0,0,,...kind and honest...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:21.50,2:19:26.10,*ENG,1482,0,0,0,,...and brave and true, right to the very end.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.33,2:19:53.35,*ENG,1483,0,0,0,,I never liked these curtains.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.96,2:19:56.63,*ENG,1484,0,0,0,,Set them on fire in my fourth year.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.97,2:19:58.80,*ENG,1485,0,0,0,,By accident, of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:04.48,2:20:08.84,*ENG,1486,0,0,0,,I put you in terrible danger this year, Harry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.25,2:20:13.94,*ENG,1487,0,0,0,,Professor...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:14.15,2:20:17.14,*ENG,1488,0,0,0,,...when I was in the graveyard, there was a moment...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.96,2:20:22.36,*ENG,1489,0,0,0,,...when Voldemort's wand and mine sort of connected.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.93,2:20:26.26,*ENG,1490,0,0,0,,Priori Incantatem.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.40,2:20:33.13,*ENG,1491,0,0,0,,You saw your parents that night, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.70,2:20:35.54,*ENG,1492,0,0,0,,They reappeared.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.01,2:20:40.77,*ENG,1493,0,0,0,,No spell can reawaken the dead, Harry. I trust you know that.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.35,2:20:45.94,*ENG,1494,0,0,0,,Dark and difficult times lie ahead.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.42,2:20:51.25,*ENG,1495,0,0,0,,Soon we must all face the choice between what is right and what is easy.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.63,2:20:56.29,*ENG,1496,0,0,0,,But remember this:
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.46,2:20:58.39,*ENG,1497,0,0,0,,You have friends here.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.40,2:21:02.16,*ENG,1498,0,0,0,,You're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:22.85,2:21:24.58,*ENG,1499,0,0,0,,Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:24.99,2:21:26.98,*ENG,1500,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.59,2:21:29.79,*ENG,1501,0,0,0,,Write to me. Promise.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.90,2:21:32.29,*ENG,1502,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:38.54,2:21:40.47,*ENG,1503,0,0,0,,Au revoir, Ron.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:24.42,2:22:26.94,*ENG,1504,0,0,0,,Do you think we'll ever just have a quiet year at Hogwarts?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:27.12,2:22:28.24,*ENG,1505,0,0,0,,- No. - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.42,2:22:32.79,*ENG,1506,0,0,0,,No, I didn't think so. Oh, well. What's life without a few dragons?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.19,2:22:40.03,*ENG,1507,0,0,0,,Everything's going to change now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.34,2:22:48.81,*ENG,1508,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:53.54,2:22:56.84,*ENG,1509,0,0,0,,Promise you'll write this summer. Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:57.01,2:22:59.57,*ENG,1510,0,0,0,,I won't. You know I won't.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:00.85,2:23:04.62,*ENG,1511,0,0,0,,- Harry will, won't you? - Yeah. Every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:01:13.10,*CHS,1,0,0,0,,《哈利波特与火焰杯》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.15,0:01:50.55,*CHS,2,0,0,0,,该死的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:40.66,*CHS,3,0,0,0,,你怎么变得这么挑剔了，虫尾巴？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:45.24,*CHS,4,0,0,0,,如果我没记错 你不久前还以阴沟为家呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:50.61,*CHS,5,0,0,0,,是你伺候我觉得烦了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.25,*CHS,6,0,0,0,,哦，不，不，伏地魔主人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:54.68,*CHS,7,0,0,0,,我只是说...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:02:57.82,*CHS,8,0,0,0,,...或许我们没有那个男孩也行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:00.39,*CHS,9,0,0,0,,不，那男孩就是一切！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:04.08,*CHS,10,0,0,0,,没他成不了事 肯定会成功的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:06.92,*CHS,11,0,0,0,,就和我说的一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.40,0:03:11.03,*CHS,12,0,0,0,,- 我不会让你失望的，主人 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:14.26,*CHS,13,0,0,0,,首先，把我们的旧部召来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.44,0:03:16.67,*CHS,14,0,0,0,,给他们发信号
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:31.88,*CHS,15,0,0,0,,娜吉妮告诉我那麻瓜老看门人...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:35.75,*CHS,16,0,0,0,,...正站在门外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.93,0:03:41.23,*CHS,17,0,0,0,,靠边站，虫尾巴 让我好好问候一下我们的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:43.23,*CHS,18,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:49.76,*CHS,19,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.51,0:03:52.17,*CHS,20,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:55.27,*CHS,21,0,0,0,,你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:58.07,*CHS,22,0,0,0,,赫敏...我做了个噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:04:01.62,*CHS,23,0,0,0,,- 你什么时候到的？ - 刚才，你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:03.01,*CHS,24,0,0,0,,昨晚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.19,0:04:05.42,*CHS,25,0,0,0,,醒醒！醒醒，罗纳得！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.59,0:04:06.85,*CHS,26,0,0,0,,真要命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:08.55,*CHS,27,0,0,0,,求求你，穿好衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:11.02,*CHS,28,0,0,0,,别再睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:14.53,*CHS,29,0,0,0,,罗恩，拜托！ 你妈妈说早饭已经准备好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:24.04,*CHS,30,0,0,0,,- 罗恩，咱们这是要去哪？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:27.77,*CHS,31,0,0,0,,- 嘿，老爸，我们这是去哪？ - 我也是云里雾里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.94,0:04:29.47,*CHS,32,0,0,0,,跟上！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:33.88,*CHS,33,0,0,0,,亚瑟！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:36.04,*CHS,34,0,0,0,,你来得可真“准时”啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:40.59,*CHS,35,0,0,0,,抱歉，阿莫斯 有些人今天睡过了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:46.42,*CHS,36,0,0,0,,大伙们，这是阿莫斯·迪戈里 他和我在魔法部共事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:49.12,*CHS,37,0,0,0,,这位从天而降的年轻人肯定是 塞德里克了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:50.46,*CHS,38,0,0,0,,是的，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.63,0:04:52.30,*CHS,39,0,0,0,,这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:57.40,*CHS,40,0,0,0,,天哪！你一定是哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:05:00.30,*CHS,41,0,0,0,,- 是的，先生 - 非常，非常荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:02.27,*CHS,42,0,0,0,,我也是，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:07.58,*CHS,43,0,0,0,,就在那
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:11.65,*CHS,44,0,0,0,,- 开始吧？ - 好唉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:13.02,*CHS,45,0,0,0,,我们可不想迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:17.32,*CHS,46,0,0,0,,快点，该出发了，找好位置
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:20.66,*CHS,47,0,0,0,,他们怎么都围着那个破靴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.83,0:05:23.32,*CHS,48,0,0,0,,- 那可不是个普通的靴子 - 它是“港口钥”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:24.87,*CHS,49,0,0,0,,该出发了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:26.63,*CHS,50,0,0,0,,什么是“港口钥”？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:30.83,*CHS,51,0,0,0,,- 准备好了么？一，二... - 哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:32.10,*CHS,52,0,0,0,,...三！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:44.28,*CHS,53,0,0,0,,孩子们，放手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:47.05,*CHS,54,0,0,0,,- 什么？！ - 放手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:01.66,*CHS,55,0,0,0,,你们肯定七荤八素了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:05.21,*CHS,56,0,0,0,,- 和以往一样，一团糟 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:13.14,*CHS,57,0,0,0,,瞧那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:17.91,*CHS,58,0,0,0,,孩子们，欢迎来到魁地奇世界杯！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:23.55,*CHS,59,0,0,0,,别走散了，跟上，姑娘们！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:26.36,*CHS,60,0,0,0,,看！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:29.53,*CHS,61,0,0,0,,快跟上，姑娘们！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:37.84,*CHS,62,0,0,0,,啊呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:39.87,*CHS,63,0,0,0,,老伙计，我们该分道扬镳了 比赛时见
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:41.44,*CHS,64,0,0,0,,- 比赛时见 - 到时见
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.61,0:06:42.91,*CHS,65,0,0,0,,- 塞德里克 - 塞德里克，来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.77,*CHS,66,0,0,0,,回见，塞德里克
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:51.48,*CHS,67,0,0,0,,欢迎到我们的新家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:54.81,*CHS,68,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:04.13,*CHS,69,0,0,0,,- 棒极了，棒极了 - 金妮，看！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:05.60,*CHS,70,0,0,0,,- 要去厕所的速度 - 看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.77,0:07:08.26,*CHS,71,0,0,0,,姑娘们，挑张床打开行李吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:11.31,*CHS,72,0,0,0,,罗恩，快从厨房里出来，我们都饿着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:13.94,*CHS,73,0,0,0,,- 对，罗恩，从厨房里出来！ - 把脚从桌上放下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.11,0:07:16.37,*CHS,74,0,0,0,,- 把脚从桌上放下来！  - 把脚从桌上放下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:19.81,*CHS,75,0,0,0,,我爱魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.07,0:07:38.56,*CHS,76,0,0,0,,来这里领取魁地奇世界杯时间表！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:41.97,*CHS,77,0,0,0,,老爸，有没有搞错 我们还要朝上走多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.57,*CHS,78,0,0,0,,好吧，我们这样比喻一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:45.54,*CHS,79,0,0,0,,如果下雨...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:48.08,*CHS,80,0,0,0,,...你们肯定最先知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.81,0:07:51.21,*CHS,81,0,0,0,,爸爸和我坐部长包厢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:54.65,*CHS,82,0,0,0,,是康奈利·福吉亲自邀请我们来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:57.01,*CHS,83,0,0,0,,别吹了，德拉科
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:07:59.28,*CHS,84,0,0,0,,和这些人不值
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:04.28,*CHS,85,0,0,0,,会玩得开心的，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.66,0:08:06.49,*CHS,86,0,0,0,,趁自己还有口气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:24.57,*CHS,87,0,0,0,,快来，坐这边 早告诉你们这些位子值得等的了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:26.61,*CHS,88,0,0,0,,快来！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.85,0:08:30.82,*CHS,89,0,0,0,,是爱尔兰队，那是特洛伊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:32.82,*CHS,90,0,0,0,,- 还有米兰！ - 还有姆勒！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:41.40,*CHS,91,0,0,0,,爱尔兰！爱尔兰！爱尔兰！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:48.83,*CHS,92,0,0,0,,- 现在出场的是保加利亚队！ - 是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:56.28,*CHS,93,0,0,0,,那是？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:09:00.07,*CHS,94,0,0,0,,世界上最出色的找球手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:05.65,*CHS,95,0,0,0,,克鲁姆！克鲁姆！克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.39,0:09:11.62,*CHS,96,0,0,0,,克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:13.52,*CHS,97,0,0,0,,好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:23.17,*CHS,98,0,0,0,,晚上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:26.70,*CHS,99,0,0,0,,作为魔法部部长...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:29.97,*CHS,100,0,0,0,,...我很荣幸的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:34.35,*CHS,101,0,0,0,,...欢迎各位...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:40.39,*CHS,102,0,0,0,,...来观看第422届魁地奇世界杯的决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:42.39,*CHS,103,0,0,0,,比赛现在...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.35,*CHS,104,0,0,0,,...开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:52.66,*CHS,105,0,0,0,,克鲁姆！克鲁姆！克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:02.17,*CHS,106,0,0,0,,没人能比上克鲁姆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:03.94,*CHS,107,0,0,0,,- 克鲁姆？ - 冷面克鲁姆？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.11,0:10:07.17,*CHS,108,0,0,0,,他就像一只鸟一样在空中飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:10.25,*CHS,109,0,0,0,,- 他不仅仅是个运动员 - 冷面克鲁姆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:11.82,*CHS,110,0,0,0,,还是个艺术家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:14.25,*CHS,111,0,0,0,,- 我想你爱上他了，罗恩 - 胡说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.42,0:10:15.82,*CHS,112,0,0,0,,威克多尔，我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:17.58,*CHS,113,0,0,0,,威克多尔，我确实爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:20.99,*CHS,114,0,0,0,,当你离开的时候，我的心只为你跳动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:23.83,*CHS,115,0,0,0,,听起来像是爱尔兰人在庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:25.73,*CHS,116,0,0,0,,停，停下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:27.86,*CHS,117,0,0,0,,不是爱尔兰人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:31.17,*CHS,118,0,0,0,,我们得赶快离开这！ 就是现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:35.64,*CHS,119,0,0,0,,快跑啊，食死徒来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.81,0:10:39.18,*CHS,120,0,0,0,,到“港口钥”那里 别走散了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.35,0:10:42.01,*CHS,121,0,0,0,,弗雷德，乔治，金妮由你们来照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:44.32,*CHS,122,0,0,0,,快去！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:46.32,*CHS,123,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:03.30,*CHS,124,0,0,0,,- 大家快跟上！ - 哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.57,0:11:06.70,*CHS,125,0,0,0,,哈利！ 哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:55.85,*CHS,126,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.62,0:12:24.11,*CHS,127,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:28.82,*CHS,128,0,0,0,,- 你在哪？ - 哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:32.69,*CHS,129,0,0,0,,我们找你好久了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.80,0:12:35.63,*CHS,130,0,0,0,,还以为把你给丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:38.42,*CHS,131,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:43.60,*CHS,132,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:45.10,*CHS,133,0,0,0,,停手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:47.51,*CHS,134,0,0,0,,是我儿子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.55,0:12:51.21,*CHS,135,0,0,0,,- 罗恩，哈利，赫敏，你们没事吧？ - 我们是回来找哈利的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:52.68,*CHS,136,0,0,0,,这是你们中的谁施的魔法？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:55.01,*CHS,137,0,0,0,,- 克劳奇，你不会... - 不要撒谎！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:57.18,*CHS,138,0,0,0,,你们在犯罪现场被发现
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:12:59.38,*CHS,139,0,0,0,,- 犯罪？ - 巴蒂，他们只是孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:01.05,*CHS,140,0,0,0,,什么罪？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:03.72,*CHS,141,0,0,0,,哈利，这是黑魔标记，是“他”的标记
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:05.05,*CHS,142,0,0,0,,难道是伏地魔？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:10.10,*CHS,143,0,0,0,,今天晚上那些戴着面具的人 是他的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:12.50,*CHS,144,0,0,0,,- 他的追随者？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.57,*CHS,145,0,0,0,,食死徒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.31,0:13:19.33,*CHS,146,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 - 还有另外一个人，就刚才
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.81,0:13:21.17,*CHS,147,0,0,0,,那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.34,0:13:23.64,*CHS,148,0,0,0,,都和我到这边来！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:25.81,*CHS,149,0,0,0,,一个人？哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.58,*CHS,150,0,0,0,,什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:29.78,*CHS,151,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.62,*CHS,152,0,0,0,,我没看见他的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.87,0:13:51.86,*CHS,153,0,0,0,,卖糖果咯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:57.11,*CHS,154,0,0,0,,卖糖果咯？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.05,0:14:02.78,*CHS,155,0,0,0,,亲爱的，要什么糖果么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.95,0:14:05.15,*CHS,156,0,0,0,,一包糖和...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:07.12,*CHS,157,0,0,0,,...一根甘草棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.59,0:14:10.65,*CHS,158,0,0,0,,我改主意了，只要糖就好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:14.82,*CHS,159,0,0,0,,- 没关系，我帮你给钱 - 只要糖，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:18.50,*CHS,160,0,0,0,,两个南瓜甜饼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.87,0:14:25.50,*CHS,161,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:28.34,*CHS,162,0,0,0,,亲爱的，要吃糖么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:31.51,*CHS,163,0,0,0,,哦，不，我不饿，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.44,*CHS,164,0,0,0,,卖糖果咯？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:36.64,*CHS,165,0,0,0,,真糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:39.75,*CHS,166,0,0,0,,魔法部怎么会不知道这是谁干的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:41.69,*CHS,167,0,0,0,,难道没有保安？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:44.66,*CHS,168,0,0,0,,据老爸讲很多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:48.79,*CHS,169,0,0,0,,这事就在他们眼皮底下发生 所以他们才这么担心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:54.84,*CHS,170,0,0,0,,你的疤又疼了，是么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:56.67,*CHS,171,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:01.61,*CHS,172,0,0,0,,小天狼星肯定想知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.78,0:15:05.74,*CHS,173,0,0,0,,...世界杯上发生的事还有你的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:13.74,*CHS,174,0,0,0,,(小天狼星布莱克收)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:17.39,*CHS,175,0,0,0,,海德薇，去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:15:58.86,*CHS,176,0,0,0,,跑道畅通！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:07.04,*CHS,177,0,0,0,,哇，这可不是天天都能看见的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.03,0:16:35.94,*CHS,178,0,0,0,,现在我们都坐下了 我想宣布一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:40.34,*CHS,179,0,0,0,,这座城堡今年将不仅仅是你们的家...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:43.67,*CHS,180,0,0,0,,...也会是一些特殊客人的家
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:46.67,*CHS,181,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨被选中...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.62,0:16:49.11,*CHS,182,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:50.68,*CHS,183,0,0,0,,到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:56.36,*CHS,184,0,0,0,,让他们等等，稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:17:02.50,*CHS,185,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨被选中来举办一项传奇性的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:04.72,*CHS,186,0,0,0,,“三强争霸赛”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:07.33,*CHS,187,0,0,0,,- 有人可能不清楚 - 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:10.67,*CHS,188,0,0,0,,...三强争霸赛 是一个由三所学校参加的...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:12.97,*CHS,189,0,0,0,,...系列魔法竞赛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:16.67,*CHS,190,0,0,0,,每个学校派出一名学生参赛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:18.54,*CHS,191,0,0,0,,特别注意的是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.71,0:17:21.65,*CHS,192,0,0,0,,若被选出就要靠你自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:23.75,*CHS,193,0,0,0,,我说你们可别不信...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:26.89,*CHS,194,0,0,0,,...胆小的人不宜参赛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.19,0:17:31.52,*CHS,195,0,0,0,,详情我们等会再说 现在请和我一起欢迎...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.69,0:17:35.72,*CHS,196,0,0,0,,...布斯巴顿魔法学院可爱的女士们...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:39.89,*CHS,197,0,0,0,,..和她们的女校长，马克西姆夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:54.01,*CHS,198,0,0,0,,老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:04.19,*CHS,199,0,0,0,,罗恩，这女人块头真大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:28.27,*CHS,200,0,0,0,,现在欢迎来自北方的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:31.28,*CHS,201,0,0,0,,德姆斯特朗的骄子...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.45,0:18:34.29,*CHS,202,0,0,0,,...及他们的校长，伊戈尔·卡卡洛夫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:18:58.90,*CHS,203,0,0,0,,噢，克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:00.55,*CHS,204,0,0,0,,老天，是他！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:02.58,*CHS,205,0,0,0,,威克多尔·克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:12.93,*CHS,206,0,0,0,,阿不思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.10,0:19:14.82,*CHS,207,0,0,0,,伊戈尔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:32.11,*CHS,208,0,0,0,,邓不利多教授，我的马长途跋涉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:34.81,*CHS,209,0,0,0,,- 它们也需要人照料 - 别担心，马克西姆夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:38.51,*CHS,210,0,0,0,,我们的护院，海格 绝对有能力照顾它们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:40.95,*CHS,211,0,0,0,,但海格先生，要知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:43.82,*CHS,212,0,0,0,,...它们只喝麦芽威士忌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:51.73,*CHS,213,0,0,0,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.74,0:19:58.73,*CHS,214,0,0,0,,请注意！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:03.24,*CHS,215,0,0,0,,我想说几句
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.98,0:20:07.04,*CHS,216,0,0,0,,三强争霸赛的胜者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.48,0:20:11.51,*CHS,217,0,0,0,,将得到永恒的荣耀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.69,0:20:15.89,*CHS,218,0,0,0,,但为达此目标，他必须经过三项考验
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:20.02,*CHS,219,0,0,0,,三项非常严峻的考验
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:21.45,*CHS,220,0,0,0,,- 帅啊 - 帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:25.86,*CHS,221,0,0,0,,有鉴于此，部长决定实施一个新规则
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:27.40,*CHS,222,0,0,0,,有请巴蒂·克劳奇先生...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.57,0:20:31.20,*CHS,223,0,0,0,,...国际魔法合作协会会长...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:33.54,*CHS,224,0,0,0,,...为我们解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:50.69,*CHS,225,0,0,0,,真要命，是疯眼汉穆迪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:54.66,*CHS,226,0,0,0,,- 阿拉斯特·穆迪，是个傲罗 - 傲罗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:58.29,*CHS,227,0,0,0,,捉拿黑巫师的人 阿兹卡班监狱里一半的人都是他抓的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:02.10,*CHS,228,0,0,0,,他最近有点神志不清了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:17.65,*CHS,229,0,0,0,,- 老朋友，谢谢你能来 - 这天花板真傻气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:18.91,*CHS,230,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:27.29,*CHS,231,0,0,0,,你们猜他喝的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:30.72,*CHS,232,0,0,0,,不知道，但肯定不是南瓜汁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.71,0:21:39.64,*CHS,233,0,0,0,,经过充分考虑...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.81,0:21:42.71,*CHS,234,0,0,0,,...魔法部决定 为了学生的安全...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:45.85,*CHS,235,0,0,0,,...17岁以下的学生...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:49.75,*CHS,236,0,0,0,,...一律不许参加三强争霸赛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:52.62,*CHS,237,0,0,0,,- 这是最终的决定 - 垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.38,*CHS,238,0,0,0,,垃圾，废话！ 你脑子是不是有病！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:59.29,*CHS,239,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.68,0:22:21.12,*CHS,240,0,0,0,,火焰杯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.68,0:22:24.59,*CHS,241,0,0,0,,想报名参赛的人...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.75,0:22:27.65,*CHS,242,0,0,0,,...必须将自己的名字写在羊皮纸上...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.82,0:22:30.92,*CHS,243,0,0,0,,...于周四晚此时以前丢到火焰里去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.03,0:22:34.26,*CHS,244,0,0,0,,这不是闹着玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.63,0:22:38.19,*CHS,245,0,0,0,,如果被选上就不能回头了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.37,0:22:43.33,*CHS,246,0,0,0,,三强争霸赛从此时开始
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.50,0:23:11.56,*CHS,247,0,0,0,,我叫阿拉斯特·穆迪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:15.13,*CHS,248,0,0,0,,前傲罗...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.84,0:23:19.27,*CHS,249,0,0,0,,...对魔法部不满的人...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.48,0:23:21.88,*CHS,250,0,0,0,,...黑魔法防御课的新老师
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:26.50,*CHS,251,0,0,0,,是邓不利多请我来任教的 废话到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:28.45,*CHS,252,0,0,0,,有什么问题么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.62,0:23:33.35,*CHS,253,0,0,0,,对黑魔法的教学...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.72,0:23:37.39,*CHS,254,0,0,0,,...我认为实践最重要
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:43.26,*CHS,255,0,0,0,,但首先，谁能告诉我 有多少种不可饶恕咒？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.80,0:23:46.13,*CHS,256,0,0,0,,- 三种，先生 - 为什么这么称呼？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.30,0:23:49.53,*CHS,257,0,0,0,,是因为它们不可饶恕 使用其中任何一个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.71,0:23:53.84,*CHS,258,0,0,0,,都会让你拿到一张去阿兹卡班的单程票 说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.01,0:23:56.74,*CHS,259,0,0,0,,部长说你们还太小 不适合看这些咒语的功力
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.91,0:24:00.37,*CHS,260,0,0,0,,我不这么看 你们该知道自己要面对的是什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.55,0:24:02.71,*CHS,261,0,0,0,,该有所准备
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.89,0:24:05.35,*CHS,262,0,0,0,,菲尼根先生，你该找个...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.52,0:24:07.82,*CHS,263,0,0,0,,...课桌下面以外的地方来扔口香糖！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.99,0:24:10.98,*CHS,264,0,0,0,,怎么回事？ 这老家伙背后长眼了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.69,0:24:13.46,*CHS,265,0,0,0,,还有顺风耳呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.80,0:24:19.29,*CHS,266,0,0,0,,那么...我们应该先说哪一个？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.47,0:24:20.70,*CHS,267,0,0,0,,- 韦斯莱 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.87,0:24:22.20,*CHS,268,0,0,0,,起立
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.37,0:24:27.14,*CHS,269,0,0,0,,和我们说一个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.31,0:24:31.18,*CHS,270,0,0,0,,我爸告诉过我一个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.75,0:24:33.01,*CHS,271,0,0,0,,迷心咒
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.18,0:24:36.48,*CHS,272,0,0,0,,噢，当然，你爸爸一定很熟悉这个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.89,0:24:39.55,*CHS,273,0,0,0,,几年前曾经给魔法部造成不小的麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.02,0:24:42.51,*CHS,274,0,0,0,,让我来告诉你为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.13,0:24:51.46,*CHS,275,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.10,0:24:54.80,*CHS,276,0,0,0,,小美人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.94,0:24:59.93,*CHS,277,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.31,0:25:01.97,*CHS,278,0,0,0,,迷心咒！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.38,0:25:08.82,*CHS,279,0,0,0,,不用担心，它不会伤害你的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.99,0:25:16.65,*CHS,280,0,0,0,,如果它咬你一口...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.19,0:25:18.68,*CHS,281,0,0,0,,...可是致命的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.23,0:25:23.03,*CHS,282,0,0,0,,笑什么笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.37,0:25:25.80,*CHS,283,0,0,0,,下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.24,0:25:30.00,*CHS,284,0,0,0,,真是个天才？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.17,0:25:33.57,*CHS,285,0,0,0,,接下来要做什么？ 把它扔到窗上？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.54,0:25:36.94,*CHS,286,0,0,0,,淹死它？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:51.99,*CHS,287,0,0,0,,很多男女巫师...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:56.15,*CHS,288,0,0,0,,...都声称自己为“那个人”做事...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.33,0:25:58.56,*CHS,289,0,0,0,,...是受了迷心咒的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.73,0:26:00.67,*CHS,290,0,0,0,,但关键是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.00,0:26:04.00,*CHS,291,0,0,0,,怎么判断谁在说谎？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.34,0:26:08.04,*CHS,292,0,0,0,,再说一个
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.04,0:26:10.57,*CHS,293,0,0,0,,起来，快点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.75,0:26:12.30,*CHS,294,0,0,0,,你是伦伯特，对么？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.98,0:26:14.47,*CHS,295,0,0,0,,起立
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.52,0:26:20.39,*CHS,296,0,0,0,,斯普劳特教授说你在草药学方面有特长
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.29,0:26:23.92,*CHS,297,0,0,0,,还有...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.16,0:26:26.09,*CHS,298,0,0,0,,钻心咒
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.26,0:26:29.13,*CHS,299,0,0,0,,没错，没错，来，过来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.33,0:26:30.96,*CHS,300,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.00,0:26:35.83,*CHS,301,0,0,0,,折磨人的咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.84,0:26:39.00,*CHS,302,0,0,0,,钻心咒！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.72,0:26:55.52,*CHS,303,0,0,0,,住手！没看到他很难受吗 住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:17.14,*CHS,304,0,0,0,,格兰杰小姐，能否告诉我们 最后一个咒语是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.58,0:27:20.91,*CHS,305,0,0,0,,不？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.12,0:27:24.24,*CHS,306,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:29.55,*CHS,307,0,0,0,,死咒
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.69,0:27:33.82,*CHS,308,0,0,0,,只有一个人曾经幸免一死...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.40,0:27:36.76,*CHS,309,0,0,0,,...他就坐在这间教室里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.36,0:28:10.13,*CHS,310,0,0,0,,他是个天才
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.30,0:28:14.33,*CHS,311,0,0,0,,当然，也是个神经病 和他同处一室真可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.50,0:28:17.67,*CHS,312,0,0,0,,你知道，他曾经身临其境 曾经直面邪恶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.84,0:28:20.43,*CHS,313,0,0,0,,那些咒语不可饶恕是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.61,0:28:24.71,*CHS,314,0,0,0,,现在却在教室里被演示 你们真该看看纳威的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.65,0:28:29.12,*CHS,315,0,0,0,,纳威？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.28,0:28:30.72,*CHS,316,0,0,0,,孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.09,0:28:32.71,*CHS,317,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.69,0:28:37.06,*CHS,318,0,0,0,,来，一起喝杯茶 我想给你看点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.61,0:28:53.60,*CHS,319,0,0,0,,我们要迟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.19,0:29:09.52,*CHS,320,0,0,0,,快点，塞德里克 别磨蹭！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.14,0:29:27.63,*CHS,321,0,0,0,,永恒的荣耀，很棒不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.81,0:29:30.44,*CHS,322,0,0,0,,等三年之后吧，咱们够了岁数
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.61,0:29:32.24,*CHS,323,0,0,0,,对，选你也别选我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.41,0:29:34.35,*CHS,324,0,0,0,,好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.55,0:29:38.45,*CHS,325,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.62,0:29:41.68,*CHS,326,0,0,0,,- 我们成功了 - 今天早上新出炉的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.86,0:29:44.02,*CHS,327,0,0,0,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.23,0:29:47.72,*CHS,328,0,0,0,,- 哦，是的  - 格兰杰，你怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.90,0:29:50.87,*CHS,329,0,0,0,,看到这个了么？ 这是年龄线
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.03,0:29:52.83,*CHS,330,0,0,0,,邓不利多亲自画的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:54.43,*CHS,331,0,0,0,,所以？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:59.63,*CHS,332,0,0,0,,所以，像邓不利多那样的天才...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.81,0:30:02.80,*CHS,333,0,0,0,,...是不可能被增龄药这样的小把戏骗过的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.98,0:30:07.24,*CHS,334,0,0,0,,- 这才是我们聪明的地方 - 因为他想不到我们会用这馊主意
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.98,0:30:10.98,*CHS,335,0,0,0,,- 准备好了么，弗雷德 - 准备好了，乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.15,0:30:12.98,*CHS,336,0,0,0,,- 一口闷 - 一口闷
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.43,0:30:18.33,*CHS,337,0,0,0,,- 好唉！ - 好唉！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.19,0:30:20.66,*CHS,338,0,0,0,,好唉！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.83,0:30:23.46,*CHS,339,0,0,0,,好唉！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.90,0:30:25.39,*CHS,340,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.70,0:30:30.83,*CHS,341,0,0,0,,- 好唉！ - 好唉！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.38,0:30:41.35,*CHS,342,0,0,0,,- 是你说的 - 是你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.32,0:30:45.75,*CHS,343,0,0,0,,- 想尝尝我的厉害？！ - 看我不把你耳朵揪下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.92,0:30:48.41,*CHS,344,0,0,0,,- 别让我笑了 - 接招！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.59,0:30:50.02,*CHS,345,0,0,0,,打！打！打！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.13,0:30:56.86,*CHS,346,0,0,0,,我们是“老学校”，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.03,0:30:59.43,*CHS,347,0,0,0,,是啊，但你看起来更老了！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.80,0:31:33.46,*CHS,348,0,0,0,,请就座
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.87,0:31:39.74,*CHS,349,0,0,0,,此时此刻，我们已等待许久
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.91,0:31:42.04,*CHS,350,0,0,0,,勇士选拔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.48,0:32:17.28,*CHS,351,0,0,0,,德姆斯特朗的勇士是威克多尔·克鲁姆
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.23,0:32:35.63,*CHS,352,0,0,0,,布斯巴顿的勇士是...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.80,0:32:37.82,*CHS,353,0,0,0,,...芙蓉·德拉库尔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.38,0:32:51.37,*CHS,354,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨的勇士是塞德里克·迪戈里！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.42,0:33:05.83,*CHS,355,0,0,0,,好极了 我们已经选出了三位勇士
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.99,0:33:10.19,*CHS,356,0,0,0,,但最终，只有一位能被载入史册
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.37,0:33:13.70,*CHS,357,0,0,0,,而他将举起冠军奖杯...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.00,0:33:17.03,*CHS,358,0,0,0,,胜利的象征...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.21,0:33:19.40,*CHS,359,0,0,0,,“三强冠军杯”！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.17,0:33:51.83,*CHS,360,0,0,0,,哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.94,0:33:55.57,*CHS,361,0,0,0,,哈利·波特？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.95,0:34:02.14,*CHS,362,0,0,0,,不，不
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.65,0:34:03.95,*CHS,363,0,0,0,,哈利·波特！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.39,0:34:05.88,*CHS,364,0,0,0,,快去，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.05,0:34:07.82,*CHS,365,0,0,0,,哈利，快点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.32,0:34:40.52,*CHS,366,0,0,0,,他作弊！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.06,0:34:43.62,*CHS,367,0,0,0,,他还没到17岁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.49,0:35:14.98,*CHS,368,0,0,0,,- 我抗议！- 我抗议！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.16,0:35:18.13,*CHS,369,0,0,0,,- 你把什么都当作阴谋！ - 安静，让我想想！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.29,0:35:20.28,*CHS,370,0,0,0,,- 全都是阴谋！ - 我抗议
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.46,0:35:21.66,*CHS,371,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 我抗议！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.83,0:35:23.70,*CHS,372,0,0,0,,你把自己的名字放到火焰杯里去了么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.87,0:35:26.03,*CHS,373,0,0,0,,- 没有，先生 - 那是你让高年级的学生...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.20,0:35:27.53,*CHS,374,0,0,0,,- ...替你做的？ - 没有，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.70,0:35:30.60,*CHS,375,0,0,0,,- 你绝对肯定？ - 是的，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.04,0:35:33.27,*CHS,376,0,0,0,,- 可他显然在撒谎 - 他没有
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.48,0:35:35.84,*CHS,377,0,0,0,,火焰杯有非常强大的魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.01,0:35:39.14,*CHS,378,0,0,0,,只有超强的魔法才能胜过它
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.31,0:35:41.31,*CHS,379,0,0,0,,一个四年级的学生是 不可能掌握那种魔法的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.48,0:35:44.48,*CHS,380,0,0,0,,疯眼汉，看来你有点想法
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.65,0:35:47.82,*CHS,381,0,0,0,,卡卡洛夫，你没忘了我当年的职责 就是揣摩黑暗巫师的想法吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.99,0:35:51.08,*CHS,382,0,0,0,,- ...可能你还记得 - 别这样，阿拉斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.86,0:35:55.16,*CHS,383,0,0,0,,巴蒂，就交给你决定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.53,0:35:58.73,*CHS,384,0,0,0,,规则是不能改的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.94,0:36:03.67,*CHS,385,0,0,0,,火焰杯组成了一个必须遵守的魔法契约
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.21,0:36:07.40,*CHS,386,0,0,0,,波特先生没有选择
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.21,0:36:10.54,*CHS,387,0,0,0,,就今夜而言，他的确是...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.35,0:36:14.37,*CHS,388,0,0,0,,...三强赛的勇士
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.31,0:36:44.44,*CHS,389,0,0,0,,不能这样下去了，阿不思
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.78,0:36:47.61,*CHS,390,0,0,0,,先是黑魔标记，然后又是这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.78,0:36:49.77,*CHS,391,0,0,0,,米勒娃，你想说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.95,0:36:53.01,*CHS,392,0,0,0,,给这些画上句号
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.49,0:36:55.48,*CHS,393,0,0,0,,别让波特参赛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.66,0:36:58.13,*CHS,394,0,0,0,,你听到巴蒂说的了，规则很明确
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.29,0:37:01.13,*CHS,395,0,0,0,,让巴蒂和他的规则见鬼去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.30,0:37:03.73,*CHS,396,0,0,0,,曾几何时，你开始迎合魔法部了？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.90,0:37:07.89,*CHS,397,0,0,0,,校长，我觉得要说这都是巧合的确难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.07,0:37:12.01,*CHS,398,0,0,0,,但是，如果想揭开这一系列事件的谜底
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.17,0:37:15.77,*CHS,399,0,0,0,,...我们也许应该...暂时..
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.68,0:37:18.94,*CHS,400,0,0,0,,...任其发展下去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.11,0:37:21.28,*CHS,401,0,0,0,,什么？袖手旁观么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.45,0:37:23.08,*CHS,402,0,0,0,,把他当成诱饵？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.09,0:37:26.92,*CHS,403,0,0,0,,我的意思是，波特是个孩子 而不是一块肉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.82,0:37:30.55,*CHS,404,0,0,0,,我同意西弗勒斯的观点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.13,0:37:33.96,*CHS,405,0,0,0,,阿拉斯特，能帮忙照看一下哈利么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.23,0:37:36.70,*CHS,406,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 但别让他知道
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.97,0:37:40.06,*CHS,407,0,0,0,,知道未来的磨难...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.60,0:37:43.26,*CHS,408,0,0,0,,...他一定已经很紧张了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.64,0:37:46.20,*CHS,409,0,0,0,,而且我们也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.09,0:38:02.89,*CHS,410,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.36,0:38:08.99,*CHS,411,0,0,0,,没关系，已经不重要了 至少也该让你的铁哥们知道一下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.16,0:38:12.46,*CHS,412,0,0,0,,- 让你知道什么？ - 你心里明白得很
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.63,0:38:15.03,*CHS,413,0,0,0,,罗恩，我不想事情这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.50,0:38:17.10,*CHS,414,0,0,0,,明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.27,0:38:19.76,*CHS,415,0,0,0,,- 你现在表现象个傻瓜 - 对，我就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.94,0:38:23.47,*CHS,416,0,0,0,,罗恩·韦斯莱 哈利·波特的傻朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.18,0:38:29.15,*CHS,417,0,0,0,,我没把名字放进火焰杯
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.58,0:38:33.42,*CHS,418,0,0,0,,我对永恒的荣耀不感兴趣 我只是想...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.19,0:38:39.65,*CHS,419,0,0,0,,听着，我对今晚发生的事毫无头绪
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.83,0:38:41.06,*CHS,420,0,0,0,,事情就这么发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.93,0:38:43.49,*CHS,421,0,0,0,,好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.31,0:38:54.07,*CHS,422,0,0,0,,瞎扯
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.09,0:39:11.56,*CHS,423,0,0,0,,多有魅力的四人组啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.89,0:39:14.49,*CHS,424,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.36,0:39:17.92,*CHS,425,0,0,0,,我是丽塔·斯基特
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.50,0:39:20.99,*CHS,426,0,0,0,,为《预言家日报》写稿的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:26.30,*CHS,427,0,0,0,,当然，你们是知道我的了 我们不了解的是你们
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.84,0:39:28.67,*CHS,428,0,0,0,,你们才是生动新闻的来源
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.84,0:39:33.04,*CHS,429,0,0,0,,这玫瑰色的脸颊下 隐藏了什么样的奇思怪想？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.25,0:39:36.71,*CHS,430,0,0,0,,强壮的肌肉裹着多少秘密？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.89,0:39:40.12,*CHS,431,0,0,0,,弯曲的卷发下面又藏着多少勇气？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.29,0:39:43.31,*CHS,432,0,0,0,,大伙们，什么才是勇士的标志？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.83,0:39:48.13,*CHS,433,0,0,0,,我自己就很想知道 更别提我饥渴的读者们
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.30,0:39:50.79,*CHS,434,0,0,0,,那么...谁先来说说？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.10,0:39:56.70,*CHS,435,0,0,0,,该从最小的开始？ 多可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.98,0:40:10.78,*CHS,436,0,0,0,,这里比较清静
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.35,0:40:13.05,*CHS,437,0,0,0,,这是扫把间
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.42,0:40:15.72,*CHS,438,0,0,0,,那你就更有家的感觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.92,0:40:18.69,*CHS,439,0,0,0,,我用速记笔你不介意吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.86,0:40:20.42,*CHS,440,0,0,0,,不会
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.80,0:40:22.79,*CHS,441,0,0,0,,好吧，哈利，告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.96,0:40:25.87,*CHS,442,0,0,0,,你，一个年仅12岁的男孩坐在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.03,0:40:27.52,*CHS,443,0,0,0,,是14
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.70,0:40:30.67,*CHS,444,0,0,0,,面对的是其他三位学生...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.84,0:40:34.10,*CHS,445,0,0,0,,...他们不仅仅在心智上比你成熟许多...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.28,0:40:36.87,*CHS,446,0,0,0,,...而且掌握了就你连...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.05,0:40:39.38,*CHS,447,0,0,0,,...做梦都不敢想的咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.88,0:40:41.91,*CHS,448,0,0,0,,担心么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.08,0:40:45.92,*CHS,449,0,0,0,,我不知道，没有认真考虑过
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.09,0:40:47.95,*CHS,450,0,0,0,,别管那支笔
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.42,0:40:50.95,*CHS,451,0,0,0,,当然，你不是一个普通的12岁男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.13,0:40:53.72,*CHS,452,0,0,0,,- 是14 - 你有传奇般的过去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.50,0:40:56.66,*CHS,453,0,0,0,,你认为是自己过去的创伤...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.83,0:41:00.06,*CHS,454,0,0,0,,...导致现在你急于想参加一场 如此危险的比赛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.24,0:41:02.00,*CHS,455,0,0,0,,不，不是我要参加的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.17,0:41:03.76,*CHS,456,0,0,0,,当然不是了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.04,0:41:07.67,*CHS,457,0,0,0,,有点叛逆心理大家才喜欢呢，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.98,0:41:11.50,*CHS,458,0,0,0,,划掉最后一句
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.28,0:41:16.44,*CHS,459,0,0,0,,说到你父母 如果他们还健在，你认为他们会怎么看？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.62,0:41:18.42,*CHS,460,0,0,0,,是骄傲，还是...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.59,0:41:22.42,*CHS,461,0,0,0,,...忧虑你选择了这样一个 病态的寻求关注的方法...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.59,0:41:25.18,*CHS,462,0,0,0,,...病态的找死心理？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.19,0:41:31.26,*CHS,463,0,0,0,,我不过是眨下眼睛 没和你说那么多吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.56,0:42:05.90,*CHS,464,0,0,0,,哈利，我不能冒险让海德薇过来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.07,0:42:09.33,*CHS,465,0,0,0,,自从世界杯以后 魔法部拦截了越来越多的猫头鹰...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.50,0:42:11.73,*CHS,466,0,0,0,,...她太容易被认出了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.91,0:42:14.77,*CHS,467,0,0,0,,我们需要谈谈，哈利 面对面
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.94,0:42:19.11,*CHS,468,0,0,0,,周六晚一点和我在格兰芬多公休室见
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.28,0:42:21.04,*CHS,469,0,0,0,,确保你是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.22,0:42:22.71,*CHS,470,0,0,0,,小天狼星
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.88,0:42:24.37,*CHS,471,0,0,0,,另外
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.55,0:42:26.35,*CHS,472,0,0,0,,这只鸟会咬人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.70,0:42:38.13,*CHS,473,0,0,0,,小天狼星？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.02,0:42:56.92,*CHS,474,0,0,0,,哈利·波特，12岁...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.09,0:43:00.05,*CHS,475,0,0,0,,...三强争霸赛的神秘参赛者
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.22,0:43:02.82,*CHS,476,0,0,0,,他的眼中散发幽灵般往事的阴影...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.99,0:43:04.55,*CHS,477,0,0,0,,...含着泪花...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.04,0:43:22.64,*CHS,478,0,0,0,,小天狼星，你怎么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.81,0:43:25.30,*CHS,479,0,0,0,,我的时间不多，哈利 让我直入主题
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.48,0:43:28.42,*CHS,480,0,0,0,,你有没有把你的名字放进火焰杯里？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.58,0:43:30.05,*CHS,481,0,0,0,,没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.65,0:43:31.91,*CHS,482,0,0,0,,这是我必须问的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.09,0:43:36.89,*CHS,483,0,0,0,,现在和我讲讲你的梦 你提到了虫尾巴和伏地魔
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.06,0:43:39.49,*CHS,484,0,0,0,,但房间里第三个人是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.66,0:43:42.15,*CHS,485,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 你没听到他的名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.00,0:43:44.52,*CHS,486,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.43,0:43:49.16,*CHS,487,0,0,0,,伏地魔给他一个任务 很重要的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.34,0:43:50.63,*CHS,488,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.81,0:43:54.43,*CHS,489,0,0,0,,他要...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.61,0:43:56.27,*CHS,490,0,0,0,,...抓我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.84,0:44:01.18,*CHS,491,0,0,0,,我不明白，但他会利用这个人来抓我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.45,0:44:04.61,*CHS,492,0,0,0,,我想这可能只是个梦而已
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.99,0:44:06.61,*CHS,493,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.79,0:44:08.35,*CHS,494,0,0,0,,只是个梦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.09,0:44:10.52,*CHS,495,0,0,0,,听着，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.69,0:44:14.15,*CHS,496,0,0,0,,世界杯时食死徒的出现 你的名字出现在火焰杯里...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.33,0:44:18.32,*CHS,497,0,0,0,,...都不是巧合 霍格沃茨不再安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.50,0:44:19.59,*CHS,498,0,0,0,,你的意思是？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.77,0:44:24.03,*CHS,499,0,0,0,,我是说恶魔就在你身边 伊戈尔·卡卡洛夫
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.21,0:44:28.61,*CHS,500,0,0,0,,他曾经是食死徒 食死徒魔性难改
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.04,0:44:34.17,*CHS,501,0,0,0,,巴蒂·克劳奇，一个铁石心肠的人. 他把自己儿子送去了阿兹卡班
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.99,0:44:41.08,*CHS,502,0,0,0,,是他们其中的一个把我的名字放进去的？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.26,0:44:43.55,*CHS,503,0,0,0,,我不知道，哈利...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.72,0:44:47.68,*CHS,504,0,0,0,,...但不管是谁，他一定不是你的朋友 争霸赛里会出人命的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.86,0:44:51.35,*CHS,505,0,0,0,,- 小天狼星，我还没有做好准备 - 你没得选择
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.90,0:44:57.30,*CHS,506,0,0,0,,- 有人来了 - 哈利，和你的朋友搞好关系
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.61,0:45:01.94,*CHS,507,0,0,0,,你在和谁说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.11,0:45:05.17,*CHS,508,0,0,0,,- 什么？屋子里又没人 - 我听见声音了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.45,0:45:09.44,*CHS,509,0,0,0,,可能你又开始胡想了 这也不是第一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.98,0:45:13.32,*CHS,510,0,0,0,,可能是你在准备下一次的访谈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.55,0:45:30.37,*CHS,511,0,0,0,,(幼年惨剧)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.25,0:45:40.87,*CHS,512,0,0,0,,太奇妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.85,0:45:46.55,*CHS,513,0,0,0,,- 太奇妙了 - 纳威，你又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.12,0:45:48.52,*CHS,514,0,0,0,,哦，抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.39,0:45:52.38,*CHS,515,0,0,0,, 《拉克斯高地的魔力水生物》？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.56,0:45:55.72,*CHS,516,0,0,0,,穆迪那天喝茶的时候给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.23,0:45:58.96,*CHS,517,0,0,0,,反正也当着这么多人的面了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.13,0:46:01.23,*CHS,518,0,0,0,,你不如自己去说算了？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.70,0:46:05.04,*CHS,519,0,0,0,,罗恩，这是你自己的问题，和我无关
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.21,0:46:07.30,*CHS,520,0,0,0,,你还想让我说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.48,0:46:08.81,*CHS,521,0,0,0,,快去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.75,0:46:15.91,*CHS,522,0,0,0,,罗恩想让我告诉你 希姆告诉他...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.48,0:46:20.08,*CHS,523,0,0,0,,...帕瓦蒂告诉蒂姆 海格在找你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.25,0:46:22.69,*CHS,524,0,0,0,,是么？那你...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.86,0:46:23.92,*CHS,525,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.03,0:46:31.97,*CHS,526,0,0,0,,- 你真的要这样吗？ - 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.77,0:46:37.74,*CHS,527,0,0,0,,帕瓦蒂告诉蒂姆...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.97,0:46:41.20,*CHS,528,0,0,0,,别让我再说一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.58,0:46:43.04,*CHS,529,0,0,0,,海格在找你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.54,0:46:46.60,*CHS,530,0,0,0,,- 你可以告诉罗纳得... - 我不是猫头鹰！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.16,0:46:59.42,*CHS,531,0,0,0,,带上你父亲的隐形衣了么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.59,0:47:02.19,*CHS,532,0,0,0,,嗯，我带了 海格，我们要去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.36,0:47:03.76,*CHS,533,0,0,0,,就快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.93,0:47:06.13,*CHS,534,0,0,0,,注意哦，这很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.87,0:47:09.34,*CHS,535,0,0,0,,这朵花是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.37,0:47:12.77,*CHS,536,0,0,0,,海格，你居然梳了头？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.17,0:47:14.90,*CHS,537,0,0,0,,我的确梳过了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.34,0:47:18.28,*CHS,538,0,0,0,,也许以后你也应该试一试
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.79,0:47:28.25,*CHS,539,0,0,0,,海格？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.16,0:47:34.06,*CHS,540,0,0,0,,隐形衣，披上隐形衣！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.60,0:47:44.00,*CHS,541,0,0,0,,- 你好，奥林 - 噢，海格
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.17,0:47:47.90,*CHS,542,0,0,0,,我以为你不会来了 我还以为...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.08,0:47:50.74,*CHS,543,0,0,0,,...你把我给忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.91,0:47:52.88,*CHS,544,0,0,0,,怎么会呢，奥林
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.51,0:47:55.35,*CHS,545,0,0,0,,你想给我看什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.02,0:48:00.25,*CHS,546,0,0,0,,我们早前谈话时，你显得那么...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.59,0:48:02.08,*CHS,547,0,0,0,,...愉悦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.66,0:48:05.49,*CHS,548,0,0,0,,你会不虚此行的 相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.07,0:48:17.83,*CHS,549,0,0,0,,咱们靠近些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.65,0:48:27.11,*CHS,550,0,0,0,,龙？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.28,0:48:28.77,*CHS,551,0,0,0,,就是第一项任务？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.18,0:48:31.21,*CHS,552,0,0,0,,- 开玩笑 - 别这样，哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.49,0:48:35.51,*CHS,553,0,0,0,,那是一种被严重误解的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.62,0:48:38.09,*CHS,554,0,0,0,,噢，好悬！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.59,0:48:43.59,*CHS,555,0,0,0,,尽管我得承认那条匈牙利树蜂确实很凶恶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.90,0:48:46.73,*CHS,556,0,0,0,,罗恩只是看了一下就差点昏过去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.24,0:48:50.26,*CHS,557,0,0,0,,- 罗恩来过？ - 当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.44,0:48:53.97,*CHS,558,0,0,0,,是他哥哥查理把它们从罗马尼亚带来的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.14,0:48:55.57,*CHS,559,0,0,0,,罗恩没告诉你？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.51,0:48:58.91,*CHS,560,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.65,0:49:01.51,*CHS,561,0,0,0,,他一个字都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.46,0:49:14.55,*CHS,562,0,0,0,,- 你作弊，波特 - 你真讨厌，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.06,0:49:18.73,*CHS,563,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运，波特 - 波特真讨厌！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.90,0:49:21.56,*CHS,564,0,0,0,,- 塞德里克必胜 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.64,0:49:24.30,*CHS,565,0,0,0,,喜欢我的徽章么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.87,0:49:26.60,*CHS,566,0,0,0,,借过
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.78,0:49:32.25,*CHS,567,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.81,0:49:34.78,*CHS,568,0,0,0,,看看徽章吧，波特！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.95,0:49:36.44,*CHS,569,0,0,0,,我能和你谈谈么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.42,0:49:39.28,*CHS,570,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 你真差劲，波特！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.45,0:49:42.45,*CHS,571,0,0,0,,- 波特，你真讨厌！ - 哈利波特真差劲！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.96,0:49:47.52,*CHS,572,0,0,0,,龙是我们的第一项任务
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.70,0:49:50.82,*CHS,573,0,0,0,,- 每个人都有一条 - 塞德里克！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.00,0:49:53.02,*CHS,574,0,0,0,,你不是说笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.80,0:49:56.83,*CHS,575,0,0,0,,芙蓉和克鲁姆他们知道么？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.00,0:49:59.27,*CHS,576,0,0,0,,- 知道 - 塞德里克，别和他罗嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.44,0:50:00.91,*CHS,577,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 他不配
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.08,0:50:03.57,*CHS,578,0,0,0,,- 看看徽章吧，波特！ - 听着，那个徽章
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.74,0:50:06.77,*CHS,579,0,0,0,,- 我叫他们不要戴... - 别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.95,0:50:09.38,*CHS,580,0,0,0,,不是我想它们爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.08,0:50:11.55,*CHS,581,0,0,0,,这种事老是发生在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.72,0:50:14.78,*CHS,582,0,0,0,,但你得承认，那火焰很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.96,0:50:16.79,*CHS,583,0,0,0,,你真窝囊，知道么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.96,0:50:19.22,*CHS,584,0,0,0,,- 是么？ - 就是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.39,0:50:20.72,*CHS,585,0,0,0,,还有什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.90,0:50:24.39,*CHS,586,0,0,0,,- 有，离我远点 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.77,0:50:30.36,*CHS,587,0,0,0,,- 波特来了，他是个骗子 - 火气好大，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.14,0:50:33.54,*CHS,588,0,0,0,,我和父亲打了个赌
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.71,0:50:36.90,*CHS,589,0,0,0,,我认为你在比赛里只能坚持10分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.48,0:50:42.42,*CHS,590,0,0,0,,他不同意 他认为只有5分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.58,0:50:45.71,*CHS,591,0,0,0,,我才不管你爸怎么想呢，马尔福
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.69,0:50:50.68,*CHS,592,0,0,0,,他既卑鄙又凶残 你只是个可怜虫
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.59,0:50:54.19,*CHS,593,0,0,0,,- 可怜虫？ - 小子，你可别这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.36,0:50:59.26,*CHS,594,0,0,0,,让我来教教你怎么在人背后下咒！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.43,0:51:03.27,*CHS,595,0,0,0,,你这个讨厌鬼，懦夫，渣滓...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.44,0:51:05.17,*CHS,596,0,0,0,,- 穆迪教授！ - ...小人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.34,0:51:08.24,*CHS,597,0,0,0,,- 你在干吗？ - 教学生
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.28,0:51:13.41,*CHS,598,0,0,0,,- 那是，那是个学生么？ - 从技术上来说是只雪貂
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.05,0:51:20.99,*CHS,599,0,0,0,,站稳了，别动！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.97,0:51:34.16,*CHS,600,0,0,0,,- 我会告诉老爸的！ - 你在威胁我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.34,0:51:36.27,*CHS,601,0,0,0,,- 教授！ - 你在威胁我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.44,0:51:38.30,*CHS,602,0,0,0,,教授！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.47,0:51:42.03,*CHS,603,0,0,0,,你老爸的糗事我知道的可多呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.21,0:51:44.91,*CHS,604,0,0,0,,- 阿拉斯特 - 走着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.08,0:51:48.88,*CHS,605,0,0,0,,阿拉斯特，我们从不用变形魔法惩罚学生！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.05,0:51:51.24,*CHS,606,0,0,0,,邓不利多肯定告诉过你这点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.79,0:51:56.25,*CHS,607,0,0,0,,- 他可能提过 - 那么你这次要好好记住了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.36,0:51:58.83,*CHS,608,0,0,0,,都走开！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.93,0:52:04.12,*CHS,609,0,0,0,,你跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.37,0:52:41.43,*CHS,610,0,0,0,,那是面照妖镜
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.17,0:52:44.33,*CHS,611,0,0,0,,防范敌人用的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.74,0:52:49.14,*CHS,612,0,0,0,,如果我能看见他们的眼白 那说明他们就在我身后
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.31,0:52:55.78,*CHS,613,0,0,0,,懒得和你讲那里面是什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.95,0:52:57.98,*CHS,614,0,0,0,,说了你也不信
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.25,0:52:59.95,*CHS,615,0,0,0,,现在...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.62,0:53:04.46,*CHS,616,0,0,0,,...你打算怎么对付那些龙？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.36,0:53:10.66,*CHS,617,0,0,0,,哦...嗯...我想可能会...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.13,0:53:13.62,*CHS,618,0,0,0,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.34,0:53:18.74,*CHS,619,0,0,0,,听着，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.74,0:53:20.90,*CHS,620,0,0,0,,你朋友迪戈里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.08,0:53:25.54,*CHS,621,0,0,0,,在你这么大的时候 就能把口哨变成一快会报时的表
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.68,0:53:27.94,*CHS,622,0,0,0,,德拉库尔小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.35,0:53:31.08,*CHS,623,0,0,0,,简直就是神话中的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.59,0:53:35.15,*CHS,624,0,0,0,,至于克鲁姆，他可能头脑简单...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.32,0:53:37.48,*CHS,625,0,0,0,,...但卡卡洛夫不是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.66,0:53:39.49,*CHS,626,0,0,0,,他们是有备而来的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.66,0:53:43.19,*CHS,627,0,0,0,,会利用克鲁姆的优势
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.97,0:53:49.53,*CHS,628,0,0,0,,那么，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.70,0:53:51.80,*CHS,629,0,0,0,,你有什么优势？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.37,0:53:54.74,*CHS,630,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.91,0:53:57.71,*CHS,631,0,0,0,,嗯，我会飞，飞得很快，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.88,0:54:01.91,*CHS,632,0,0,0,,- 我听说了，可不是一般得好 - 但不许用扫把啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.08,0:54:05.71,*CHS,633,0,0,0,,你可以用...魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.16,0:54:13.63,*CHS,634,0,0,0,,下注了！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.79,0:54:15.96,*CHS,635,0,0,0,,下注了！来这赌一把！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.13,0:54:19.07,*CHS,636,0,0,0,,大家都来下注吧，出小钱赢大钱
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.23,0:54:22.10,*CHS,637,0,0,0,,明智就投克鲁姆！还有谁要下？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.27,0:54:23.76,*CHS,638,0,0,0,,您呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.10,0:54:26.83,*CHS,639,0,0,0,,10比1赌芙蓉赢，拿好了 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.34,0:54:29.28,*CHS,640,0,0,0,,请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.51,0:54:32.10,*CHS,641,0,0,0,,今天对大家来说是伟大的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.55,0:54:39.78,*CHS,642,0,0,0,,每项任务都很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.95,0:54:42.65,*CHS,643,0,0,0,,比赛中请不要离开自己的座位
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.82,0:54:45.55,*CHS,644,0,0,0,,这会降低你的风险
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.73,0:54:49.16,*CHS,645,0,0,0,,- 哈利，是你么？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.33,0:54:51.02,*CHS,646,0,0,0,,我相信我们都希望勇士们...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.20,0:54:54.26,*CHS,647,0,0,0,,- 你觉得怎样？还好么？ - ...有好的运气
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.57,0:54:59.97,*CHS,648,0,0,0,,关键要集中精神 此后，你只需要...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.14,0:55:01.97,*CHS,649,0,0,0,,斗龙
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.28,0:55:08.77,*CHS,650,0,0,0,,年轻的爱情
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.48,0:55:10.75,*CHS,651,0,0,0,,多么...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.22,0:55:14.52,*CHS,652,0,0,0,,...让人激动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.19,0:55:20.35,*CHS,653,0,0,0,,今天如果有什么不幸...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.53,0:55:23.29,*CHS,654,0,0,0,,...你们俩还可以上头版呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.46,0:55:25.69,*CHS,655,0,0,0,,关你什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.87,0:55:27.89,*CHS,656,0,0,0,,这座帐篷是给勇士...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.24,0:55:29.93,*CHS,657,0,0,0,,...及亲友专用的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.74,0:55:36.90,*CHS,658,0,0,0,,无所谓，我们已经得到想要的了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.05,0:55:42.85,*CHS,659,0,0,0,,你们好，勇士们 请靠过来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.02,0:55:47.21,*CHS,660,0,0,0,,现在，你们期待的一刻终于到来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.39,0:55:50.62,*CHS,661,0,0,0,,只有你们四个才能体会的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.79,0:55:52.92,*CHS,662,0,0,0,,格兰杰小姐，你在这干吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.23,0:55:55.89,*CHS,663,0,0,0,,抱歉，我就走
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.06,0:55:57.66,*CHS,664,0,0,0,,巴蒂，袋子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.03,0:56:00.26,*CHS,665,0,0,0,,勇士们，围着我站成一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.43,0:56:03.53,*CHS,666,0,0,0,,德拉库尔小姐，到这里 克鲁姆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.70,0:56:07.64,*CHS,667,0,0,0,,波特...波特先生，到这里 好，现在
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.81,0:56:10.24,*CHS,668,0,0,0,,...德拉库尔小姐，请
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.31,0:56:15.98,*CHS,669,0,0,0,,威尔士绿龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.62,0:56:21.95,*CHS,670,0,0,0,,克鲁姆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.93,0:56:26.83,*CHS,671,0,0,0,,中国火球龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.30,0:56:35.70,*CHS,672,0,0,0,,瑞典短鼻龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.17,0:56:38.16,*CHS,673,0,0,0,,- 剩下的就是... - 树蜂龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.34,0:56:40.60,*CHS,674,0,0,0,,- 怎么了，孩子？ - 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.01,0:56:46.41,*CHS,675,0,0,0,,匈牙利树蜂龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.58,0:56:51.71,*CHS,676,0,0,0,,这些代表了四头实实在在的龙...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.89,0:56:54.95,*CHS,677,0,0,0,,...每只守护着一个金蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.12,0:56:57.59,*CHS,678,0,0,0,,你们的目标很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.76,0:56:59.25,*CHS,679,0,0,0,,拿到金蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.43,0:57:02.42,*CHS,680,0,0,0,,这你们必须做到 因为每个蛋都有一个线索...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.60,0:57:06.09,*CHS,681,0,0,0,,...没有线索便无法进行下一任务
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.27,0:57:07.60,*CHS,682,0,0,0,,有什么问题么？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.64,0:57:11.30,*CHS,683,0,0,0,,很好，好运，勇士们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.47,0:57:14.30,*CHS,684,0,0,0,,迪戈里先生，大炮一响，你就...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.92,0:57:26.75,*CHS,685,0,0,0,,迪戈里！迪戈里！迪戈里！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.33,0:57:41.70,*CHS,686,0,0,0,,三位勇士已经斗败了龙...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.87,0:57:45.36,*CHS,687,0,0,0,,...他们也将继续下一任务
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.94,0:57:49.03,*CHS,688,0,0,0,,现在，欢迎第四位也是最后一位参赛者
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.01,0:57:54.57,*CHS,689,0,0,0,,哈利！哈利！哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.68,0:59:04.62,*CHS,690,0,0,0,,用魔杖，哈利，用魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.12,0:59:07.14,*CHS,691,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.15,0:59:38.31,*CHS,692,0,0,0,,- 好耶！ - 好！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.23,0:59:48.66,*CHS,693,0,0,0,,噢，老天
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.31,1:00:01.60,*CHS,694,0,0,0,,- 好啊！ - 龙，干得好！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.59,1:02:35.75,*CHS,695,0,0,0,,好！ 好！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.99,1:03:01.68,*CHS,696,0,0,0,,- 好样的，哈利 - 就知道你死不了，可能会断条腿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.86,1:03:03.79,*CHS,697,0,0,0,,- 或者少条胳膊 - 但要你死？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.96,1:03:05.72,*CHS,698,0,0,0,,- 没门！ - 没门！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.83,1:03:09.16,*CHS,699,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.63,1:03:12.29,*CHS,700,0,0,0,,哈利，快看看 线索是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.33,1:03:16.17,*CHS,701,0,0,0,,- 要我打开么？ - 要
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.97,1:03:19.50,*CHS,702,0,0,0,,- 你们要我打开么？ - 要
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.68,1:03:33.08,*CHS,703,0,0,0,,什么鬼东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.22,1:03:39.95,*CHS,704,0,0,0,,好了，大伙 回去做自己的事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.13,1:03:44.15,*CHS,705,0,0,0,,肯定很让人尴尬了 就算不让你们听那噪音
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.33,1:03:51.33,*CHS,706,0,0,0,,我现在了解你一定是疯了才会 把名字放到火焰杯里去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.67,1:03:54.40,*CHS,707,0,0,0,,你现在想清楚了？ 这么长时间
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.54,1:03:57.64,*CHS,708,0,0,0,,不只是我一个人这么想的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.81,1:04:00.08,*CHS,709,0,0,0,,大家都是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.28,1:04:05.51,*CHS,710,0,0,0,,好极了 这让我感到“好过”多了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.45,1:04:09.85,*CHS,711,0,0,0,,- 至少，龙的事情是我给你报的信 - 是海格告诉我的呀
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.02,1:04:11.49,*CHS,712,0,0,0,,不，是我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.66,1:04:14.68,*CHS,713,0,0,0,,你难道不记得 我叫赫敏告诉你...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.86,1:04:18.92,*CHS,714,0,0,0,,...希姆告诉我说帕瓦蒂和蒂姆说 海格在找你
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.10,1:04:23.04,*CHS,715,0,0,0,,希姆没告诉我任何事 其实都只是我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.04,1:04:27.03,*CHS,716,0,0,0,,我以为你想明白了...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.27,1:04:29.26,*CHS,717,0,0,0,,...咱们之间就没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.64,1:04:32.31,*CHS,718,0,0,0,,谁能想明白啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.98,1:04:34.41,*CHS,719,0,0,0,,完全逻辑混乱
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.58,1:04:37.61,*CHS,720,0,0,0,,谁说不是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.78,1:04:39.81,*CHS,721,0,0,0,,我想我当时是太着急了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.42,1:04:44.12,*CHS,722,0,0,0,,男孩们毛病真多
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.58,1:05:10.01,*CHS,723,0,0,0,,- 你好，哈利 - 你好，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.65,1:05:16.25,*CHS,724,0,0,0,,秋，哈利在看你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.19,1:05:21.89,*CHS,725,0,0,0,,别出声
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.60,1:05:23.96,*CHS,726,0,0,0,,瞧这个！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.97,1:05:28.46,*CHS,727,0,0,0,,我简直不敢相信她又故技重施
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.50,1:05:31.73,*CHS,728,0,0,0,,格兰杰小姐 一位平凡却又野心勃勃的女孩...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.91,1:05:34.67,*CHS,729,0,0,0,,...似乎开始钟情于著名的巫师
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.84,1:05:37.11,*CHS,730,0,0,0,,据悉，她最新的猎物是...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.28,1:05:40.91,*CHS,731,0,0,0,,...保加利亚猛男威克多尔·克鲁姆
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.21,1:05:45.15,*CHS,732,0,0,0,,对于哈利·波特如何看待此事 目前仍没有消息
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.52,1:05:48.45,*CHS,733,0,0,0,,韦斯莱先生，你的包裹
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.62,1:05:50.11,*CHS,734,0,0,0,,谢谢，耐吉尔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.93,1:05:57.76,*CHS,735,0,0,0,,现在不行，耐吉尔 等会
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.60,1:06:01.12,*CHS,736,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.47,1:06:09.24,*CHS,737,0,0,0,,我许诺要给他哈利的签名的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.44,1:06:13.21,*CHS,738,0,0,0,,瞧，我妈给我寄的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.35,1:06:23.19,*CHS,739,0,0,0,,是条裙子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.36,1:06:27.16,*CHS,740,0,0,0,,和你的眼睛很配 还有女帽么？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.63,1:06:29.46,*CHS,741,0,0,0,,放下，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.00,1:06:33.96,*CHS,742,0,0,0,,- 金妮，这肯定是给你的 - 我才不穿呢，真让人恶心
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.70,1:06:37.53,*CHS,743,0,0,0,,你笑什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.70,1:06:39.64,*CHS,744,0,0,0,,不是给金妮的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.81,1:06:41.21,*CHS,745,0,0,0,,是给你的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.18,1:06:45.94,*CHS,746,0,0,0,,- 礼袍 - 礼袍，干嘛用的？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.18,1:06:49.34,*CHS,747,0,0,0,,圣诞舞会...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.52,1:06:54.85,*CHS,748,0,0,0,,...是三强赛的传统项目...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.59,1:06:57.65,*CHS,749,0,0,0,,...从首届就开始
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.32,1:07:02.19,*CHS,750,0,0,0,,在平安夜，我们的客人和我们...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.36,1:07:04.02,*CHS,751,0,0,0,,...将会在大厅...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.20,1:07:08.26,*CHS,752,0,0,0,,...举行一场礼仪庄重的晚会
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.80,1:07:12.07,*CHS,753,0,0,0,,作为主办方学校的代表...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.24,1:07:17.34,*CHS,754,0,0,0,,...我希望你们每个人拿出最好的姿态
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.64,1:07:20.27,*CHS,755,0,0,0,,我可是认真的，因为...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.45,1:07:24.88,*CHS,756,0,0,0,,...圣诞晚会首先是一个...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.75,1:07:27.24,*CHS,757,0,0,0,,...舞会
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.49,1:07:33.29,*CHS,758,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.49,1:07:36.49,*CHS,759,0,0,0,,戈德里克·格兰芬多学院 10个世纪以来已经赢得了...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.66,1:07:39.29,*CHS,760,0,0,0,,...魔法届的普遍尊重
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.47,1:07:43.53,*CHS,761,0,0,0,,我不会让你们在一夜之间因为 表现得像...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.70,1:07:47.90,*CHS,762,0,0,0,,...一群胡作非为的狒狒而把 这个名字玷污
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.64,1:07:50.61,*CHS,763,0,0,0,,试试说5倍快？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.78,1:07:52.27,*CHS,764,0,0,0,,现在，说到跳舞...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.45,1:07:56.14,*CHS,765,0,0,0,,...是让身体呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.32,1:07:59.65,*CHS,766,0,0,0,,每个女孩体内, 都有一只天鹅...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.82,1:08:02.19,*CHS,767,0,0,0,,...振翅欲飞
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.36,1:08:06.35,*CHS,768,0,0,0,,爱洛斯·米根身体里也要蹦出东西来了 但我想不是天鹅
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.53,1:08:09.65,*CHS,769,0,0,0,,在每个男孩体内 有一只狮子准备要猎食
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.83,1:08:12.06,*CHS,770,0,0,0,,- 韦斯莱先生 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.23,1:08:14.67,*CHS,771,0,0,0,,你能加入我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.27,1:08:22.80,*CHS,772,0,0,0,,把你的右手放在我的腰上
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.98,1:08:25.54,*CHS,773,0,0,0,,- 放那里？ - 我的腰上
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.71,1:08:28.27,*CHS,774,0,0,0,,而且伸直你的骼膊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.72,1:08:30.68,*CHS,775,0,0,0,,请放音乐
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.75,1:08:35.74,*CHS,776,0,0,0,,1，2，3
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.92,1:08:39.41,*CHS,777,0,0,0,,1，2，3，1，2，3
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.13,1:08:45.26,*CHS,778,0,0,0,,咱们得把这个故事流传下去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.43,1:08:46.59,*CHS,779,0,0,0,,- 到永远 - 到永远
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.77,1:08:50.63,*CHS,780,0,0,0,,所有人都来加入我们 男孩们，都站起来！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.73,1:09:15.66,*CHS,781,0,0,0,,她们为什么总是聚在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.83,1:09:18.49,*CHS,782,0,0,0,,我怎么才能和其中的一个说话？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.34,1:09:29.83,*CHS,783,0,0,0,,管它，哈利，你和龙战斗过 若连你都找不到舞伴，还能有谁可以？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.01,1:09:32.27,*CHS,784,0,0,0,,我想这比斗龙也容易不到哪去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.48,1:09:40.04,*CHS,785,0,0,0,,我长的像我妈
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.22,1:09:44.16,*CHS,786,0,0,0,,我对她了解不多 我3岁时，她就离开了我们
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.32,1:09:46.26,*CHS,787,0,0,0,,我不是那么伤心
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.43,1:09:49.99,*CHS,788,0,0,0,,但是我父亲却伤心透了 我父亲是个小个子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.16,1:09:54.69,*CHS,789,0,0,0,,我在6岁时就可以轻松举起 我的父亲，然后把他放到衣橱里
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.87,1:09:57.20,*CHS,790,0,0,0,,他总为这个笑的很厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.27,1:10:01.14,*CHS,791,0,0,0,,非常有趣
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.08,1:10:10.81,*CHS,792,0,0,0,,而他在我上学的时候也去世了...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.98,1:10:14.01,*CHS,793,0,0,0,,所以我要自己照顾自己
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.45,1:10:16.68,*CHS,794,0,0,0,,不要说我了 说说关于你的事
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.87,1:10:38.97,*CHS,795,0,0,0,,这真是太疯狂了 也许只有我们没有舞伴了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.25,1:10:43.98,*CHS,796,0,0,0,,纳威也没有
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.15,1:10:46.81,*CHS,797,0,0,0,,他至少可以带自己去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.55,1:10:50.89,*CHS,798,0,0,0,,我听说他已经找到舞伴了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.36,1:10:55.12,*CHS,799,0,0,0,,现在我真的很郁闷
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.97,1:11:04.43,*CHS,800,0,0,0,,快找一个好舞伴 不然都被别人抢走了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.47,1:11:08.44,*CHS,801,0,0,0,,你和谁去？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.18,1:11:12.87,*CHS,802,0,0,0,,- 安吉莉娜？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.05,1:11:18.35,*CHS,803,0,0,0,,你...想和我一起参加舞会吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.68,1:11:20.41,*CHS,804,0,0,0,,舞会？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.59,1:11:22.05,*CHS,805,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.76,1:11:27.32,*CHS,806,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.49,1:11:29.12,*CHS,807,0,0,0,,你也是个女的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.30,1:11:30.63,*CHS,808,0,0,0,,你终于注意到了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.80,1:11:32.73,*CHS,809,0,0,0,,你可以选择我们其中一个
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.37,1:11:40.27,*CHS,810,0,0,0,,算了吧，男孩单身还过得去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.44,1:11:41.93,*CHS,811,0,0,0,,但是你个女孩子，太惨无人睹了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.11,1:11:45.87,*CHS,812,0,0,0,,我不会单身去的 不管你信不信，已经有人邀请我了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.82,1:11:54.81,*CHS,813,0,0,0,,而且我也答应了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.66,1:11:58.25,*CHS,814,0,0,0,,活见鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.42,1:12:00.09,*CHS,815,0,0,0,,她吹牛
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.26,1:12:01.49,*CHS,816,0,0,0,,随你怎么说
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.20,1:12:05.49,*CHS,817,0,0,0,,不管怎样我们也得找个人跟我们去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.67,1:12:09.57,*CHS,818,0,0,0,,明天回休息室之时 都要带上自己得舞伴，同意？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.74,1:12:11.29,*CHS,819,0,0,0,,同意
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.66,1:12:36.99,*CHS,820,0,0,0,,- 秋 - 哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.57,1:12:43.30,*CHS,821,0,0,0,,当心楼梯，上面比较滑
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.47,1:12:45.06,*CHS,822,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.51,1:12:50.57,*CHS,823,0,0,0,,秋？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.51,1:12:53.07,*CHS,824,0,0,0,,怎么？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.45,1:12:56.68,*CHS,825,0,0,0,,我想...你能不能...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.85,1:12:59.51,*CHS,826,0,0,0,,我想你能不能做我舞伴？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.32,1:13:03.58,*CHS,827,0,0,0,,什么，我没听清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.49,1:13:09.39,*CHS,828,0,0,0,,我可以邀请你做我的舞伴吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.43,1:13:16.99,*CHS,829,0,0,0,,哈利...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.17,1:13:20.00,*CHS,830,0,0,0,,...对不起 已经有人邀请我了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.01,1:13:22.44,*CHS,831,0,0,0,,而且...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.11,1:13:26.34,*CHS,832,0,0,0,,我也答应他了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.01,1:13:30.57,*CHS,833,0,0,0,,那也好，没事，挺好的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.88,1:13:34.61,*CHS,834,0,0,0,,没关系的，没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.92,1:13:36.51,*CHS,835,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.79,1:13:39.52,*CHS,836,0,0,0,,哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.16,1:13:41.96,*CHS,837,0,0,0,,我真的...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.13,1:13:43.76,*CHS,838,0,0,0,,...很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.54,1:13:55.03,*CHS,839,0,0,0,,没关系的，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.21,1:13:58.41,*CHS,840,0,0,0,,罗恩，真的没事，无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.58,1:14:00.44,*CHS,841,0,0,0,,你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.71,1:14:02.87,*CHS,842,0,0,0,,他刚才去邀请芙蓉·德拉库尔
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.05,1:14:05.54,*CHS,843,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 她怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.72,1:14:07.08,*CHS,844,0,0,0,,当然是不
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.65,1:14:11.99,*CHS,845,0,0,0,,- 难道同意了？ - 别傻了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.39,1:14:16.83,*CHS,846,0,0,0,,她只是刚好路过 你知道我很喜欢她走路的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.56,1:14:21.19,*CHS,847,0,0,0,,我控制不住自己 话就从嘴里溜了出来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.37,1:14:24.83,*CHS,848,0,0,0,,实际上，他是冲她大声吼叫 很吓人
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.01,1:14:29.60,*CHS,849,0,0,0,,- 然后你呢？ - 还能怎么样，我跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.78,1:14:33.51,*CHS,850,0,0,0,,我摆脱不了这阴影了 真不知道自己怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.68,1:14:34.91,*CHS,851,0,0,0,,- 嗨，哈利  - 嗨，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.08,1:14:38.14,*CHS,852,0,0,0,,我总是看到她们的背影
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.49,1:14:42.05,*CHS,853,0,0,0,,我看她是永远不会原谅我的了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.69,1:14:43.68,*CHS,854,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.77,1:15:02.47,*CHS,855,0,0,0,,真要命
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.71,1:15:06.47,*CHS,856,0,0,0,,真要命
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.98,1:15:11.28,*CHS,857,0,0,0,,要命...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.45,1:15:12.68,*CHS,858,0,0,0,,噢，要命...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.39,1:15:19.09,*CHS,859,0,0,0,,你穿的什么？ 你穿的什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.26,1:15:22.28,*CHS,860,0,0,0,,- 我的礼袍 - 嗯，它们还好吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.46,1:15:25.40,*CHS,861,0,0,0,,没有花边、没有讨厌的衣领
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.56,1:15:27.50,*CHS,862,0,0,0,,我觉得你的更传统
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.67,1:15:32.70,*CHS,863,0,0,0,,传统？简直是古董！ 让我看上去像婶婶泰茜
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.07,1:15:38.13,*CHS,864,0,0,0,,闻着也像婶婶泰茜
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.88,1:15:44.71,*CHS,865,0,0,0,,杀了我吧，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.12,1:15:47.68,*CHS,866,0,0,0,,别乱想了！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.65,1:15:52.09,*CHS,867,0,0,0,,可怜的孩子 我打赌她肯定一个人在房间里哭呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.26,1:15:54.73,*CHS,868,0,0,0,,- 谁？ - 当然是赫敏啦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.89,1:15:58.49,*CHS,869,0,0,0,,还不明白吗，哈利 否则她为什么不告诉我们她跟谁来？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.66,1:16:00.86,*CHS,870,0,0,0,,因为她怕我们取笑她
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.03,1:16:06.13,*CHS,871,0,0,0,,没人邀请她 她要是不那么傲气，我就去请她了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.11,1:16:08.51,*CHS,872,0,0,0,,- 你们好 - 你们好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.67,1:16:10.51,*CHS,873,0,0,0,,你的衣服真是...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.08,1:16:12.27,*CHS,874,0,0,0,,...有个性
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.85,1:16:16.01,*CHS,875,0,0,0,,总算找到你了波特 你和佩蒂尔小姐准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.18,1:16:18.01,*CHS,876,0,0,0,,- 什么准备好，教授？ - 跳舞啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.18,1:16:21.21,*CHS,877,0,0,0,,这是老规矩了，三个冠军选手 现在是四个了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.39,1:16:22.45,*CHS,878,0,0,0,,...最先入场跳舞
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.79,1:16:25.42,*CHS,879,0,0,0,,- 相当肯定我告诉你了 - 您没有
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.99,1:16:27.72,*CHS,880,0,0,0,,那你现在也知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.23,1:16:33.53,*CHS,881,0,0,0,,至于你，韦斯莱先生 你也可以和佩蒂尔小姐一起进礼堂了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.70,1:16:36.10,*CHS,882,0,0,0,,- 你们也来了 - 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.27,1:16:37.76,*CHS,883,0,0,0,,这边走
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.64,1:16:44.47,*CHS,884,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.31,1:16:47.30,*CHS,885,0,0,0,,- 嗨! - 大家排好队...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.48,1:16:50.85,*CHS,886,0,0,0,,...你可迟到了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.05,1:16:55.45,*CHS,887,0,0,0,,这边走，跟上
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.16,1:16:59.39,*CHS,888,0,0,0,,她真美！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.56,1:17:01.15,*CHS,889,0,0,0,,对，没错
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.54,1:17:52.10,*CHS,890,0,0,0,,那是赫敏·格兰杰和威克多尔·克鲁姆吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.75,1:17:55.31,*CHS,891,0,0,0,,不可能，怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.02,1:18:01.58,*CHS,892,0,0,0,,嗨！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.33,1:18:12.32,*CHS,893,0,0,0,,哈利，挽着我的腰
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.20,1:18:14.63,*CHS,894,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.20,1:19:23.07,*CHS,895,0,0,0,,你们准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.64,1:19:25.90,*CHS,896,0,0,0,,摆动你们的身体
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.67,1:19:29.14,*CHS,897,0,0,0,,学着摇摆起来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.54,1:19:32.14,*CHS,898,0,0,0,,像疯狂的小精灵那样转啊转
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.65,1:19:34.88,*CHS,899,0,0,0,,像他那样舞动
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.18,1:19:38.52,*CHS,900,0,0,0,,像独角兽那样摇摆
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.69,1:19:41.12,*CHS,901,0,0,0,,一直到黎明
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.29,1:19:44.12,*CHS,902,0,0,0,,空中舞动你的手
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.33,1:19:47.09,*CHS,903,0,0,0,,就像老女人一样，什么都不管
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.80,1:19:50.46,*CHS,904,0,0,0,,你能像飞马那样跳舞吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.80,1:19:55.00,*CHS,905,0,0,0,,不觉得他像个红色的南瓜吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.17,1:20:00.57,*CHS,906,0,0,0,,我觉得他就像图书馆到处乱放的书
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.51,1:20:04.03,*CHS,907,0,0,0,,可以邀你一起吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.21,1:20:06.94,*CHS,908,0,0,0,,手，腿，都是你的了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.84,1:20:34.43,*CHS,909,0,0,0,,他很帅，对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.11,1:20:38.44,*CHS,910,0,0,0,,威克多尔去拿酒了 你们也一起来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.61,1:20:42.31,*CHS,911,0,0,0,,不，我们可不想打扰你跟威克多尔
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.99,1:20:46.32,*CHS,912,0,0,0,,你发什么神经？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.62,1:20:50.32,*CHS,913,0,0,0,,他是德姆斯特朗学校的 你居然跟敌人这么亲密
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.49,1:20:54.05,*CHS,914,0,0,0,,敌人？是谁一直想要他的亲笔签名？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.76,1:20:57.20,*CHS,915,0,0,0,,再说，比赛的目的...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.37,1:21:00.89,*CHS,916,0,0,0,,...是促进国际间的魔法交流...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.47,1:21:03.03,*CHS,917,0,0,0,,...广交朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.70,1:21:06.87,*CHS,918,0,0,0,,我觉得他可不只是想交朋友那么简单
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.85,1:21:19.18,*CHS,919,0,0,0,,你到底想不想和我跳舞？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.35,1:21:20.79,*CHS,920,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.03,1:21:31.46,*CHS,921,0,0,0,,- 他在利用你 - 你怎么能这样说？！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.63,1:21:35.83,*CHS,922,0,0,0,,- 我能处理好我自己的事情 - 我倒不觉得，他对你来说太老了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.00,1:21:39.67,*CHS,923,0,0,0,,- 什么？！什么？你竟然真的这样认为？ - 没错，我就是这样想的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.84,1:21:41.97,*CHS,924,0,0,0,,那你应该有好点子了？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.14,1:21:44.13,*CHS,925,0,0,0,,- 继续说 - 下次再有舞会的时候...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.31,1:21:47.44,*CHS,926,0,0,0,,...鼓起勇气 在别人邀请我之前邀请我！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.62,1:21:49.64,*CHS,927,0,0,0,,我可不是最后的替补
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.82,1:21:54.02,*CHS,928,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你完完全全偏题了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.19,1:21:55.52,*CHS,929,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.99,1:21:57.29,*CHS,930,0,0,0,,你去哪里了？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.46,1:21:59.95,*CHS,931,0,0,0,,没关系！都去睡觉吧，你们两个
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.76,1:22:06.79,*CHS,932,0,0,0,,- 她年纪越大越可怕！ - 罗恩，你把一切都搞砸了！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.97,1:22:08.83,*CHS,933,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.11,1:22:16.10,*CHS,934,0,0,0,,不，不要让
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.91,1:22:22.25,*CHS,935,0,0,0,,这魔法消逝
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.02,1:22:26.78,*CHS,936,0,0,0,,答案就在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.11,1:23:27.21,*CHS,937,0,0,0,,让我再看一次
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.52,1:23:31.45,*CHS,938,0,0,0,,是的，时辰就快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.12,1:23:37.99,*CHS,939,0,0,0,,哈利，终于！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.29,1:23:44.63,*CHS,940,0,0,0,,你让开，虫尾巴 让我来好好招待一下我们的客人
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.24,1:23:56.64,*CHS,941,0,0,0,,你没事吧，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.08,1:23:59.84,*CHS,942,0,0,0,,我刚好经过
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.45,1:24:01.68,*CHS,943,0,0,0,,是我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.96,1:24:16.23,*CHS,944,0,0,0,,哈利，几星期前你就说 你已经解开金蛋之谜了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.40,1:24:20.60,*CHS,945,0,0,0,,- 离下个任务只有两天了 - 是吗？我也没办法
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.14,1:24:23.93,*CHS,946,0,0,0,,我猜威克多尔已经解出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.11,1:24:26.94,*CHS,947,0,0,0,,不知道，我们从来没有 讨论过比赛的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.14,1:24:32.74,*CHS,948,0,0,0,,事实上我们都不怎么说话 威克多尔更像是一个身体强健的人
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.48,1:24:39.68,*CHS,949,0,0,0,,我的意思是他不太唠叨
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.15,1:24:42.38,*CHS,950,0,0,0,,大多数时候他就看着我学习
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.19,1:24:45.28,*CHS,951,0,0,0,,其实这样挺讨厌的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.66,1:24:49.36,*CHS,952,0,0,0,,你一定会解开金蛋之谜的对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.20,1:24:51.72,*CHS,953,0,0,0,,你到底想说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.30,1:24:55.27,*CHS,954,0,0,0,,这个任务只是对你的一个考验...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.47,1:24:58.63,*CHS,955,0,0,0,,用最残忍和最残酷方式
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.77,1:25:01.40,*CHS,956,0,0,0,,况且...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.74,1:25:05.64,*CHS,957,0,0,0,,...我都为你担惊受怕
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.58,1:25:09.17,*CHS,958,0,0,0,,虽然你上次勇敢地战胜了火龙
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.78,1:25:12.28,*CHS,959,0,0,0,,但是这次就不一定了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.45,1:25:14.15,*CHS,960,0,0,0,,嗨，波特！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.89,1:25:21.38,*CHS,961,0,0,0,,- 波特！ - 塞德里克
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.10,1:25:25.76,*CHS,962,0,0,0,,你怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.83,1:25:28.23,*CHS,963,0,0,0,,精心备战中
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.77,1:25:33.60,*CHS,964,0,0,0,,我其实还没有好好谢谢你 告诉我巨龙的事
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.77,1:25:36.11,*CHS,965,0,0,0,,没关系 如果你是我，你也会这样做的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.41,1:25:37.97,*CHS,966,0,0,0,,你说对了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.08,1:25:41.64,*CHS,967,0,0,0,,你知道五楼的浴室吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.49,1:25:48.08,*CHS,968,0,0,0,,那是个不错的洗澡的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.46,1:25:52.36,*CHS,969,0,0,0,,带上你的蛋...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.09,1:25:55.82,*CHS,970,0,0,0,,...在热水里好好想想
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.03,1:26:33.19,*CHS,971,0,0,0,,我一定是疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.41,1:26:45.57,*CHS,972,0,0,0,,我的确是疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.25,1:26:51.51,*CHS,973,0,0,0,,如果我是你我会把它放到水里试试
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.69,1:26:53.59,*CHS,974,0,0,0,,桃金娘！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.75,1:26:55.48,*CHS,975,0,0,0,,你好，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.22,1:26:59.49,*CHS,976,0,0,0,,好久不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.76,1:27:07.43,*CHS,977,0,0,0,,那天我在一处截流处玩耍的时候...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.60,1:27:11.04,*CHS,978,0,0,0,,...我看到了一种变身水
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.21,1:27:13.54,*CHS,979,0,0,0,,不要做坏孩子哦，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.71,1:27:15.47,*CHS,980,0,0,0,,变身水？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.24,1:27:20.27,*CHS,981,0,0,0,,桃金娘，你是说把它放到水里试一试吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.09,1:27:28.78,*CHS,982,0,0,0,,他就是那样做的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.62,1:27:31.28,*CHS,983,0,0,0,,另一个男孩...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.69,1:27:34.75,*CHS,984,0,0,0,,...很帅的那个...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.06,1:27:37.29,*CHS,985,0,0,0,,...塞德里克
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.70,1:27:43.36,*CHS,986,0,0,0,,好了，打开它吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.48,1:27:56.47,*CHS,987,0,0,0,,顺着歌声来寻觅我们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.65,1:28:01.31,*CHS,988,0,0,0,,我们不能在陆地上歌唱
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.49,1:28:05.86,*CHS,989,0,0,0,,你有一个小时的时间来找到我们
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.59,1:28:11.26,*CHS,990,0,0,0,,取回我们带走的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.44,1:28:20.67,*CHS,991,0,0,0,,桃金娘...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.34,1:28:25.78,*CHS,992,0,0,0,,...黑湖里面没有人鱼是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.68,1:28:28.34,*CHS,993,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.22,1:28:33.59,*CHS,994,0,0,0,,塞德里克想了好久才想出来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.09,1:28:37.85,*CHS,995,0,0,0,,几乎所有的泡泡都没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.51,1:28:57.48,*CHS,996,0,0,0,,哈利，你再说一遍
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.18,1:29:02.01,*CHS,997,0,0,0,,“顺着歌声来寻觅我们在哪里”
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.18,1:29:04.74,*CHS,998,0,0,0,,很明显是黑湖
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.72,1:29:08.24,*CHS,999,0,0,0,,“一小时之内你一定要找到”
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.42,1:29:11.88,*CHS,1000,0,0,0,,还是很明显，一定是困难重重
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.26,1:29:15.13,*CHS,1001,0,0,0,,困难重重？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.30,1:29:18.56,*CHS,1002,0,0,0,,你什么时候在水下呆过一个小时？赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.10,1:29:23.43,*CHS,1003,0,0,0,,哈利，我们一定能想出办法 我们三个一定能想出来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.60,1:29:26.10,*CHS,1004,0,0,0,,这场热烈的会议该停止了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.27,1:29:28.26,*CHS,1005,0,0,0,,麦格教授在她办公室等你们
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.51,1:29:30.91,*CHS,1006,0,0,0,,没有你，波特 就你们两个，韦斯莱和格兰杰
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.08,1:29:33.74,*CHS,1007,0,0,0,,老师但是 离第二个任务只剩下几小时了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.91,1:29:36.51,*CHS,1008,0,0,0,,没错，我想波特已经准备好了...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.68,1:29:38.55,*CHS,1009,0,0,0,,...该去睡个好觉了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.72,1:29:41.21,*CHS,1010,0,0,0,,快走！立刻！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.20,1:29:53.00,*CHS,1011,0,0,0,,隆巴顿！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.17,1:29:55.19,*CHS,1012,0,0,0,,你帮波特收拾一下书
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.84,1:30:06.04,*CHS,1013,0,0,0,,如果你对植物感兴趣...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.21,1:30:08.81,*CHS,1014,0,0,0,,...那你应该按着 这本书的向导去学草药学
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.42,1:30:13.75,*CHS,1015,0,0,0,,你知道吗在尼泊尔面有个巫师吗？ 他种出了反重心的树
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.92,1:30:17.65,*CHS,1016,0,0,0,,纳威，恕我冒犯...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.26,1:30:19.99,*CHS,1017,0,0,0,,...我对植物一点都不敢兴趣
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.33,1:30:22.02,*CHS,1018,0,0,0,,现在如果...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.20,1:30:27.00,*CHS,1019,0,0,0,,...有一种魔法芜箐 能让我在水下呼吸一小时...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.17,1:30:29.66,*CHS,1020,0,0,0,,...那才是我真正要的，否则
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.84,1:30:33.64,*CHS,1021,0,0,0,,我并不了解芜箐 但是你可以用呼吸草
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.81,1:30:37.71,*CHS,1022,0,0,0,,- 快下注！ - 快下注！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.88,1:30:39.35,*CHS,1023,0,0,0,,大家来啊，不要害羞.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.51,1:30:40.95,*CHS,1024,0,0,0,,- 三个男生 - 一个女生
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.12,1:30:43.28,*CHS,1025,0,0,0,,- 四个都下去了 - 但都能上来吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.45,1:30:44.97,*CHS,1026,0,0,0,,别那么低级
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.59,1:30:47.42,*CHS,1027,0,0,0,,- 谁还要下注？ - 芙蓉一赔一
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.59,1:30:51.58,*CHS,1028,0,0,0,,- 你确定这能行吗，纳威？ - 肯定行
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.76,1:30:53.69,*CHS,1029,0,0,0,,- 维持一个小时？ - 应该会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.86,1:30:55.35,*CHS,1030,0,0,0,,应该会？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.53,1:30:57.72,*CHS,1031,0,0,0,,这得看情况...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.90,1:31:00.37,*CHS,1032,0,0,0,,...有的能活跃于淡水，有的则喜欢咸水
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.53,1:31:03.20,*CHS,1033,0,0,0,,你怎么现在才告诉我？ 开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.37,1:31:05.34,*CHS,1034,0,0,0,,我只是想帮你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.51,1:31:08.60,*CHS,1035,0,0,0,,不管怎样，你的主意 比赫敏和罗恩的好多了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.78,1:31:10.54,*CHS,1036,0,0,0,,他们人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.71,1:31:13.74,*CHS,1037,0,0,0,,- 你看上去有点紧张，哈利 - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.75,1:31:22.98,*CHS,1038,0,0,0,,欢迎来到第二场比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.16,1:31:26.85,*CHS,1039,0,0,0,,昨晚，我们从各个选手那儿 取走一样东西
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.03,1:31:28.39,*CHS,1040,0,0,0,,一样财富
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.56,1:31:31.19,*CHS,1041,0,0,0,,每个人的财富...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.37,1:31:34.06,*CHS,1042,0,0,0,,...都被安置于黑湖之中
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.23,1:31:35.79,*CHS,1043,0,0,0,,获胜的标准是...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.97,1:31:39.80,*CHS,1044,0,0,0,,...找到你们的财富然后安全抵达湖面
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.97,1:31:42.60,*CHS,1045,0,0,0,,- 有了这个就太简单了 - 把呼吸草放到你的嘴里
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.78,1:31:46.41,*CHS,1046,0,0,0,,他们只能维持一小时 记住只有一小时
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.58,1:31:50.52,*CHS,1047,0,0,0,,超过一小时就没救了 魔法也救不了他们
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.98,1:31:53.25,*CHS,1048,0,0,0,,你们可以在炮声后开始
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.78,1:32:22.72,*CHS,1049,0,0,0,,- 他怎么了？ - 不知道，我看不到他
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.05,1:32:27.04,*CHS,1050,0,0,0,,哦，天哪 是我害了哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.89,1:32:30.79,*CHS,1051,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.96,1:32:33.59,*CHS,1052,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.17,1:33:55.30,*CHS,1053,0,0,0,,布斯巴顿的选手 德拉库尔小姐...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.48,1:33:58.00,*CHS,1054,0,0,0,,...很不幸被迫退出...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.65,1:34:01.74,*CHS,1055,0,0,0,,...无法再继续接下来的比赛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.53,1:35:21.39,*CHS,1056,0,0,0,,但她也是我的朋友！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.96,1:35:24.69,*CHS,1057,0,0,0,,只能救一个！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.05,1:36:17.91,*CHS,1058,0,0,0,,我们下去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.89,1:36:30.76,*CHS,1059,0,0,0,,克鲁姆！克鲁姆！克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.29,1:37:30.02,*CHS,1060,0,0,0,,好啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.14,1:37:50.20,*CHS,1061,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.45,1:37:57.14,*CHS,1062,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.45,1:38:00.92,*CHS,1063,0,0,0,,他没事
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.12,1:38:03.56,*CHS,1064,0,0,0,,他没事，巴蒂！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.72,1:38:07.16,*CHS,1065,0,0,0,,- 给他拿块毛巾 - 所有的裁判过来集合！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.76,1:38:11.25,*CHS,1066,0,0,0,,你救了她，尽管你可以不用救她
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.90,1:38:13.59,*CHS,1067,0,0,0,,我的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.00,1:38:15.56,*CHS,1068,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.37,1:38:19.10,*CHS,1069,0,0,0,,还有你，你也帮了她
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.74,1:38:22.77,*CHS,1070,0,0,0,,恩，就那么一点点
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.98,1:38:31.14,*CHS,1071,0,0,0,,- 哈利！ - 赫敏！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.32,1:38:33.98,*CHS,1072,0,0,0,,你没事吧？ 你一定冻坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.22,1:38:37.16,*CHS,1073,0,0,0,,我非常钦佩你
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.32,1:38:39.35,*CHS,1074,0,0,0,,我是最后一名，赫敏
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.19,1:38:44.32,*CHS,1075,0,0,0,,倒数第二 芙蓉退出了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.50,1:38:47.73,*CHS,1076,0,0,0,,克鲁姆！克鲁姆！克鲁姆
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.90,1:38:50.80,*CHS,1077,0,0,0,,- 好啊！干得漂亮！ - 安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.14,1:38:55.73,*CHS,1078,0,0,0,,注意了！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.21,1:39:00.08,*CHS,1079,0,0,0,,获胜者是迪戈里先生...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.51,1:39:04.01,*CHS,1080,0,0,0,,...他使用气泡膜帮助呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.18,1:39:06.85,*CHS,1081,0,0,0,,波特本来可以第一个上岸...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.02,1:39:11.98,*CHS,1082,0,0,0,,...但是他救了韦斯莱以后...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.16,1:39:16.42,*CHS,1083,0,0,0,,...还毅然决定营救他人 我们同意授予他...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.60,1:39:18.59,*CHS,1084,0,0,0,,...第二名...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.77,1:39:20.26,*CHS,1085,0,0,0,,- 第二名！ - 干得漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.43,1:39:23.06,*CHS,1086,0,0,0,,...因为他舍己为人的精神！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.34,1:39:25.86,*CHS,1087,0,0,0,,好啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.38,1:39:31.17,*CHS,1088,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 舍己为人的精神？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.34,1:39:32.97,*CHS,1089,0,0,0,,- 太棒了 - 舍己为人？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.15,1:39:35.51,*CHS,1090,0,0,0,,坏事在你手里也变成好事
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.68,1:39:38.34,*CHS,1091,0,0,0,,- 做的好，舍己为人的孩子 - 恭喜你波特
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.52,1:39:40.18,*CHS,1092,0,0,0,,- 战绩不错 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.35,1:39:41.88,*CHS,1093,0,0,0,,干得不错孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.06,1:39:45.29,*CHS,1094,0,0,0,,- 等会在海格那儿见，哈利 - 抱歉，我们一直都没有机会谈谈
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.46,1:39:49.45,*CHS,1095,0,0,0,,我已经听了很多遍你的故事了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.46,1:39:53.92,*CHS,1096,0,0,0,,印象深刻，真的 当然，也很悲伤...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.10,1:39:56.09,*CHS,1097,0,0,0,,...失去了家庭
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.10,1:40:00.27,*CHS,1098,0,0,0,,无法再次团聚，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.51,1:40:04.60,*CHS,1099,0,0,0,,但是生活还得继续...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.28,1:40:06.94,*CHS,1100,0,0,0,,...迎接新的一天到来
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.82,1:40:12.55,*CHS,1101,0,0,0,,我敢肯定你父母一定会为你骄傲的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.72,1:40:14.19,*CHS,1102,0,0,0,,巴蒂！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.35,1:40:18.48,*CHS,1103,0,0,0,,你不是想让波特夏天去你那里打工吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.66,1:40:21.86,*CHS,1104,0,0,0,,上次你带去的那个小男孩 就一直没有回来过！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.34,1:40:36.24,*CHS,1105,0,0,0,,他们还说我是疯子！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.52,1:40:49.25,*CHS,1106,0,0,0,,我们初次见面还记忆犹新
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.42,1:40:52.45,*CHS,1107,0,0,0,,你是我见过的最奇怪的孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.96,1:40:55.52,*CHS,1108,0,0,0,,你总是让我想到我自己
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.70,1:40:59.72,*CHS,1109,0,0,0,,- 四年后的我们 - 我们还是那张脸
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.90,1:41:03.23,*CHS,1110,0,0,0,,是啊，也许吧 但我们却是好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.40,1:41:04.96,*CHS,1111,0,0,0,,当然，还有哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.14,1:41:10.51,*CHS,1112,0,0,0,,而且很快就会成为 最年轻的三强赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.71,1:41:12.74,*CHS,1113,0,0,0,,万岁！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.18,1:41:16.67,*CHS,1114,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨，霍格沃茨 霍格，沃茨，霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.85,1:41:19.48,*CHS,1115,0,0,0,,教我们一些东西吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.46,1:41:30.95,*CHS,1116,0,0,0,,克劳奇先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.04,1:41:41.63,*CHS,1117,0,0,0,,有人死在这儿，福吉 而且他不会是最后一个，你应该采取行动
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.81,1:41:43.37,*CHS,1118,0,0,0,,这样不行
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.54,1:41:47.60,*CHS,1119,0,0,0,,在这种非常时期，巫师界希望 得到他们的领导的支持，邓不利多
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.78,1:41:49.11,*CHS,1120,0,0,0,,让他们自己看看！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.28,1:41:53.38,*CHS,1121,0,0,0,,三强争霸赛不会被取消 我不会让别人认为我是胆小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.55,1:41:56.75,*CHS,1122,0,0,0,,真正的领导人只会做正确的事 他不会管别人怎么想
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.92,1:41:59.72,*CHS,1123,0,0,0,,- 你是在对我说话吗？ - 抱歉，先生
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.89,1:42:03.56,*CHS,1124,0,0,0,,我们的对话已经不再是秘密了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.90,1:42:09.46,*CHS,1125,0,0,0,,你好，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.64,1:42:11.93,*CHS,1126,0,0,0,,很高兴又见到你哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.77,1:42:14.30,*CHS,1127,0,0,0,,我可以等会再来
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.47,1:42:17.81,*CHS,1128,0,0,0,,哦，没事了我跟部长已经谈好了 我等会就回来
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.98,1:42:20.54,*CHS,1129,0,0,0,,您请，部长
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.08,1:42:23.07,*CHS,1130,0,0,0,,您的帽子，先生
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.25,1:42:26.91,*CHS,1131,0,0,0,,哈利，不用拘束，自己拿糖吃
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.09,1:42:30.32,*CHS,1132,0,0,0,,但是我提醒你，他们很难应付
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.75,1:44:03.34,*CHS,1133,0,0,0,,教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.52,1:44:06.04,*CHS,1134,0,0,0,,- 教授 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.96,1:44:20.73,*CHS,1135,0,0,0,,伊戈尔·卡卡洛夫应你要求 把你从阿兹卡班带到议会提供证据...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.90,1:44:22.83,*CHS,1136,0,0,0,,...如果你的证词无误
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.00,1:44:25.70,*CHS,1137,0,0,0,,证据确凿...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.87,1:44:29.93,*CHS,1138,0,0,0,,...议会将考虑将你当场释放
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.11,1:44:34.71,*CHS,1139,0,0,0,,但是现在，你仍是一个有罪的食死徒
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.88,1:44:36.58,*CHS,1140,0,0,0,,你接受对你的条款吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.15,1:44:39.85,*CHS,1141,0,0,0,,- 我接受，长官 - 你有什么证据？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.19,1:44:42.65,*CHS,1142,0,0,0,,我有名单，长官
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.19,1:44:46.78,*CHS,1143,0,0,0,,有一个人叫罗斯，埃文·罗斯
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.46,1:44:51.99,*CHS,1144,0,0,0,,- 罗斯已经死了 - 就会胡扯一些事来搬弄是非...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.17,1:44:54.29,*CHS,1145,0,0,0,,- ...不是吗？ - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.47,1:44:57.10,*CHS,1146,0,0,0,,- 这就是你能提供的所有证据吗？ - 不，不
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.27,1:45:00.57,*CHS,1147,0,0,0,,还个人叫洛克伍德，他是一个间谍
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.74,1:45:03.11,*CHS,1148,0,0,0,,教堂部门的奥古斯·洛克伍德？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.28,1:45:04.47,*CHS,1149,0,0,0,,对，就是他
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.64,1:45:08.31,*CHS,1150,0,0,0,,他把消息发送到外面去的给“那个人”
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.55,1:45:12.81,*CHS,1151,0,0,0,,很好，议会会考虑的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.99,1:45:14.95,*CHS,1152,0,0,0,,目前你还要被遣送回阿兹卡班
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.12,1:45:19.85,*CHS,1153,0,0,0,,不！不！不要！等一下，我还有 斯内普！西弗勒斯·斯内普
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.03,1:45:23.00,*CHS,1154,0,0,0,,议会应该看过我呈上的证据
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.16,1:45:27.12,*CHS,1155,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯·斯内普曾经确实是食死徒 但是他在伏地魔垮台之前...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.30,1:45:30.29,*CHS,1156,0,0,0,,- ...就加入了我们的行列 - 他在撒谎！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.47,1:45:33.91,*CHS,1157,0,0,0,,- 今天他已经不再是食死徒了 - 他还是对黑暗魔头效忠的！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.07,1:45:36.37,*CHS,1158,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.98,1:45:40.41,*CHS,1159,0,0,0,,除非证人还能提供其他人的名字...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.58,1:45:42.71,*CHS,1160,0,0,0,,...否则本庭宣布结束
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.88,1:45:44.98,*CHS,1161,0,0,0,,噢，不，不，不！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.89,1:45:47.35,*CHS,1162,0,0,0,,我还知道一个
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.52,1:45:50.08,*CHS,1163,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 名字
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.26,1:45:51.72,*CHS,1164,0,0,0,,- 嗯？ - 我知道的...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.89,1:45:53.92,*CHS,1165,0,0,0,,...他还参与了绑架...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.09,1:45:56.25,*CHS,1166,0,0,0,,...还用了诅咒魔法...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.43,1:45:59.92,*CHS,1167,0,0,0,,...折磨弗兰克·隆巴顿和他的妻子！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.10,1:46:02.43,*CHS,1168,0,0,0,,他的名字 告诉我这个卑劣的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.60,1:46:05.13,*CHS,1169,0,0,0,,巴蒂·克劳奇...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.84,1:46:08.86,*CHS,1170,0,0,0,,...小巴蒂·克劳奇
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.35,1:46:20.05,*CHS,1171,0,0,0,,抓住他！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.69,1:46:27.32,*CHS,1172,0,0,0,,放开你们的手！ 你们这些可怜的人！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.03,1:46:30.62,*CHS,1173,0,0,0,,你好，父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.03,1:46:34.09,*CHS,1174,0,0,0,,你不是我儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.41,1:46:49.87,*CHS,1175,0,0,0,,好奇不是罪过，哈利 但是你要小心谨慎
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.25,1:46:52.65,*CHS,1176,0,0,0,,这是记忆盘
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.82,1:46:57.48,*CHS,1177,0,0,0,,对我而言非常有用 当脑子里的事情杂乱无章时
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.66,1:47:01.18,*CHS,1178,0,0,0,,你可以用它再来回顾一下 我做过的事
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.66,1:47:04.63,*CHS,1179,0,0,0,,知道吗哈利，我搜索了很久...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.80,1:47:06.36,*CHS,1180,0,0,0,,...想找一些细节...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.77,1:47:09.89,*CHS,1181,0,0,0,,...一些我没有注意到的事...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.07,1:47:14.27,*CHS,1182,0,0,0,,...一些能解开噩耗之谜的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.07,1:47:18.94,*CHS,1183,0,0,0,,每次感觉就快要找到了 线索又消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.01,1:47:21.60,*CHS,1184,0,0,0,,我真是心急如焚啊
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.95,1:47:25.71,*CHS,1185,0,0,0,,老师？克劳奇的儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.49,1:47:28.55,*CHS,1186,0,0,0,,后来他怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.72,1:47:33.52,*CHS,1187,0,0,0,,被遣送到阿兹卡班去了 这对巴蒂的打击很大
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.19,1:47:37.79,*CHS,1188,0,0,0,,但是他也没有选择 证据确凿
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.27,1:47:42.26,*CHS,1189,0,0,0,,- 你问这干嘛？ - 只是我...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.00,1:47:45.10,*CHS,1190,0,0,0,,我梦见过他
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.37,1:47:50.17,*CHS,1191,0,0,0,,那是在夏天，开学以前
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.31,1:47:55.30,*CHS,1192,0,0,0,,在梦里，我在一幢房子里
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.52,1:48:00.28,*CHS,1193,0,0,0,,伏地魔也在那里 只有他不是人形
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.45,1:48:04.08,*CHS,1194,0,0,0,,虫尾巴也在那里 还有克劳奇的儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.46,1:48:07.29,*CHS,1195,0,0,0,,- 其它的梦都跟这个一样？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.13,1:48:09.75,*CHS,1196,0,0,0,,总是重复做同一个
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.80,1:48:15.13,*CHS,1197,0,0,0,,老师，这些梦...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.30,1:48:20.50,*CHS,1198,0,0,0,,...我所看到的 你不认为它是在真的发生,对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.14,1:48:25.11,*CHS,1199,0,0,0,,我想你还是不要去多想这些梦了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.61,1:48:27.58,*CHS,1200,0,0,0,,我觉得最好你...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.22,1:48:34.98,*CHS,1201,0,0,0,,...把这些都忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.26,1:48:48.22,*CHS,1202,0,0,0,,这是一个信号，西弗勒斯 你和我都知道这是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.94,1:48:58.14,*CHS,1203,0,0,0,,波特！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.31,1:49:00.84,*CHS,1204,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.95,1:49:09.72,*CHS,1205,0,0,0,,恭喜你，你在黑湖里面所用的是...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.89,1:49:12.15,*CHS,1206,0,0,0,,呼吸草，我说的对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.93,1:49:14.45,*CHS,1207,0,0,0,,是的，老师
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.39,1:49:16.79,*CHS,1208,0,0,0,,真聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.63,1:49:22.59,*CHS,1209,0,0,0,,很少人知道呼吸草
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.40,1:49:26.89,*CHS,1210,0,0,0,,那可是很难弄到的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.61,1:49:30.54,*CHS,1211,0,0,0,,这个也同样
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.75,1:49:36.41,*CHS,1212,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.72,1:49:39.15,*CHS,1213,0,0,0,,泡泡汁，老师？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.72,1:49:41.62,*CHS,1214,0,0,0,,它其效无比
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.36,1:49:46.05,*CHS,1215,0,0,0,,只要三滴就能让你 最私处的秘密暴露无遗
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.23,1:49:51.39,*CHS,1216,0,0,0,,但是对学生使用它是绝对禁止的 但是...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.06,1:49:55.09,*CHS,1217,0,0,0,,...你要是再敢从我的 私人收藏中偷东西的话...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.27,1:50:00.14,*CHS,1218,0,0,0,,...说不定我不小心就 撒一点在你的南瓜脑袋里
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.31,1:50:04.71,*CHS,1219,0,0,0,,- 我没偷过任何东西 - 不要跟我说谎
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.85,1:50:11.55,*CHS,1220,0,0,0,,呼吸草也许不是你做的 但是毒蛇皮和苍蝇翅膀呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.25,1:50:15.58,*CHS,1221,0,0,0,,你和你的伙伴还拿了变身水 相信我...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.76,1:50:17.95,*CHS,1222,0,0,0,,...我一定会查出真相的
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.78,1:50:46.38,*CHS,1223,0,0,0,,- 好啊！ - 好！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.57,1:51:07.10,*CHS,1224,0,0,0,,肃静！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.34,1:51:16.68,*CHS,1225,0,0,0,,今天早时穆迪教授 把火焰杯放到了迷宫的深处
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.85,1:51:21.81,*CHS,1226,0,0,0,,只有他才知道放到了哪里 由于迪戈里...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.92,1:51:25.72,*CHS,1227,0,0,0,,...和波特...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.59,1:51:29.32,*CHS,1228,0,0,0,,...并列第一...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.50,1:51:33.63,*CHS,1229,0,0,0,,...他们将最先进入迷宫 接着是克鲁姆...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.87,1:51:38.33,*CHS,1230,0,0,0,,- 然后是德拉库尔 - 加油！克鲁姆！克鲁姆！克鲁姆！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.21,1:51:42.30,*CHS,1231,0,0,0,,首先拿到奖杯的选手将成为冠军！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.65,1:51:49.38,*CHS,1232,0,0,0,,老师们会在周围巡视
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.55,1:51:52.48,*CHS,1233,0,0,0,,在比赛时 如果有任何选手想退出比赛...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.65,1:51:57.15,*CHS,1234,0,0,0,,...他或她只要用魔棒发送信号弹
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.49,1:52:01.39,*CHS,1235,0,0,0,,选手们过来！快一点！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.53,1:52:08.86,*CHS,1236,0,0,0,,在迷宫里 没有龙也没有水妖
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.04,1:52:12.40,*CHS,1237,0,0,0,,但是有更高的挑战
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.57,1:52:15.60,*CHS,1238,0,0,0,,人会在里面发生变化
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.78,1:52:17.47,*CHS,1239,0,0,0,,尽量找到火焰杯
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.64,1:52:22.41,*CHS,1240,0,0,0,,但是要小心，否则你会迷失自我
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.88,1:52:26.88,*CHS,1241,0,0,0,,选手们准备好！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.93,1:52:37.40,*CHS,1242,0,0,0,,好运！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.80,1:52:39.73,*CHS,1243,0,0,0,,- 孩子 - 一会见，父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.10,1:52:44.70,*CHS,1244,0,0,0,,我数三下，一...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.48,1:56:13.71,*CHS,1245,0,0,0,,芙蓉？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.38,1:56:16.81,*CHS,1246,0,0,0,,芙蓉
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.39,1:56:22.22,*CHS,1247,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.89,1:57:02.36,*CHS,1248,0,0,0,,趴下！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.93,1:57:04.66,*CHS,1249,0,0,0,,趴下！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.30,1:57:06.53,*CHS,1250,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.14,1:57:19.34,*CHS,1251,0,0,0,,不，不要，停手 他被施了巫术，塞德里克！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.51,1:57:21.57,*CHS,1252,0,0,0,,- 让开！ - 他被施了巫术！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.19,1:57:34.89,*CHS,1253,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.78,1:57:57.54,*CHS,1254,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.85,1:58:01.51,*CHS,1255,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.89,1:58:05.32,*CHS,1256,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.79,1:58:09.35,*CHS,1257,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.33,1:58:13.13,*CHS,1258,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.92,1:58:32.41,*CHS,1259,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.82,1:58:37.52,*CHS,1260,0,0,0,,那一刻我以为你不管我了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.69,1:58:39.42,*CHS,1261,0,0,0,,那一刻我确实想过
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.29,1:58:42.45,*CHS,1262,0,0,0,,只是一场游戏，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.50,1:58:44.89,*CHS,1263,0,0,0,,一场游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.34,1:58:51.96,*CHS,1264,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.11,1:59:05.14,*CHS,1265,0,0,0,,去拿吧，你救了我，去拿吧
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.32,1:59:07.31,*CHS,1266,0,0,0,,- 一起拿，一，二... - 二...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.49,1:59:08.71,*CHS,1267,0,0,0,,- 三！ - 三！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.17,1:59:24.10,*CHS,1268,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 没事，你呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.18,1:59:32.51,*CHS,1269,0,0,0,,我们在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.22,1:59:39.84,*CHS,1270,0,0,0,,我曾经来过这里
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.49,1:59:45.08,*CHS,1271,0,0,0,,他是个港口钥
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.86,1:59:51.13,*CHS,1272,0,0,0,,- 哈利，这个杯子是个港口钥 - 在梦里我来过这里
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.20,1:59:56.60,*CHS,1273,0,0,0,,塞德里克，快回到火焰杯那里，快！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.77,1:59:58.74,*CHS,1274,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.98,2:00:06.88,*CHS,1275,0,0,0,,- 哈利，那是什么？ - 快回到火焰杯那里！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.52,2:00:16.85,*CHS,1276,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？你想怎样？ - 干掉多余的那个
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.02,2:00:19.79,*CHS,1277,0,0,0,,- [咒语] - 不！塞德里克！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.10,2:00:32.97,*CHS,1278,0,0,0,,快点，现在就开始！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.92,2:00:47.41,*CHS,1279,0,0,0,,你父亲的骨头...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.59,2:00:49.88,*CHS,1280,0,0,0,,...虽然不情愿地献出
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.36,2:01:00.39,*CHS,1281,0,0,0,,奴婢的肉...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.43,2:01:05.60,*CHS,1282,0,0,0,,...高尚的奉献
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.71,2:01:13.44,*CHS,1283,0,0,0,,敌人的鲜血...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.25,2:01:21.74,*CHS,1284,0,0,0,,...贪婪地吸取
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.79,2:01:30.76,*CHS,1285,0,0,0,,伏地魔又一次复活了...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.53,2:01:33.46,*CHS,1286,0,0,0,,...又一次
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.86,2:02:40.26,*CHS,1287,0,0,0,,我的魔杖，虫尾巴
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.81,2:02:51.78,*CHS,1288,0,0,0,,伸出你的手臂
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.94,2:02:53.54,*CHS,1289,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.71,2:02:56.34,*CHS,1290,0,0,0,,主人，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.52,2:02:57.98,*CHS,1291,0,0,0,,另一只手臂，虫尾巴
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.62,2:03:40.52,*CHS,1292,0,0,0,,欢迎，我的朋友们
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.93,2:03:44.69,*CHS,1293,0,0,0,,已经13年了...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.33,2:03:50.83,*CHS,1294,0,0,0,,...今天你们又重新聚集在我的面前 就好象是昨天发生的一样
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.77,2:03:54.71,*CHS,1295,0,0,0,,我承认我有点...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.17,2:03:56.73,*CHS,1296,0,0,0,,...失望
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.41,2:03:59.50,*CHS,1297,0,0,0,,你们没有一个人试图来找寻我
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.68,2:04:03.05,*CHS,1298,0,0,0,,克拉普丝！格鲁穆！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.95,2:04:05.28,*CHS,1299,0,0,0,,哥卢！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.79,2:04:09.41,*CHS,1300,0,0,0,,就连你...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.29,2:04:15.23,*CHS,1301,0,0,0,,...卢修斯
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.06,2:04:21.90,*CHS,1302,0,0,0,,主人，只要我有您的踪迹 或者一丝丝的传言…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.07,2:04:25.06,*CHS,1303,0,0,0,,有我的踪迹的，我圆滑的朋友 不仅仅是传言
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.24,2:04:30.40,*CHS,1304,0,0,0,,我会证明给您看的，我的主人 我从来没有改换门庭
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.11,2:04:37.74,*CHS,1305,0,0,0,,在您不在的这期间 我在众人面前的所作所为...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.75,2:04:42.38,*CHS,1306,0,0,0,,...只不过是我完美的掩饰罢了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.75,2:04:44.31,*CHS,1307,0,0,0,,我可是愿意回到您的身边的
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.79,2:04:50.69,*CHS,1308,0,0,0,,因为你害怕！不是忠心！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.83,2:04:57.60,*CHS,1309,0,0,0,,不过，这几个月的时间里 你至少表现出来还有点用，虫尾巴
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.81,2:05:05.14,*CHS,1310,0,0,0,,谢谢，主人
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.74,2:05:07.47,*CHS,1311,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.58,2:05:12.95,*CHS,1312,0,0,0,,- 好个帅小伙 - 别碰他！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.42,2:05:15.91,*CHS,1313,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.09,2:05:18.89,*CHS,1314,0,0,0,,我差点都忘记你还在这里了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.06,2:05:23.46,*CHS,1315,0,0,0,,站在我父亲的尸骨上
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.63,2:05:24.99,*CHS,1316,0,0,0,,怎么介绍你呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.16,2:05:29.46,*CHS,1317,0,0,0,,...这些时间以来 你都已经是和我齐名的人物了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.14,2:05:34.80,*CHS,1318,0,0,0,,大难不死的男孩
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.97,2:05:37.87,*CHS,1319,0,0,0,,你的传奇中有多少谎言，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.04,2:05:42.04,*CHS,1320,0,0,0,,要我提醒你13年前的那个晚上 到底发生了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.21,2:05:46.95,*CHS,1321,0,0,0,,要我道出到底是什么 让我丧失了法力么？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.12,2:05:48.71,*CHS,1322,0,0,0,,是的，要我说吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.05,2:05:50.39,*CHS,1323,0,0,0,,因为爱
Dialogue: 0,2:05:50.56,2:05:55.05,*CHS,1324,0,0,0,,你知道么，当那可爱的莉莉·波特 为了她唯一的儿子...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.23,2:05:57.82,*CHS,1325,0,0,0,,...她给与了他终极的保护
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.23,2:06:00.03,*CHS,1326,0,0,0,,我丝毫碰不到他
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.27,2:06:03.39,*CHS,1327,0,0,0,,那是个古老的魔法
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.57,2:06:05.83,*CHS,1328,0,0,0,,我应该预见到的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.00,2:06:07.80,*CHS,1329,0,0,0,,不过没关系，没关系
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.97,2:06:10.17,*CHS,1330,0,0,0,,一切都改变了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.94,2:06:14.43,*CHS,1331,0,0,0,,我可以碰你了...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.05,2:06:16.78,*CHS,1332,0,0,0,,...现在
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.92,2:06:26.25,*CHS,1333,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.60,2:06:36.29,*CHS,1334,0,0,0,,诧异你那几滴血 能给我带来那么大的转变吧，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.44,2:06:39.16,*CHS,1335,0,0,0,,拿起你的魔杖来，波特！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.77,2:06:43.00,*CHS,1336,0,0,0,,我叫你拿起来！ 起来！起来！
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.58,2:06:46.91,*CHS,1337,0,0,0,,你应该学过怎么决斗吧，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.08,2:06:49.51,*CHS,1338,0,0,0,,首先，我们要互相鞠躬
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.68,2:06:52.05,*CHS,1339,0,0,0,,来吧，哈利 礼节是一定要遵守的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.22,2:06:55.45,*CHS,1340,0,0,0,,邓布利多可不想让你 忘记了自己的风度，不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.62,2:06:56.95,*CHS,1341,0,0,0,,我说了，鞠躬
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.82,2:07:03.16,*CHS,1342,0,0,0,,- 现在好多了，那么... - 不
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.56,2:07:05.43,*CHS,1343,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.90,2:07:09.63,*CHS,1344,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.70,2:07:12.64,*CHS,1345,0,0,0,,好孩子，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.80,2:07:14.93,*CHS,1346,0,0,0,,你的父母应该为你而感到骄傲
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.24,2:07:18.64,*CHS,1347,0,0,0,,尤其是你那个麻瓜母亲
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.81,2:07:20.40,*CHS,1348,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.42,2:07:25.82,*CHS,1349,0,0,0,,我要杀了你，哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.98,2:07:27.98,*CHS,1350,0,0,0,,我要毁了你
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.19,2:07:35.75,*CHS,1351,0,0,0,,过了今晚，没人再能质疑我的力量
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.39,2:07:38.95,*CHS,1352,0,0,0,,过了今晚 如果再有人提起你的话
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.13,2:07:41.79,*CHS,1353,0,0,0,,...他们只可能谈起你是怎么...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.10,2:07:43.93,*CHS,1354,0,0,0,,...苦苦求死的
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.10,2:07:47.87,*CHS,1355,0,0,0,,但我是个仁慈的魔头...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.41,2:07:50.00,*CHS,1356,0,0,0,,...非常仁慈
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.34,2:07:51.83,*CHS,1357,0,0,0,,起来！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.85,2:07:58.82,*CHS,1358,0,0,0,,不要背对着我躲起来，哈利·波特！
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.98,2:08:01.25,*CHS,1359,0,0,0,,我要你看着我是怎么杀你的！
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.42,2:08:04.62,*CHS,1360,0,0,0,,我要看到光明从你的眼眸中消失
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.57,2:08:20.30,*CHS,1361,0,0,0,,那就满足你的要求
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.34,2:08:23.74,*CHS,1362,0,0,0,,- [咒语] - [咒语]
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.26,2:08:43.92,*CHS,1363,0,0,0,,别插手，让我来结果他
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.50,2:08:50.20,*CHS,1364,0,0,0,,他是我的！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.27,2:09:27.26,*CHS,1365,0,0,0,,哈利，当法术一旦切断的时候 你必须跑到到港口钥那里
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.44,2:09:29.50,*CHS,1366,0,0,0,,我们能为你赢得一点时间...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.67,2:09:31.44,*CHS,1367,0,0,0,,...不过就一点，明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.64,2:09:35.67,*CHS,1368,0,0,0,,哈利，把我的身体带回去，好么？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.85,2:09:38.37,*CHS,1369,0,0,0,,把我的身体带到我父亲身边
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.42,2:09:40.75,*CHS,1370,0,0,0,,切断
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.22,2:09:43.19,*CHS,1371,0,0,0,,亲爱的，准备好
Dialogue: 0,2:09:44.02,2:09:46.65,*CHS,1372,0,0,0,,切断！切断吧！
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.40,2:09:53.76,*CHS,1373,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.47,2:10:01.46,*CHS,1374,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.22,2:10:15.81,*CHS,1375,0,0,0,,他做到了！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.06,2:10:18.72,*CHS,1376,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.49,2:10:22.98,*CHS,1377,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.20,2:10:27.43,*CHS,1378,0,0,0,,不！不！不，不要！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.73,2:10:29.60,*CHS,1379,0,0,0,,天啊，邓不利多 发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.90,2:10:32.46,*CHS,1380,0,0,0,,他回来了，他回来了！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.64,2:10:34.66,*CHS,1381,0,0,0,,伏地魔复活了！
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.84,2:10:37.24,*CHS,1382,0,0,0,,塞德里克，他要求我 把他的身体带回来
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.41,2:10:39.74,*CHS,1383,0,0,0,,我不能把他留在那里
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.91,2:10:42.71,*CHS,1384,0,0,0,,没事了，哈利，没事了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.88,2:10:45.18,*CHS,1385,0,0,0,,他回家了，你们两个都回家了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:45.35,2:10:48.98,*CHS,1386,0,0,0,,让大家都坐回原位！ 有个孩子被杀了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.06,2:10:55.72,*CHS,1387,0,0,0,,尸体必须被移走，邓布利多 这里有太多人了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.99,2:10:57.69,*CHS,1388,0,0,0,,让我过去
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.86,2:10:59.39,*CHS,1389,0,0,0,,让我过去！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:01.30,2:11:02.56,*CHS,1390,0,0,0,,让我过去！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.73,2:11:04.13,*CHS,1391,0,0,0,,那是我的孩子！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.44,2:11:06.87,*CHS,1392,0,0,0,,我的孩子！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:09.71,2:11:12.44,*CHS,1393,0,0,0,,我的孩子！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:15.25,2:11:18.81,*CHS,1394,0,0,0,,- 好了，好了，不要太难过！ - 不
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.98,2:11:21.95,*CHS,1395,0,0,0,,现在你不应该在这儿
Dialogue: 0,2:11:22.62,2:11:24.82,*CHS,1396,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.89,2:11:30.29,*CHS,1397,0,0,0,,没事了，有我在，有我在
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.46,2:11:33.79,*CHS,1398,0,0,0,,好了，冷静点
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.80,2:11:39.60,*CHS,1399,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.71,2:11:42.57,*CHS,1400,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,2:12:24.98,2:12:26.68,*CHS,1401,0,0,0,,你还好么，波特？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:27.25,2:12:29.19,*CHS,1402,0,0,0,,那里还疼么？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.35,2:12:31.15,*CHS,1403,0,0,0,,现在好多了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.09,2:12:34.18,*CHS,1404,0,0,0,,让我来帮你检查一下
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.33,2:12:39.32,*CHS,1405,0,0,0,,奖杯是港口钥
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.03,2:12:43.86,*CHS,1406,0,0,0,,有人给它施了魔法
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.14,2:12:46.23,*CHS,1407,0,0,0,,它什么样子的？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.57,2:12:48.23,*CHS,1408,0,0,0,,- 他长什么样子？ - 谁？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:48.41,2:12:50.17,*CHS,1409,0,0,0,,黑暗魔头
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.48,2:12:55.57,*CHS,1410,0,0,0,,当你站在他面前的时候 他什么样子？
Dialogue: 0,2:12:56.85,2:12:58.65,*CHS,1411,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.49,2:13:04.42,*CHS,1412,0,0,0,,就好象一下子掉进了 我自己的一个梦里...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.39,2:13:09.38,*CHS,1413,0,0,0,,...一个噩梦里
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.11,2:13:29.67,*CHS,1414,0,0,0,,有其他人么？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.85,2:13:32.11,*CHS,1415,0,0,0,,有其他人在墓地里吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:13:36.05,2:13:37.45,*CHS,1416,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.16,2:13:42.09,*CHS,1417,0,0,0,,好像没有和你提过 关于墓地的事情吧，教授
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.53,2:13:52.80,*CHS,1418,0,0,0,,“龙真是一种神奇的生物，不是吗？”
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.21,2:14:00.27,*CHS,1419,0,0,0,,如果没有我的建议 那个傻蛋会把你带进森林么？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:00.45,2:14:02.35,*CHS,1420,0,0,0,,如果没有我的提示？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:05.88,2:14:09.58,*CHS,1421,0,0,0,,你认为那个桃金娘会知道 要把金蛋放到水里吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.75,2:14:12.25,*CHS,1422,0,0,0,,要不是我先告诉他
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.86,2:14:16.52,*CHS,1423,0,0,0,,你认为纳威·隆巴顿 会找到呼吸草吗...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.69,2:14:19.89,*CHS,1424,0,0,0,,...如果不是我给了隆巴顿一本书 告诉他那里可以找到
Dialogue: 0,2:14:20.06,2:14:21.62,*CHS,1425,0,0,0,,知道吗！
Dialogue: 0,2:14:30.04,2:14:34.03,*CHS,1426,0,0,0,,从一开始就是你 是你把我的名字放在了火焰杯里
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.61,2:14:38.24,*CHS,1427,0,0,0,,- 是你对克鲁姆施咒，但是你… -“但是，但是”
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.42,2:14:40.58,*CHS,1428,0,0,0,,你赢是因为我给你铺好了路
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.22,2:14:44.71,*CHS,1429,0,0,0,,今晚你最终会出现在那个墓地里 因为那是你注定的
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.89,2:14:46.19,*CHS,1430,0,0,0,,现在终于大功告成了
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.86,2:14:52.19,*CHS,1431,0,0,0,,在这些血管里流过的血 是黑暗魔头的血
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.71,2:15:04.20,*CHS,1432,0,0,0,,想象一下他会怎么好好地奖赏我 当他得知...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.14,2:15:07.63,*CHS,1433,0,0,0,,...我将会一劳永逸地...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.25,2:15:12.58,*CHS,1434,0,0,0,,...消灭了伟大的哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.75,2:15:14.01,*CHS,1435,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.72,2:15:19.99,*CHS,1436,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.46,2:15:23.95,*CHS,1437,0,0,0,,就是这个，喝下去
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.93,2:15:29.39,*CHS,1438,0,0,0,,- 你知道我是谁么？ - 阿不思·邓不利多
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.57,2:15:32.26,*CHS,1439,0,0,0,,- 你是不是阿拉斯托·穆迪，是不是？ - 不
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.44,2:15:35.53,*CHS,1440,0,0,0,,他在不在这个屋子里面？
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.58,2:15:40.10,*CHS,1441,0,0,0,,哈利，到一边去！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:01.10,2:16:04.43,*CHS,1442,0,0,0,,- 你还好么，阿拉斯托？ - 我很抱歉，阿不思
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.40,2:16:07.46,*CHS,1443,0,0,0,,他是穆迪，那么另一个是？
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.27,2:16:10.37,*CHS,1444,0,0,0,,变身水
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.54,2:16:13.77,*CHS,1445,0,0,0,,现在我们知道是谁 偷了你储藏的药剂了，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.01,2:16:15.95,*CHS,1446,0,0,0,,我们马上就把你弄出来
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.38,2:16:51.78,*CHS,1447,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.45,2:16:57.65,*CHS,1448,0,0,0,,小巴蒂·克劳奇
Dialogue: 0,2:16:57.89,2:17:00.82,*CHS,1449,0,0,0,,如果你展现给我看 我也展现给你看
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.19,2:17:04.39,*CHS,1450,0,0,0,,伸出你的手臂，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.77,2:17:11.00,*CHS,1451,0,0,0,,你应该知道这意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.90,2:17:13.23,*CHS,1452,0,0,0,,他复活了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.44,2:17:16.57,*CHS,1453,0,0,0,,伏地魔卷土重来了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.51,2:17:19.84,*CHS,1454,0,0,0,,对不起，老师，我没能够阻止
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.04,2:17:24.57,*CHS,1455,0,0,0,,让猫头鹰给阿兹卡班送信 告诉他们逃脱了一个犯人
Dialogue: 0,2:17:25.05,2:17:27.54,*CHS,1456,0,0,0,,- 我将会受到英雄般的礼遇 - 也许吧
Dialogue: 0,2:17:28.12,2:17:30.99,*CHS,1457,0,0,0,,不过我个人对英雄不怎么感冒
Dialogue: 0,2:17:50.88,2:17:53.54,*CHS,1458,0,0,0,,今天，我们蒙受了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:54.25,2:17:57.01,*CHS,1459,0,0,0,,一个无比巨大的损失
Dialogue: 0,2:17:59.12,2:18:01.88,*CHS,1460,0,0,0,,你们都认识的塞德里克·迪戈里
Dialogue: 0,2:18:02.05,2:18:04.39,*CHS,1461,0,0,0,,生前极其勤奋刻苦
Dialogue: 0,2:18:05.29,2:18:07.66,*CHS,1462,0,0,0,,公正善良
Dialogue: 0,2:18:08.23,2:18:10.52,*CHS,1463,0,0,0,,最重要的是
Dialogue: 0,2:18:10.83,2:18:15.39,*CHS,1464,0,0,0,,他是一个很热心的朋友
Dialogue: 0,2:18:16.53,2:18:20.90,*CHS,1465,0,0,0,,我想你们有权知道他是怎么死的
Dialogue: 0,2:18:23.94,2:18:25.47,*CHS,1466,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,2:18:26.31,2:18:28.40,*CHS,1467,0,0,0,,塞德里克·迪戈里是被
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.31,2:18:31.30,*CHS,1468,0,0,0,,魔头伏地魔杀害的
Dialogue: 0,2:18:33.22,2:18:36.78,*CHS,1469,0,0,0,,魔法部不希望我告诉你们真相
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.42,2:18:41.12,*CHS,1470,0,0,0,,不过如果我不告诉你们 我会觉得那是对他的一种侮辱
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.29,2:18:44.96,*CHS,1471,0,0,0,,这种悲痛...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:45.13,2:18:48.79,*CHS,1472,0,0,0,,如今我们所共同感受到的 提醒了我
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.97,2:18:50.30,*CHS,1473,0,0,0,,提醒了大家
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.47,2:18:54.17,*CHS,1474,0,0,0,,为什么尽管我们来自不同地方 操着不同的口音
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.34,2:18:57.77,*CHS,1475,0,0,0,,但是我们仍然万众一心
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.28,2:19:00.30,*CHS,1476,0,0,0,,经过最近发生的事
Dialogue: 0,2:19:00.65,2:19:05.58,*CHS,1477,0,0,0,,这个学期我们所建立起来的友谊 将比任何时候都重要
Dialogue: 0,2:19:06.45,2:19:11.79,*CHS,1478,0,0,0,,好好记住了 塞德里克·迪戈里不会白白牺牲的
Dialogue: 0,2:19:12.22,2:19:14.35,*CHS,1479,0,0,0,,你们都好好记住了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:14.96,2:19:17.99,*CHS,1480,0,0,0,,我们要纪念这个男孩
Dialogue: 0,2:19:18.53,2:19:21.00,*CHS,1481,0,0,0,,一个善良的、诚实的
Dialogue: 0,2:19:21.50,2:19:26.10,*CHS,1482,0,0,0,,勇敢的、真诚的男孩 直至他生命的终点
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.33,2:19:53.35,*CHS,1483,0,0,0,,我从来就不喜欢这些窗帘
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.96,2:19:56.63,*CHS,1484,0,0,0,,四年级的时候，我曾经放火烧了它们
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.97,2:19:58.80,*CHS,1485,0,0,0,,当然那是个意外啦
Dialogue: 0,2:20:04.48,2:20:08.84,*CHS,1486,0,0,0,,很抱歉，今年我把你置于 很危险的处境里，哈利
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.25,2:20:13.94,*CHS,1487,0,0,0,,教授...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:14.15,2:20:17.14,*CHS,1488,0,0,0,,...当我在墓地的时候 有一个时刻...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.96,2:20:22.36,*CHS,1489,0,0,0,,...伏地魔的魔杖和我的 在某种程度上连接在一起的时候
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.93,2:20:26.26,*CHS,1490,0,0,0,,闪回咒
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.40,2:20:33.13,*CHS,1491,0,0,0,,那晚你看到了你的父母，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.70,2:20:35.54,*CHS,1492,0,0,0,,他们又出现了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.01,2:20:40.77,*CHS,1493,0,0,0,,没有能够起死回生的魔咒的 你应该知道这点
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.35,2:20:45.94,*CHS,1494,0,0,0,,黑暗和困难笼罩着前行的道路
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.42,2:20:51.25,*CHS,1495,0,0,0,,很快我们就要在正确的 和轻松的之间进行选择
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.63,2:20:56.29,*CHS,1496,0,0,0,,不过记住
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.46,2:20:58.39,*CHS,1497,0,0,0,,在这里，你有许多朋友
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.40,2:21:02.16,*CHS,1498,0,0,0,,你并不是一个人
Dialogue: 0,2:21:22.85,2:21:24.58,*CHS,1499,0,0,0,,赫敏
Dialogue: 0,2:21:24.99,2:21:26.98,*CHS,1500,0,0,0,,这是给你的
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.59,2:21:29.79,*CHS,1501,0,0,0,,写信给我，答应我
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.90,2:21:32.29,*CHS,1502,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,2:21:38.54,2:21:40.47,*CHS,1503,0,0,0,,谢谢你，罗恩
Dialogue: 0,2:22:24.42,2:22:26.94,*CHS,1504,0,0,0,,我们就不能在霍格沃茨 普普通通过一年吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:27.12,2:22:28.24,*CHS,1505,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.42,2:22:32.79,*CHS,1506,0,0,0,,当我没说 如果生活中没有龙会怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.19,2:22:40.03,*CHS,1507,0,0,0,,一切都要从现在开始改变了，是么？
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.34,2:22:48.81,*CHS,1508,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,2:22:53.54,2:22:56.84,*CHS,1509,0,0,0,,向我保证，这个夏天会给我写信 你们两个都要
Dialogue: 0,2:22:57.01,2:22:59.57,*CHS,1510,0,0,0,,我不会的，你知道我不会的
Dialogue: 0,2:23:00.85,2:23:04.62,*CHS,1511,0,0,0,,- 哈利，你会写的，是吧？ - 没错，每周都写
